Word: 啊, Pinyin: ā, Meaning: interjection of surprise; Ah!; Oh!, Example: 啊，是你！, Translation: Ah, it's you!

Word: 哎, Pinyin: āi, Meaning: hey!; (interjection used to attract attention or to express surprise or disapprobation), Example: 哎，你来了。, Translation: Hey, you're here.

Word: 唉, Pinyin: āi, Meaning: interjection or grunt of agreement or recognition (e.g. yes, it's me!); to sigh, Example: 唉，是我。, Translation: Ah, it's me.

Word: 矮, Pinyin: ǎi, Meaning: low; short (in length), Example: 他个子很矮。, Translation: He is very short.

Word: 爱, Pinyin: ài, Meaning: to love; to be fond of; to like; affection; to be inclined (to do sth); to tend to (happen), Example: 我爱吃苹果。, Translation: I like apples.

Word: 爱情, Pinyin: ài qíng, Meaning: romance; love (romantic), Example: 你相信爱情吗？, Translation: Do you believe in love?

Word: 安, Pinyin: Ān, Meaning: surname An, Example: 我姓安。, Translation: My surname is An.

Word: 安静, Pinyin: ān jìng, Meaning: quiet; peaceful; calm, Example: 这里很安静。, Translation: It's very quiet here.

Word: 安排, Pinyin: ān pái, Meaning: to arrange; to plan; to set up; arrangements; plans, Example: 我来安排时间。, Translation: I'll arrange the schedule.

Word: 安全, Pinyin: ān quán, Meaning: safe; secure; safety; security, Example: 注意安全。, Translation: Stay safe.

Word: 安慰, Pinyin: ān wèi, Meaning: to comfort; to console, Example: 请安慰我。, Translation: Please comfort me.

Word: 安装, Pinyin: ān zhuāng, Meaning: to install; to erect; to fix; to mount; installation, Example: 请安装这个软件。, Translation: Please install this software.

Word: 按, Pinyin: àn, Meaning: to press; to push; to leave aside or shelve; to control; to restrain; to keep one's hand on; to check or refer to; according to; in the light of; (of an editor or author) to make a comment, Example: 请按按钮。, Translation: Please press the button.

Word: 按摩, Pinyin: àn mó, Meaning: massage; to massage, Example: 我们去按摩吧。, Translation: Let's go get a massage.

Word: 按照, Pinyin: àn zhào, Meaning: according to; in accordance with; in the light of; on the basis of, Example: 按照你说的做。, Translation: Do as you said.

Word: 案件, Pinyin: àn jiàn, Meaning: case; instance, Example: 这个案件很简单。, Translation: This case is very simple.

Word: 暗, Pinyin: àn, Meaning: variant of 暗, Example: 天暗了，回家吧。, Translation: It's getting dark, let's go home.

Word: 八, Pinyin: bā, Meaning: eight; 8, Example: 我有八个苹果。, Translation: I have eight apples.

Word: 拔, Pinyin: bá, Meaning: to pull up; to pull out; to draw out by suction; to select; to pick; to stand out (above level); to surpass; to seize, Example: 我去拔牙。, Translation: I am going to pull out a tooth.

Word: 把, Pinyin: bǎ, Meaning: to hold; to grasp; to hold a baby in position to help it urinate or defecate; handlebar; classifier: handful, bundle, bunch; classifier for things with handles; (used to put the object before the verb: 把 + {noun} + {verb}), Example: 把门关上。, Translation: Close the door.

Word: 把握, Pinyin: bǎ wò, Meaning: to grasp (also fig.); to seize; to hold; assurance; certainty; sure (of the outcome), Example: 我有把握。, Translation: I'm sure.

Word: 爸, Pinyin: bà, Meaning: father; dad; pa; papa, Example: 爸，我回来了。, Translation: Dad, I'm back.

Word: 爸爸, Pinyin: bà ba, Meaning: (coll.) father; dad, Example: 爸爸在家吗？, Translation: Is dad at home?

Word: 吧, Pinyin: bā, Meaning: bar (loanword) (serving drinks, or providing Internet access etc); to puff (on a pipe etc); (onom.) bang; abbr. for 贴吧, Example: 我在酒吧等你。, Translation: I am waiting for you at the bar.

Word: 罢了, Pinyin: bà le, Meaning: a modal particle indicating (that's all, only, nothing much), Example: 普通朋友罢了。, Translation: Just ordinary friends.

Word: 白, Pinyin: Bái, Meaning: surname Bai, Example: 我朋友姓白。, Translation: My friend's surname is Bai.

Word: 白色, Pinyin: bái sè, Meaning: white; fig. reactionary; anti-communist, Example: 我喜欢白色。, Translation: I like white.

Word: 白天, Pinyin: bái tiān, Meaning: daytime; during the day; day, Example: 白天我上班。, Translation: I work during the day.

Word: 百, Pinyin: Bǎi, Meaning: surname Bai, Example: 我姓百。, Translation: My surname is Bai.

Word: 摆, Pinyin: bǎi, Meaning: to arrange; to exhibit; to move to and fro; a pendulum, Example: 把书摆在桌上。, Translation: Put the book on the table.

Word: 摆脱, Pinyin: bǎi tuō, Meaning: to break away from; to cast off (old ideas etc); to get rid of; to break away (from); to break out (of); to free oneself from; to extricate oneself, Example: 我想摆脱烦恼。, Translation: I want to get rid of my worries.

Word: 班, Pinyin: Bān, Meaning: surname Ban, Example: 我姓班。, Translation: My surname is Ban.

Word: 搬, Pinyin: bān, Meaning: to move (i.e. relocate oneself); to move (sth relatively heavy or bulky); to shift; to copy indiscriminately, Example: 我明天搬家。, Translation: I'm moving tomorrow.

Word: 板, Pinyin: bǎn, Meaning: board; plank; plate; shutter; table tennis bat; clappers (music); accented beat in Chinese music; hard; stiff; to stop smiling or look serious, Example: 买块木板吧。, Translation: Let's buy a wooden board.

Word: 版, Pinyin: bǎn, Meaning: a register; block of printing; edition; version; page, Example: 这是最新版吗？, Translation: Is this the latest version?

Word: 办, Pinyin: bàn, Meaning: to do; to manage; to handle; to go about; to run; to set up; to deal with, Example: 我来办。, Translation: I'll handle it.

Word: 办法, Pinyin: bàn fǎ, Meaning: means; method; way (of doing sth), Example: 别担心，有办法。, Translation: Don't worry, there's a way.

Word: 办公室, Pinyin: bàn gōng shì, Meaning: office; business premises; bureau, Example: 他在办公室吗？, Translation: Is he in the office?

Word: 半, Pinyin: bàn, Meaning: half; semi-; incomplete; (after a number) and a half, Example: 我喝了半杯水。, Translation: I drank half a cup of water.

Word: 半场, Pinyin: bàn chǎng, Meaning: half of a game or contest; half-court, Example: 上半场结束了。, Translation: The first half is over.

Word: 伴, Pinyin: bàn, Meaning: partner; companion; comrade; associate; to accompany, Example: 路上有个伴真好。, Translation: It's great to have a companion.

Word: 扮演, Pinyin: bàn yǎn, Meaning: to play the role of; to act, Example: 他喜欢扮演超人。, Translation: He likes to play the role of Superman.

Word: 帮, Pinyin: bāng, Meaning: old variant of 帮, Example: 请帮帮我。, Translation: Please help me.

Word: 帮忙, Pinyin: bāng máng, Meaning: to help; to lend a hand; to do a favor; to do a good turn, Example: 你能帮忙吗？, Translation: Can you help?

Word: 帮助, Pinyin: bāng zhù, Meaning: assistance; aid; to help; to assist, Example: 谢谢你的帮助。, Translation: Thank you for your help.

Word: 绑架, Pinyin: bǎng jià, Meaning: to kidnap; to abduct; to hijack; a kidnapping; abduction; staking, Example: 别绑架小孩。, Translation: Don't kidnap children.

Word: 棒, Pinyin: bàng, Meaning: stick; club; cudgel; smart; capable; strong; wonderful; classifier for legs of a relay race, Example: 你做得真棒！, Translation: You did great!

Word: 包, Pinyin: Bāo, Meaning: surname Bao, Example: 包老师来了。, Translation: Teacher Bao is here.

Word: 包括, Pinyin: bāo kuò, Meaning: to comprise; to include; to involve; to incorporate; to consist of, Example: 价格包括午餐。, Translation: The price includes lunch.

Word: 宝, Pinyin: bǎo, Meaning: variant of 宝, Example: 這是我的宝。, Translation: This is my treasure.

Word: 宝宝, Pinyin: bǎo bao, Meaning: darling; baby, Example: 宝宝真可爱。, Translation: Baby is so cute.

Word: 宝贝, Pinyin: bǎo bèi, Meaning: treasured object; treasure; darling; baby; cowry; good-for-nothing or queer character, Example: 你是我的宝贝。, Translation: You are my darling.

Word: 保, Pinyin: Bǎo, Meaning: Bulgaria; Bulgarian; abbr. for 保加利亚, Example: 请保重身体。, Translation: Please take care of yourself.

Word: 保安, Pinyin: bǎo ān, Meaning: to ensure public security; to ensure safety (for workers engaged in production); public security; security guard, Example: 我是保安。, Translation: I am a security guard.

Word: 保持, Pinyin: bǎo chí, Meaning: to keep; to maintain; to hold; to preserve, Example: 请保持安静。, Translation: Please keep quiet.

Word: 保存, Pinyin: bǎo cún, Meaning: to conserve; to preserve; to keep; to save (a file etc) (computing), Example: 请保存文件。, Translation: Please save the file.

Word: 保护, Pinyin: bǎo hù, Meaning: to protect; to defend; to safeguard; protection, Example: 我们要保护动物。, Translation: We should protect animals.

Word: 保留, Pinyin: bǎo liú, Meaning: to keep; to retain; to have reservations (about sth); to hold back (from saying sth); to put aside for later, Example: 请保留这张票。, Translation: Please keep this ticket.

Word: 保险, Pinyin: bǎo xiǎn, Meaning: insurance; to insure; safe; secure; be sure; be bound to, Example: 这样比较保险。, Translation: This is safer.

Word: 保障, Pinyin: bǎo zhàng, Meaning: to ensure; to guarantee; to safeguard, Example: 这能保障你的安全。, Translation: This ensures your safety.

Word: 保证, Pinyin: bǎo zhèng, Meaning: guarantee; to guarantee; to ensure; to safeguard; to pledge, Example: 我保证准时到。, Translation: I promise to arrive on time.

Word: 报, Pinyin: bào, Meaning: to announce; to inform; report; newspaper; recompense; revenge, Example: 他报了警。, Translation: He called the police.

Word: 报道, Pinyin: bào dào, Meaning: to report (news); report, Example: 电视正在报道比赛。, Translation: The TV is reporting on the match.

Word: 报告, Pinyin: bào gào, Meaning: to inform; to report; to make known; report; speech; talk; lecture, Example: 我报告一下进度。, Translation: I'll give a quick progress report.

Word: 报警, Pinyin: bào jǐng, Meaning: to sound an alarm; to report sth to the police, Example: 我马上报警。, Translation: I will call the police right away.

Word: 报纸, Pinyin: bào zhǐ, Meaning: newspaper; newsprint, Example: 他在看报纸。, Translation: He is reading the newspaper.

Word: 抱, Pinyin: bào, Meaning: to hold; to carry (in one's arms); to hug; to embrace; to surround; to cherish; (coll.) (of clothes) to fit nicely, Example: 妈妈抱我。, Translation: Mom hugs me.

Word: 抱怨, Pinyin: bào yuàn, Meaning: to complain; to grumble; to harbor a complaint; to feel dissatisfied, Example: 别抱怨了。, Translation: Stop complaining.

Word: 暴力, Pinyin: bào lì, Meaning: violence; force; violent, Example: 别用暴力！, Translation: Don't use violence!

Word: 暴露, Pinyin: bào lù, Meaning: to expose; to reveal; to lay bare; also pr. [pù lù], Example: 别暴露你的计划。, Translation: Don't expose your plan.

Word: 爆, Pinyin: bào, Meaning: to explode or burst; to quick fry or quick boil, Example: 气球爆了。, Translation: The balloon popped.

Word: 爆发, Pinyin: bào fā, Meaning: to break out; to erupt; to explode; to burst out, Example: 火山突然爆发。, Translation: The volcano suddenly erupted.

Word: 爆炸, Pinyin: bào zhà, Meaning: explosion; to explode; to blow up; to detonate, Example: 煤气爆炸了。, Translation: The gas exploded.

Word: 杯, Pinyin: bēi, Meaning: cup; trophy cup; classifier for certain containers of liquids: glass, cup, Example: 我要一杯水。, Translation: I want a cup of water.

Word: 悲剧, Pinyin: bēi jù, Meaning: tragedy, Example: 结局是个悲剧。, Translation: The ending is a tragedy.

Word: 悲伤, Pinyin: bēi shāng, Meaning: sad; sorrowful, Example: 他看起来很悲伤。, Translation: He looks very sad.

Word: 北, Pinyin: běi, Meaning: north; (classical) to be defeated, Example: 他往北走。, Translation: He walks north.

Word: 背, Pinyin: bēi, Meaning: variant of 背, Example: 妈妈背我去学校。, Translation: Mom carries me to school on her back.

Word: 背后, Pinyin: bèi hòu, Meaning: behind; at the back; in the rear; behind sb's back, Example: 我站你背后。, Translation: I'll stand behind you.

Word: 背景, Pinyin: bèi jǐng, Meaning: background; backdrop; context; (fig.) powerful backer, Example: 他的背景很普通。, Translation: His background is very ordinary.

Word: 倍, Pinyin: bèi, Meaning: (two, three etc) -fold; times (multiplier); double; to increase or multiply, Example: 价格翻了一倍。, Translation: The price doubled.

Word: 被, Pinyin: bèi, Meaning: quilt; to cover (with); (literary) to suffer (a misfortune); used to indicate passive voice (placed before the doer of the action like "by" in English passive-voice sentences, or, if the doer is not mentioned, before the verb); (since c. 2009) (sarcastic or jocular) used to indicate that the following word should be regarded as being in air quotes (as in 被旅游 to "go on a trip", for example), Example: 我的包被偷了。, Translation: My bag was stolen.

Word: 被告, Pinyin: bèi gào, Meaning: defendant, Example: 被告今天出庭了。, Translation: The defendant appeared in court today.

Word: 本, Pinyin: běn, Meaning: root; stem; origin; source; this; the current; original; inherent; originally; classifier for books, periodicals, files etc, Example: 我买了一本书。, Translation: I bought a book.

Word: 本地, Pinyin: běn dì, Meaning: local; this locality, Example: 这是本地的菜。, Translation: This is local food.

Word: 本来, Pinyin: běn lái, Meaning: original; originally; at first; it goes without saying; of course, Example: 我本来想去。, Translation: I originally wanted to go.

Word: 本人, Pinyin: běn rén, Meaning: I; me; myself; oneself; yourself; himself; herself; the person concerned, Example: 本人就是。, Translation: That's me.

Word: 本身, Pinyin: běn shēn, Meaning: itself; in itself; per se, Example: 这问题本身不难。, Translation: The problem itself isn't hard.

Word: 笨, Pinyin: bèn, Meaning: stupid; foolish; silly; slow-witted; clumsy, Example: 我太笨了。, Translation: I'm so stupid.

Word: 逼, Pinyin: bī, Meaning: variant of 逼; to compel; to pressure, Example: 别逼我。, Translation: Don't force me.

Word: 鼻子, Pinyin: bí zi, Meaning: nose, Example: 我鼻子疼。, Translation: My nose hurts.

Word: 比, Pinyin: Bǐ, Meaning: Belgium; Belgian; abbr. for 比利时, Example: 我去过比。, Translation: I have been to Belgium.

Word: 比较, Pinyin: bǐ jiào, Meaning: to compare; to contrast; comparatively; relatively; quite; comparison, Example: 今天比较冷。, Translation: It's quite cold today.

Word: 比如, Pinyin: bǐ rú, Meaning: for example; for instance; such as, Example: 我喜欢水果，比如苹果。, Translation: I like fruit, for example apples.

Word: 比如说, Pinyin: bǐ rú shuō, Meaning: for example, Example: 比如说，我喜欢喝茶。, Translation: For example, I like drinking tea.

Word: 比赛, Pinyin: bǐ sài, Meaning: competition (sports etc); match; to compete, Example: 我们去看比赛吧。, Translation: Let's go watch the match.

Word: 彼此, Pinyin: bǐ cǐ, Meaning: each other; one another, Example: 我们彼此信任。, Translation: We trust each other.

Word: 笔, Pinyin: bǐ, Meaning: pen; pencil; writing brush; to write or compose; the strokes of Chinese characters; classifier for sums of money, deals, Example: 请给我一支笔。, Translation: Please give me a pen.

Word: 笔记本, Pinyin: bǐ jì běn, Meaning: notebook (stationery); notebook (computing), Example: 我买了一个新笔记本。, Translation: I bought a new notebook.

Word: 必, Pinyin: bì, Meaning: certainly; must; will; necessarily, Example: 他必会来。, Translation: He will certainly come.

Word: 必须, Pinyin: bì xū, Meaning: to have to; must; compulsory; necessarily, Example: 你必须去。, Translation: You must go.

Word: 必要, Pinyin: bì yào, Meaning: necessary; essential; indispensable; required, Example: 这是必要的。, Translation: This is necessary.

Word: 毕竟, Pinyin: bì jìng, Meaning: after all; all in all; when all is said and done; in the final analysis, Example: 他毕竟是个孩子。, Translation: After all, he is a child.

Word: 毕业, Pinyin: bì yè, Meaning: graduation; to graduate; to finish school, Example: 我明年毕业。, Translation: I will graduate next year.

Word: 闭, Pinyin: bì, Meaning: to close; to stop up; to shut; to obstruct, Example: 请闭上眼睛。, Translation: Please close your eyes.

Word: 避免, Pinyin: bì miǎn, Meaning: to avert; to prevent; to avoid; to refrain from, Example: 避免迟到。, Translation: Avoid being late.

Word: 边, Pinyin: biān, Meaning: side; edge; margin; border; boundary; simultaneously, Example: 我们坐这边。, Translation: Let's sit on this side.

Word: 编, Pinyin: biān, Meaning: to weave; to plait; to organize; to group; to arrange; to edit; to compile; to write; to compose; to fabricate; to make up, Example: 妈妈编辫子。, Translation: Mom braids her hair.

Word: 编辑, Pinyin: biān jí, Meaning: to edit; to compile; editor; compiler, Example: 他是一名编辑。, Translation: He is an editor.

Word: 变, Pinyin: biàn, Meaning: to change; to become different; to transform; to vary; rebellion, Example: 天气变了。, Translation: The weather has changed.

Word: 变成, Pinyin: biàn chéng, Meaning: to change into; to turn into; to become, Example: 水变成冰了。, Translation: Water turned into ice.

Word: 变化, Pinyin: biàn huà, Meaning: (intransitive) to change; to vary; change; variation, Example: 天气变化很大。, Translation: The weather changes a lot.

Word: 便, Pinyin: biàn, Meaning: plain; informal; suitable; convenient; opportune; to urinate or defecate; equivalent to 就: then; in that case; even if; soon afterwards, Example: 那便好。, Translation: Then it's fine.

Word: 便宜, Pinyin: biàn yí, Meaning: convenient, Example: 这件衣服很便宜。, Translation: This shirt is very cheap.

Word: 遍, Pinyin: biàn, Meaning: variant of 遍, Example: 请再说一遍。, Translation: Please say it again.

Word: 标, Pinyin: biāo, Meaning: mark; sign; label; to mark with a symbol, label, lettering etc; to bear (a brand name, registration number etc); prize; award; bid; target; quota; (old) the topmost branches of a tree; visible symptom; classifier for military units, Example: 请标上价格。, Translation: Please mark the price.

Word: 标志, Pinyin: biāo zhì, Meaning: sign; mark; symbol; logo; to symbolize; to indicate; to mark, Example: 这是公司的标志。, Translation: This is the company's logo.

Word: 标准, Pinyin: biāo zhǔn, Meaning: standard; norm; criterion; (adjective) standard; good; correct; conforming to a standard, Example: 你的发音很标准。, Translation: Your pronunciation is very standard.

Word: 表, Pinyin: biǎo, Meaning: exterior surface; family relationship via females; to show (one's opinion); a model; a table (listing information); a form; a meter (measuring sth), Example: 请填这张表。, Translation: Please fill out this form.

Word: 表达, Pinyin: biǎo dá, Meaning: to express; to convey, Example: 我想表达我的想法。, Translation: I want to express my thoughts.

Word: 表面, Pinyin: biǎo miàn, Meaning: surface; face; outside; appearance, Example: 表面很光滑。, Translation: The surface is very smooth.

Word: 表明, Pinyin: biǎo míng, Meaning: to make clear; to make known; to state clearly; to indicate; known, Example: 事实表明我错了。, Translation: Facts show I was wrong.

Word: 表情, Pinyin: biǎo qíng, Meaning: (facial) expression; to express one's feelings, Example: 你的表情真可爱！, Translation: Your expression is really cute!

Word: 表示, Pinyin: biǎo shì, Meaning: to express; to show; to say; to state; to indicate; to mean, Example: 我表示完全同意。, Translation: I completely agree.

Word: 表现, Pinyin: biǎo xiàn, Meaning: to show; to show off; to display; to manifest; expression; manifestation; show; display; performance (at work etc); behavior, Example: 他今天表现很好。, Translation: He performed well today.

Word: 表演, Pinyin: biǎo yǎn, Meaning: play; show; performance; exhibition; to perform; to act; to demonstrate, Example: 今晚有表演吗？, Translation: Is there a performance tonight?

Word: 别, Pinyin: Bié, Meaning: surname Bie, Example: 别担心。, Translation: Don't worry.

Word: 别的, Pinyin: bié de, Meaning: else; other, Example: 你想吃别的吗？, Translation: Do you want to eat something else?

Word: 别人, Pinyin: bié ren, Meaning: other people; others; other person, Example: 我不像别人。, Translation: I am not like others.

Word: 冰, Pinyin: bīng, Meaning: ice; to chill sth; (of an object or substance) to feel cold; (of a person) cold; unfriendly; (slang) methamphetamine, Example: 我想喝冰水。, Translation: I want to drink iced water.

Word: 兵, Pinyin: bīng, Meaning: soldiers; a force; an army; weapons; arms; military; warlike, Example: 他是当兵的。, Translation: He is a soldier.

Word: 饼, Pinyin: bǐng, Meaning: round flat cake; cookie; cake; pastry, Example: 这饼真好吃。, Translation: This cake is really delicious.

Word: 并, Pinyin: bìng, Meaning: and; furthermore; also; together with; (not) at all; simultaneously; to combine; to join; to merge, Example: 我并不累。, Translation: I am not tired at all.

Word: 并非, Pinyin: bìng fēi, Meaning: really isn't, Example: 这并非事实, Translation: This isn't really true.

Word: 并且, Pinyin: bìng qiě, Meaning: and; besides; moreover; furthermore; in addition, Example: 我喜欢跑步并且游泳。, Translation: I like running and swimming.

Word: 病, Pinyin: bìng, Meaning: illness; disease; to fall ill; defect, Example: 我生病了。, Translation: I am sick.

Word: 病毒, Pinyin: bìng dú, Meaning: virus, Example: 电脑有病毒。, Translation: The computer has a virus.

Word: 病人, Pinyin: bìng rén, Meaning: sick person; patient; invalid, Example: 病人需要休息。, Translation: The patient needs rest.

Word: 拨, Pinyin: bō, Meaning: to push aside with the hand, foot, a stick etc; to dial; to allocate; to set aside (money); to poke (the fire); to pluck (a string instrument); to turn round; classifier: group, batch, Example: 我拨个电话。, Translation: I'll dial a number.

Word: 玻璃, Pinyin: bō li, Meaning: glass; (slang) male homosexual, Example: 小心玻璃。, Translation: Be careful of the glass.

Word: 播, Pinyin: bō, Meaning: to sow; to scatter; to spread; to broadcast; Taiwan pr. [bò], Example: 电视正在播新闻。, Translation: The TV is broadcasting the news.

Word: 播放, Pinyin: bō fàng, Meaning: to broadcast; to transmit (by radio or TV), Example: 电视正在播放新闻。, Translation: The TV is broadcasting the news.

Word: 脖子, Pinyin: bó zi, Meaning: neck, Example: 我脖子疼。, Translation: My neck hurts.

Word: 博士, Pinyin: bó shì, Meaning: doctor; court academician (in feudal China); Ph.D., Example: 他是博士。, Translation: He has a Ph.D.

Word: 补, Pinyin: bǔ, Meaning: to repair; to patch; to mend; to make up for; to fill (a vacancy); to supplement, Example: 我明天去补课。, Translation: I will make up the class tomorrow.

Word: 补偿, Pinyin: bǔ cháng, Meaning: to compensate; to make up, Example: 我会用钱补偿你。, Translation: I will compensate you.

Word: 不, Pinyin: bù, Meaning: no; not so; (bound form) not; un-, Example: 我不去。, Translation: I am not going.

Word: 不必, Pinyin: bù bì, Meaning: need not; does not have to; not necessarily, Example: 你不必来。, Translation: You don't have to come.

Word: 不错, Pinyin: bù cuò, Meaning: correct; right; not bad; pretty good, Example: 你的中文不错。, Translation: Your Chinese is pretty good.

Word: 不得不, Pinyin: bù dé bù, Meaning: have no choice or option but to; cannot but; have to; can't help it; can't avoid, Example: 我不得不去。, Translation: I have to go.

Word: 不断, Pinyin: bù duàn, Meaning: unceasing; uninterrupted; continuous; constant, Example: 他不断学习中文。, Translation: He keeps learning Chinese.

Word: 不对, Pinyin: bù duì, Meaning: incorrect; wrong; amiss; abnormal; queer, Example: 你说得不对。, Translation: What you said is wrong.

Word: 不够, Pinyin: bù gòu, Meaning: not enough; insufficient; inadequate, Example: 钱不够。, Translation: Not enough money.

Word: 不管, Pinyin: bù guǎn, Meaning: not to be concerned; regardless of; no matter, Example: 不管多忙，我陪你。, Translation: No matter how busy, I will stay with you.

Word: 不过, Pinyin: bù guò, Meaning: only; merely; no more than; but; however; anyway (to get back to a previous topic); cannot be more (after adjectival), Example: 不过今天不行。, Translation: But today doesn't work.

Word: 不好意思, Pinyin: bù hǎo yì si, Meaning: to feel embarrassed; to find it embarrassing; to be sorry (for inconveniencing sb), Example: 不好意思，打扰了。, Translation: Sorry to bother you.

Word: 不见, Pinyin: bù jiàn, Meaning: not to see; not to meet; to have disappeared; to be missing, Example: 好久不见！, Translation: Long time no see!

Word: 不仅, Pinyin: bù jǐn, Meaning: not just; not limited to; (as a correlative conjunction) not only (..., but also ...), Example: 她不仅会唱，还会跳。, Translation: She can not only sing, but also dance.

Word: 不久, Pinyin: bù jiǔ, Meaning: not long (after); before too long; soon; soon after, Example: 我不久就回来。, Translation: I'll be back soon.

Word: 不论, Pinyin: bù lùn, Meaning: whatever; no matter what (who, how etc); regardless of; not to discuss, Example: 不论何时，我都在。, Translation: No matter when, I'm here.

Word: 不然, Pinyin: bù rán, Meaning: not so; no; or else; otherwise; if not; How about ...?, Example: 快点走，不然要迟到了。, Translation: Hurry up, or else we'll be late.

Word: 不如, Pinyin: bù rú, Meaning: not equal to; not as good as; inferior to; it would be better to, Example: 下雨不如在家休息。, Translation: It would be better to rest at home when it rains.

Word: 不少, Pinyin: bù shǎo, Meaning: many; a lot; not few, Example: 今天来了不少人。, Translation: Many people came today.

Word: 不同, Pinyin: bù tóng, Meaning: different; distinct; not the same; not alike, Example: 我们想法不同。, Translation: Our ideas are different.

Word: 不行, Pinyin: bù xíng, Meaning: won't do; be out of the question; be no good; not work; not be capable, Example: 这个办法不行。, Translation: This method won't work.

Word: 不幸, Pinyin: bù xìng, Meaning: misfortune; adversity; unfortunate; sad; unfortunately, Example: 不幸的是，他病了。, Translation: Unfortunately, he is sick.

Word: 不许, Pinyin: bù xǔ, Meaning: not to allow; must not; can't, Example: 这里不许拍照。, Translation: No photos allowed here.

Word: 不要, Pinyin: bù yào, Meaning: don't!; must not, Example: 不要说话。, Translation: Don't talk.

Word: 不一定, Pinyin: bù yī dìng, Meaning: not necessarily; maybe, Example: 明天不一定下雨。, Translation: It might not rain tomorrow.

Word: 不用, Pinyin: bù yòng, Meaning: need not, Example: 你不用来了。, Translation: You don't need to come.

Word: 不再, Pinyin: bù zài, Meaning: no more; no longer, Example: 我不再抽烟了。, Translation: I don't smoke anymore.

Word: 不知, Pinyin: bù zhī, Meaning: not to know; unaware; unknowingly; fig. not to admit (defeat, hardships, tiredness etc), Example: 我不知真假。, Translation: I don't know if it's true or false.

Word: 不止, Pinyin: bù zhǐ, Meaning: incessantly; without end; more than; not limited to, Example: 不止一次了。, Translation: More than once.

Word: 不准, Pinyin: bù zhǔn, Meaning: not to allow; to forbid; to prohibit, Example: 这里不准拍照。, Translation: No photos allowed here.

Word: 不足, Pinyin: bù zú, Meaning: insufficient; lacking; deficiency; not enough; inadequate; not worth; cannot; should not, Example: 时间不足，改天吧。, Translation: Not enough time, let's do it another day.

Word: 布, Pinyin: bù, Meaning: variant of 布; to announce; to spread, Example: 消息已公布。, Translation: The news has been announced.

Word: 步, Pinyin: Bù, Meaning: surname Bu, Example: 步老师来了。, Translation: Teacher Bu is here.

Word: 部, Pinyin: bù, Meaning: ministry; department; section; part; division; troops; board; classifier for works of literature, films, machines etc, Example: 我买了一部新手机。, Translation: I bought a new phone.

Word: 部队, Pinyin: bù duì, Meaning: army; armed forces; troops; force; unit, Example: 我爸爸在部队。, Translation: My dad is in the army.

Word: 部分, Pinyin: bù fen, Meaning: part; share; section; piece, Example: 这部分很简单。, Translation: This part is very simple.

Word: 部门, Pinyin: bù mén, Meaning: department; branch; section; division, Example: 你在哪个部门？, Translation: Which department are you in?

Word: 部长, Pinyin: bù zhǎng, Meaning: head of a (government etc) department; section chief; section head; secretary; minister, Example: 部长说没问题。, Translation: The minister says no problem.

Word: 擦, Pinyin: cā, Meaning: to rub; to scratch; to towel; to wipe with a towel; to apply (lipstick, lotion etc); to touch; to brush (past); to shred (vegetables etc), Example: 请擦桌子。, Translation: Please wipe the table.

Word: 猜, Pinyin: cāi, Meaning: to guess, Example: 你猜对了吗？, Translation: Did you guess correctly?

Word: 才, Pinyin: cái, Meaning: ability; talent; sb of a certain type; a capable individual; then and only then; just now; (before an expression of quantity) only, Example: 他才五岁。, Translation: He is only five years old.

Word: 才能, Pinyin: cái néng, Meaning: talent; ability; capacity, Example: 他很有才能。, Translation: He has great talent.

Word: 材料, Pinyin: cái liào, Meaning: (raw) material; data; (fig.) person who has the potential to do the job, Example: 我需要买些材料。, Translation: I need to buy some materials.

Word: 财产, Pinyin: cái chǎn, Meaning: property; assets; estate, Example: 他有很多财产。, Translation: He has a lot of property.

Word: 财富, Pinyin: cái fù, Meaning: wealth; riches, Example: 健康就是财富。, Translation: Health is wealth.

Word: 财务, Pinyin: cái wù, Meaning: financial affairs, Example: 我是财务。, Translation: I work in finance.

Word: 采访, Pinyin: cǎi fǎng, Meaning: to interview; to gather news; to hunt for and collect; to cover, Example: 明天我要采访他。, Translation: Tomorrow I will interview him.

Word: 采取, Pinyin: cǎi qǔ, Meaning: to adopt or carry out (measures, policies, course of action); to take, Example: 我们采取了新措施。, Translation: We adopted new measures.

Word: 采用, Pinyin: cǎi yòng, Meaning: to adopt; to employ; to use, Example: 我们采用新方法。, Translation: We use a new method.

Word: 踩, Pinyin: cǎi, Meaning: variant of 踩, Example: 我踩到石头了。, Translation: I stepped on a stone.

Word: 菜, Pinyin: cài, Meaning: dish (type of food); vegetable; cuisine; (coll.) (one's) type; (of one's skills etc) weak; poor, Example: 今天吃什么菜？, Translation: What dish should we eat today?

Word: 参观, Pinyin: cān guān, Meaning: to look around; to tour; to visit, Example: 我们去参观博物馆。, Translation: We will visit the museum.

Word: 参加, Pinyin: cān jiā, Meaning: to participate; to take part; to join, Example: 我想参加。, Translation: I want to join.

Word: 参赛, Pinyin: cān sài, Meaning: to compete; to take part in a competition, Example: 我想参赛。, Translation: I want to compete.

Word: 参与, Pinyin: cān yù, Meaning: to participate (in sth), Example: 你愿意参与吗？, Translation: Would you like to participate?

Word: 餐, Pinyin: cān, Meaning: meal; to eat; classifier for meals, Example: 晚餐吃什么？, Translation: What's for dinner?

Word: 餐厅, Pinyin: cān tīng, Meaning: dining hall; dining room; restaurant, Example: 我们在餐厅吃饭。, Translation: We are eating at the restaurant.

Word: 惨, Pinyin: cǎn, Meaning: miserable; wretched; cruel; inhuman; disastrous; tragic; dim; gloomy, Example: 他输得很惨。, Translation: He lost badly.

Word: 藏, Pinyin: Zàng, Meaning: Tibet; abbr. for Xizang or Tibet Autonomous Region 藏, Example: 我想去藏。, Translation: I want to go to Tibet.

Word: 操作, Pinyin: cāo zuò, Meaning: to work; to operate; to manipulate, Example: 这个机器怎么操作？, Translation: How do you operate this machine?

Word: 草, Pinyin: cǎo, Meaning: variant of 草, Example: 别踩草。, Translation: Don't step on the grass.

Word: 侧, Pinyin: cè, Meaning: the side; to incline towards; to lean; inclined; lateral; side, Example: 请往侧边走。, Translation: Please walk to the side.

Word: 厕所, Pinyin: cè suǒ, Meaning: toilet; lavatory, Example: 我去一下厕所。, Translation: I'm going to the toilet.

Word: 测, Pinyin: cè, Meaning: to survey; to measure; to conjecture, Example: 请测一下体温。, Translation: Please measure your temperature.

Word: 测试, Pinyin: cè shì, Meaning: to test (machinery etc); to test (a person's skill in a particular area); a test; (computing) beta (version of software), Example: 我们测试一下软件。, Translation: Let's test the software.

Word: 策略, Pinyin: cè lu:è, Meaning: strategy; tactics; crafty; adroit, Example: 你的策略很好。, Translation: Your strategy is very good.

Word: 策划, Pinyin: cè huà, Meaning: to plot; to scheme; to bring about; to engineer; planning; producer; planner, Example: 谁策划了这次活动？, Translation: Who planned this event?

Word: 层, Pinyin: céng, Meaning: to pile on top of one another; layer; stratum; floor (of a building); story; (math.) sheaf; classifier for layers, Example: 这栋楼有十层。, Translation: This building has ten floors.

Word: 曾, Pinyin: Zēng, Meaning: surname Zeng, Example: 曾老师来了。, Translation: Teacher Zeng is here.

Word: 曾经, Pinyin: céng jīng, Meaning: once; already; former; previously; ever; (past tense marker used before verb or clause), Example: 我曾经去过北京。, Translation: I once went to Beijing.

Word: 插, Pinyin: chā, Meaning: to insert; stick in; pierce; to take part in; to interfere; to interpose, Example: 把花插进花瓶。, Translation: Put the flower in the vase.

Word: 查, Pinyin: Zhā, Meaning: surname Zha, Example: 他姓查。, Translation: He is surnamed Zha.

Word: 查看, Pinyin: chá kàn, Meaning: to look over; to examine; to check up; to ferret out, Example: 帮我查看一下。, Translation: Please help me check it.

