Word: 承认, Pinyin: chéng rèn, Meaning: to admit; to concede; to recognize; recognition (diplomatic, artistic etc); to acknowledge, Example: 我承认错了。, Translation: I admit I was wrong.

Word: 承受, Pinyin: chéng shòu, Meaning: to bear; to support; to inherit, Example: 我承受不了压力。, Translation: I can't bear the pressure.

