Word: 程度, Pinyin: chéng dù, Meaning: degree; level; extent, Example: 他的中文程度很好。, Translation: His Chinese level is very good.

Word: 程序, Pinyin: chéng xù, Meaning: procedures; sequence; order; computer program, Example: 这个程序很好用。, Translation: This program is very easy to use.

Word: 吃, Pinyin: chī, Meaning: to eat; to consume; to eat at (a cafeteria etc); to eradicate; to destroy; to absorb; to suffer (shock, injury, defeat etc), Example: 我吃饭了。, Translation: I ate.

