Word: 次, Pinyin: cì, Meaning: next in sequence; second; the second (day, time etc); secondary; vice-; sub-; infra-; inferior quality; substandard; order; sequence; hypo- (chemistry); classifier for enumerated events: time, Example: 下次再见。, Translation: See you next time.

