Word: 刺激, Pinyin: cì jī, Meaning: to provoke; to irritate; to upset; to stimulate; to excite; irritant, Example: 别刺激他。, Translation: Don't provoke him.

Word: 聪明, Pinyin: cōng ming, Meaning: intelligent; clever; bright; smart; acute (of sight and hearing), Example: 这孩子真聪明。, Translation: This kid is really smart.

