Word: 费, Pinyin: Fèi, Meaning: surname Fei, Example: 费老师来了。, Translation: Teacher Fei is here.

Word: 费用, Pinyin: fèi yòng, Meaning: cost; expenditure; expense, Example: 这笔费用谁付？, Translation: Who pays this cost?

Word: 分, Pinyin: fēn, Meaning: to divide; to separate; to distribute; to allocate; to distinguish (good and bad); (bound form) branch of (an organization); sub- (as in 局); fraction; one tenth (of certain units); unit of length equivalent to 0.33 cm; minute (unit of time); minute (angular measurement unit); a point (in sports or games); 0.01 yuan (unit of money), Example: 我们分蛋糕吧。, Translation: Let's share the cake.

Word: 分别, Pinyin: fēn bié, Meaning: to part; to leave each other; to distinguish; to tell apart; difference; distinction; in different ways; differently; separately; individually, Example: 我们分别回家吧。, Translation: Let's go home separately.

Word: 分开, Pinyin: fēn kāi, Meaning: to separate; to part, Example: 我们分开吧。, Translation: Let's part ways.

Word: 分离, Pinyin: fēn lí, Meaning: to separate, Example: 我们不得不分离。, Translation: We have to separate.

Word: 分配, Pinyin: fēn pèi, Meaning: to distribute; to assign; to allocate; to partition (a hard drive), Example: 任务怎么分配？, Translation: How should we assign the task?

Word: 分手, Pinyin: fēn shǒu, Meaning: to part company; to split up; to break up, Example: 我们分手吧。, Translation: Let's break up.

Word: 分析, Pinyin: fēn xī, Meaning: to analyze; analysis, Example: 请分析一下数据。, Translation: Please analyze the data.

Word: 分享, Pinyin: fēn xiǎng, Meaning: to share (let others have some of sth good), Example: 我们一起分享蛋糕吧。, Translation: Let's share the cake together.

Word: 分钟, Pinyin: fēn zhōng, Meaning: minute, Example: 请等一分钟。, Translation: Please wait one minute.

Word: 粉, Pinyin: fěn, Meaning: powder; cosmetic face powder; food prepared from starch; noodles or pasta made from any kind of flour; to turn to powder; (dialect) to whitewash; white; pink; (suffix) fan (abbr. for 粉丝); to be a fan of, Example: 我喜欢吃米粉。, Translation: I like eating rice noodles.

Word: 粉丝, Pinyin: fěn sī, Meaning: bean vermicelli; mung bean starch noodles; Chinese vermicelli; cellophane noodles; fan (loanword); enthusiast for sb or sth, Example: 我爱吃粉丝。, Translation: I love eating vermicelli.

Word: 份, Pinyin: fèn, Meaning: classifier for gifts, newspaper, magazine, papers, reports, contracts etc; variant of 分, Example: 我买了一份报纸。, Translation: I bought a newspaper.

Word: 愤怒, Pinyin: fèn nù, Meaning: angry; indignant; wrath; ire, Example: 他非常愤怒。, Translation: He is very angry.

Word: 丰富, Pinyin: fēng fù, Meaning: to enrich; rich; plentiful; abundant, Example: 他的知识很丰富。, Translation: His knowledge is very rich.

Word: 风, Pinyin: fēng, Meaning: wind; news; style; custom; manner, Example: 今天风很大。, Translation: It is very windy today.

Word: 风格, Pinyin: fēng gé, Meaning: style, Example: 我喜欢你的风格。, Translation: I like your style.

Word: 风险, Pinyin: fēng xiǎn, Meaning: risk; hazard, Example: 投资有风险。, Translation: Investing has risks.

Word: 封, Pinyin: Fēng, Meaning: surname Feng, Example: 我姓封。, Translation: My surname is Feng.

Word: 疯, Pinyin: fēng, Meaning: insane; mad; wild, Example: 你疯了吗？, Translation: Are you crazy?

Word: 疯狂, Pinyin: fēng kuáng, Meaning: crazy; frenzied; wild, Example: 这主意真疯狂。, Translation: This idea is really crazy.

Word: 否认, Pinyin: fǒu rèn, Meaning: to declare to be untrue; to deny, Example: 他否认了这件事。, Translation: He denied it.

Word: 否则, Pinyin: fǒu zé, Meaning: otherwise; if not; or (else), Example: 快走，否则迟到。, Translation: Hurry up, otherwise you'll be late.

Word: 佛, Pinyin: Fó, Meaning: Buddha; Buddhism (abbr. for 陀), Example: 他去拜佛了。, Translation: He went to worship Buddha.

Word: 服, Pinyin: fú, Meaning: clothes; dress; garment; to serve (in the military, a prison sentence etc); to obey; to be convinced (by an argument); to convince; to admire; to acclimatize; to take (medicine); mourning clothes; to wear mourning clothes, Example: 我彻底服了。, Translation: I am completely convinced.

Word: 服务, Pinyin: fú wù, Meaning: to serve; service, Example: 这家店的服务很好。, Translation: The service at this shop is very good.

Word: 服装, Pinyin: fú zhuāng, Meaning: dress; clothing; costume; clothes, Example: 我喜欢这套服装。, Translation: I like this outfit.

Word: 符合, Pinyin: fú hé, Meaning: in keeping with; in accordance with; tallying with; in line with; to agree with; to accord with; to conform to; to correspond with; to manage; to handle, Example: 这符合要求吗？, Translation: Does it meet the requirements?

Word: 幅, Pinyin: fú, Meaning: width; roll; classifier for textiles or pictures, Example: 我买了一幅画。, Translation: I bought a painting.

Word: 福, Pinyin: Fú, Meaning: surname Fu; abbr. for Fujian province 省, Example: 我姓福。, Translation: My surname is Fu.

Word: 父母, Pinyin: fù mǔ, Meaning: father and mother; parents, Example: 我的父母很爱我。, Translation: My parents love me very much.

Word: 父亲, Pinyin: fù qīn, Meaning: father; also pr. [fù qin], Example: 我父亲是老师。, Translation: My father is a teacher.

Word: 付, Pinyin: Fù, Meaning: surname Fu, Example: 我姓付。, Translation: My surname is Fu.

Word: 付出, Pinyin: fù chū, Meaning: to pay; to expend; to invest (energy or time), Example: 他为你付出了很多。, Translation: He put in a lot for you.

Word: 妇女, Pinyin: fù nǚ, Meaning: woman, Example: 这位妇女很善良。, Translation: This woman is very kind.

Word: 负, Pinyin: fù, Meaning: to bear; to carry (on one's back); to turn one's back on; to be defeated; negative (math. etc), Example: 答案是负数。, Translation: The answer is negative.

Word: 负担, Pinyin: fù dān, Meaning: to bear (an expense, a responsibility etc); burden, Example: 别增加我的负担。, Translation: Don't increase my burden.

Word: 负责, Pinyin: fù zé, Meaning: to be in charge of; to take responsibility for; to be to blame; conscientious, Example: 谁负责这个？, Translation: Who is in charge of this?

Word: 负责人, Pinyin: fù zé rén, Meaning: person in charge, Example: 负责人是谁？, Translation: Who is the person in charge?

Word: 附近, Pinyin: fù jìn, Meaning: nearby; neighboring; (in the) vicinity (of); neighborhood, Example: 我家附近有个公园。, Translation: There is a park near my house.

Word: 复杂, Pinyin: fù zá, Meaning: complicated; complex, Example: 这事很复杂。, Translation: This matter is very complicated.

Word: 副, Pinyin: fù, Meaning: secondary; auxiliary; deputy; assistant; vice-; abbr. for 副词 adverb; classifier for pairs, sets of things & facial expressions, Example: 他戴着一副眼镜。, Translation: He is wearing a pair of glasses.

Word: 富, Pinyin: Fù, Meaning: surname Fu, Example: 我姓富。, Translation: My surname is Fu.

Word: 富有, Pinyin: fù yǒu, Meaning: rich; wealthy; affluent; to be rich in; to be replete with, Example: 他很富有。, Translation: He is very wealthy.

Word: 夫妇, Pinyin: fū fù, Meaning: a (married) couple; husband and wife, Example: 他们是一对夫妇。, Translation: They are a married couple.

Word: 夫妻, Pinyin: fū qī, Meaning: husband and wife; married couple, Example: 他们是夫妻。, Translation: They are a married couple.

Word: 夫人, Pinyin: fū ren, Meaning: lady; madam; Mrs., Example: 这是我夫人。, Translation: This is my wife.

Word: 该, Pinyin: gāi, Meaning: should; ought to; probably; must be; to deserve; to owe; to be sb's turn to do sth; that; the above-mentioned, Example: 我该走了。, Translation: I should go now.

Word: 改, Pinyin: gǎi, Meaning: to change; to alter; to transform; to correct, Example: 我想改名字。, Translation: I want to change my name.

Word: 改变, Pinyin: gǎi biàn, Meaning: to change; to alter; to transform, Example: 我想改变生活。, Translation: I want to change my life.

Word: 改革开放, Pinyin: gǎi gé kāi fàng, Meaning: to reform and open to the outside world; refers to Deng Xiaoping's policies from around 1980, Example: 改革开放让中国变好了。, Translation: Reform and opening up has made China better.

Word: 改善, Pinyin: gǎi shàn, Meaning: to make better; to improve, Example: 我们要改善生活。, Translation: We need to improve our lives.

Word: 改造, Pinyin: gǎi zào, Meaning: to transform; to reform; to remodel; to remold, Example: 我想改造我的房间。, Translation: I want to remodel my room.

Word: 盖, Pinyin: Gě, Meaning: surname Ge, Example: 盖老师来了。, Translation: Teacher Ge is here.

Word: 概念, Pinyin: gài niàn, Meaning: concept; idea, Example: 我不懂这个概念。, Translation: I don't understand this concept.

Word: 杆, Pinyin: gān, Meaning: pole, Example: 旗杆很高。, Translation: The flagpole is very tall.

Word: 尴尬, Pinyin: gān gà, Meaning: awkward; embarrassed, Example: 他有点尴尬。, Translation: He is a bit embarrassed.

Word: 赶, Pinyin: gǎn, Meaning: to overtake; to catch up with; to hurry; to rush; to try to catch (the bus etc); to drive (cattle etc) forward; to drive (sb) away; to avail oneself of (an opportunity); until; by (a certain time), Example: 我赶着去上班。, Translation: I'm rushing to work.

Word: 赶到, Pinyin: gǎn dào, Meaning: to hurry (to some place), Example: 我马上赶到。, Translation: I'll hurry over right away.

Word: 赶紧, Pinyin: gǎn jǐn, Meaning: hurriedly; without delay, Example: 赶紧走吧！, Translation: Hurry up and go!

Word: 赶快, Pinyin: gǎn kuài, Meaning: quickly; at once, Example: 赶快走吧！, Translation: Hurry up and go!

Word: 敢, Pinyin: gǎn, Meaning: to dare; daring; (polite) may I venture, Example: 你敢试试吗？, Translation: Do you dare to try?

Word: 感, Pinyin: gǎn, Meaning: to feel; to move; to touch; to affect; feeling; emotion; (suffix) sense of ~, Example: 我感觉很好。, Translation: I feel good.

Word: 感到, Pinyin: gǎn dào, Meaning: to feel; to sense; to perceive, Example: 我感到很开心。, Translation: I feel very happy.

Word: 感动, Pinyin: gǎn dòng, Meaning: to move (sb); to touch (sb emotionally); moving, Example: 他的故事让我感动。, Translation: His story moved me.

Word: 感激, Pinyin: gǎn jī, Meaning: to be grateful; to appreciate; thankful, Example: 我很感激你。, Translation: I am very grateful to you.

Word: 感觉, Pinyin: gǎn jué, Meaning: feeling; impression; sensation; to feel; to perceive, Example: 你感觉怎么样？, Translation: How do you feel?

Word: 感冒, Pinyin: gǎn mào, Meaning: to catch cold; (common) cold; (coll.) to be interested in (often used in the negative); (Tw) to detest; can't stand, Example: 我感冒了。, Translation: I caught a cold.

Word: 感情, Pinyin: gǎn qíng, Meaning: emotion; sentiment; affection; feelings between two persons, Example: 我们的感情很好。, Translation: Our relationship is very good.

Word: 感染, Pinyin: gǎn rǎn, Meaning: to infect; infection; (fig.) to influence, Example: 他感染了病毒。, Translation: He got infected with a virus.

Word: 感受, Pinyin: gǎn shòu, Meaning: to sense; perception; to feel (through the senses); to experience; a feeling; an impression; an experience, Example: 你的感受是什么？, Translation: What is your feeling?

Word: 感谢, Pinyin: gǎn xiè, Meaning: (express) thanks; gratitude; grateful; thankful; thanks, Example: 非常感谢你。, Translation: Thank you very much.

Word: 干, Pinyin: gān, Meaning: old variant of 干, Example: 今天不干了。, Translation: Not working today.

Word: 干净, Pinyin: gān jìng, Meaning: clean; neat, Example: 房间很干净。, Translation: The room is very clean.

Word: 干什么, Pinyin: gàn shén me, Meaning: what are you doing?; what's he up to?, Example: 你在干什么？, Translation: What are you doing?

Word: 刚, Pinyin: gāng, Meaning: hard; firm; strong; just; barely; exactly, Example: 我刚到家。, Translation: I just got home.

Word: 刚才, Pinyin: gāng cái, Meaning: just now; a moment ago, Example: 刚才我在吃饭。, Translation: I was eating just now.

Word: 刚刚, Pinyin: gāng gang, Meaning: just recently; just a moment ago, Example: 我刚刚到家。, Translation: I just got home.

Word: 港, Pinyin: Gǎng, Meaning: Hong Kong (abbr. for 港); surname Gang, Example: 我去港看朋友。, Translation: I go to Hong Kong to see my friend.

Word: 高, Pinyin: Gāo, Meaning: surname Gao, Example: 我姓高。, Translation: My surname is Gao.

Word: 高度, Pinyin: gāo dù, Meaning: height; altitude; elevation; high degree; highly, Example: 这座山的高度是多少？, Translation: What is the height of this mountain?

Word: 高级, Pinyin: gāo jí, Meaning: high level; high grade; advanced; high-ranking, Example: 这台电脑很高级。, Translation: This computer is very advanced.

Word: 高手, Pinyin: gāo shǒu, Meaning: expert; past master; dab hand, Example: 他是下棋高手。, Translation: He is a chess expert.

Word: 高速, Pinyin: gāo sù, Meaning: high speed; expressway (abbr. for 路), Example: 我们走高速去。, Translation: We will take the expressway.

Word: 高兴, Pinyin: gāo xìng, Meaning: happy; glad; willing (to do sth); in a cheerful mood, Example: 我今天很高兴。, Translation: I am very happy today.

Word: 高中, Pinyin: gāo zhōng, Meaning: senior high school; abbr. for 高级中学, Example: 我在读高中。, Translation: I am in high school.

Word: 搞, Pinyin: gǎo, Meaning: to do; to make; to go in for; to set up; to get hold of; to take care of, Example: 我搞定了。, Translation: I've got it done.

Word: 告, Pinyin: gào, Meaning: to say; to tell; to announce; to report; to denounce; to file a lawsuit; to sue, Example: 请告诉我。, Translation: Please tell me.

Word: 告诉, Pinyin: gào sù, Meaning: to press charges; to file a complaint, Example: 请告诉我。, Translation: Please tell me.

Word: 哥, Pinyin: gē, Meaning: elder brother, Example: 我哥在家。, Translation: My elder brother is at home.

Word: 哥哥, Pinyin: gē ge, Meaning: older brother, Example: 我哥哥很好。, Translation: My older brother is very nice.

Word: 歌, Pinyin: gē, Meaning: song; to sing, Example: 我喜欢这首歌。, Translation: I like this song.

Word: 歌曲, Pinyin: gē qǔ, Meaning: song, Example: 我喜欢这首歌曲。, Translation: I like this song.

Word: 歌手, Pinyin: gē shǒu, Meaning: singer, Example: 我想当歌手。, Translation: I want to be a singer.

Word: 革命, Pinyin: gé mìng, Meaning: to withdraw the mandate of heaven (and transition to a new dynasty) (original meaning); revolution; revolutionary; to revolt (against sb or sth); to revolutionize (sth); (separable verb sometimes used in the pattern 革noun的命), Example: 他想搞场革命。, Translation: He wants to start a revolution.

Word: 格, Pinyin: gé, Meaning: square; frame; rule; (legal) case; style; character; standard; pattern; (grammar) case; (classical) to obstruct; to hinder; (classical) to arrive; to come; (classical) to investigate; to study exhaustively, Example: 这张纸有格子吗？, Translation: Does this paper have a grid?

Word: 隔, Pinyin: gé, Meaning: to separate; to partition; to stand or lie between; at a distance from; after or at an interval of, Example: 我们隔着一张桌子。, Translation: There is a table between us.

Word: 个, Pinyin: gě, Meaning: used in 自个儿, Example: 他喜欢自个儿玩。, Translation: He likes to play by himself.

Word: 个人, Pinyin: gè rén, Meaning: individual; personal; oneself, Example: 这是个人的事。, Translation: It is a personal matter.

Word: 个性, Pinyin: gè xìng, Meaning: individuality; personality, Example: 她很有个性。, Translation: She has a lot of personality.

Word: 各, Pinyin: gè, Meaning: each; every, Example: 各人一份。, Translation: One for each person.

Word: 各地, Pinyin: gè dì, Meaning: in all parts of (a country); various regions, Example: 各地都有美食。, Translation: Good food is available everywhere.

Word: 各个, Pinyin: gè gè, Meaning: every; various; separately, one by one, Example: 各个房间都很干净。, Translation: Every room is very clean.

Word: 各位, Pinyin: gè wèi, Meaning: everybody; all (guests, colleagues etc); all of you, Example: 各位请坐。, Translation: Everyone, please sit down.

Word: 各种, Pinyin: gè zhǒng, Meaning: every kind of; all kinds of; various, Example: 我喜欢各种水果。, Translation: I like all kinds of fruit.

Word: 各自, Pinyin: gè zì, Meaning: each; respective; apiece, Example: 我们各自回家。, Translation: We each go home.

Word: 给, Pinyin: gěi, Meaning: to; for; for the benefit of; to give; to allow; to do sth (for sb); (grammatical equivalent of 被); (grammatical equivalent of 把); (sentence intensifier), Example: 我给你一本书。, Translation: I'll give you a book.

Word: 给予, Pinyin: jǐ yǔ, Meaning: (literary) to give; to accord; to render, Example: 他给予我帮助。, Translation: He gives me help.

Word: 根, Pinyin: gēn, Meaning: root; basis; classifier for long slender objects, e.g. cigarettes, guitar strings; radical (chemistry), Example: 给我一根绳子。, Translation: Give me a rope.

Word: 根本, Pinyin: gēn běn, Meaning: fundamental; basic; root; simply; absolutely (not); (not) at all, Example: 我根本不知道。, Translation: I don't know at all.

Word: 根据, Pinyin: gēn jù, Meaning: according to; based on; basis; foundation, Example: 根据天气，带伞吧。, Translation: According to the weather, bring an umbrella.

Word: 跟, Pinyin: gēn, Meaning: heel; to follow closely; to go with; (of a woman) to marry sb; with; compared with; to; towards; and (joining two nouns), Example: 你跟我走。, Translation: Come with me.

Word: 跟踪, Pinyin: gēn zōng, Meaning: to follow sb's tracks; to tail; to shadow; tracking, Example: 他在跟踪我。, Translation: He is following me.

Word: 更, Pinyin: gēng, Meaning: to change or replace; to experience; one of the five two-hour periods into which the night was formerly divided; watch (e.g. of a sentry or guard), Example: 都三更了，睡吧。, Translation: It's past midnight, go to sleep.

Word: 更加, Pinyin: gèng jiā, Meaning: more (than sth else); even more, Example: 我更加喜欢它了。, Translation: I like it even more now.

Word: 工厂, Pinyin: gōng chǎng, Meaning: factory, Example: 我在工厂工作。, Translation: I work at a factory.

Word: 工程, Pinyin: gōng chéng, Meaning: engineering; an engineering project; project; undertaking, Example: 我们在做新工程。, Translation: We are working on a new project.

Word: 工具, Pinyin: gōng jù, Meaning: tool; instrument; utensil; means (to achieve a goal etc), Example: 这是个好工具。, Translation: This is a good tool.

Word: 工人, Pinyin: gōng rén, Meaning: worker, Example: 我爸爸是工人。, Translation: My dad is a worker.

Word: 工业, Pinyin: gōng yè, Meaning: industry, Example: 中国工业很强。, Translation: China's industry is very strong.

Word: 工资, Pinyin: gōng zī, Meaning: wages; pay, Example: 你工资多少？, Translation: How much is your salary?

Word: 工作, Pinyin: gōng zuò, Meaning: to work; (of a machine) to operate; job; work; task, Example: 我明天去工作。, Translation: I will go to work tomorrow.

Word: 公, Pinyin: gōng, Meaning: public; collectively owned; common; international (e.g. high seas, metric system, calendar); make public; fair; just; Duke, highest of five orders of nobility 位; honorable (gentlemen); father-in-law; male (animal), Example: 他做事很公平。, Translation: He is very fair.

Word: 公布, Pinyin: gōng bù, Meaning: to announce; to make public; to publish, Example: 学校公布了成绩。, Translation: The school announced the grades.

Word: 公共, Pinyin: gōng gòng, Meaning: public; common; communal, Example: 这是公共汽车。, Translation: This is a bus.

Word: 公开, Pinyin: gōng kāi, Meaning: open; overt; public; to make public; to release, Example: 结果已公开。, Translation: The results are public.

Word: 公里, Pinyin: gōng lǐ, Meaning: kilometer, Example: 学校离我家三公里。, Translation: The school is three kilometers from my home.

Word: 公路, Pinyin: gōng lù, Meaning: highway; road, Example: 我们走公路吧。, Translation: Let's take the highway.

