Word: 镜头, Pinyin: jìng tóu, Meaning: camera lens; camera shot (in a movie etc); scene, Example: 这个镜头拍得真好。, Translation: This shot looks great.

Word: 究竟, Pinyin: jiū jìng, Meaning: to go to the bottom of a matter; after all; when all is said and done; (in an interrogative sentence) finally; outcome; result, Example: 你究竟想怎样？, Translation: What do you want after all?

