Word: 明天, Pinyin: míng tiān, Meaning: tomorrow, Example: 我们明天见。, Translation: See you tomorrow.

Word: 明显, Pinyin: míng xiǎn, Meaning: clear; distinct; obvious, Example: 他的变化很明显。, Translation: His change is very obvious.

Word: 明星, Pinyin: míng xīng, Meaning: star; celebrity, Example: 他是大明星。, Translation: He is a big star.

Word: 命, Pinyin: mìng, Meaning: life; fate; order or command; to assign a name, title etc, Example: 别拿命开玩笑。, Translation: Don't joke with your life.

Word: 命令, Pinyin: mìng lìng, Meaning: order; command, Example: 老板下了命令。, Translation: The boss gave an order.

Word: 命运, Pinyin: mìng yùn, Meaning: fate; destiny, Example: 他的命运改变了。, Translation: His fate changed.

Word: 摸, Pinyin: mō, Meaning: to feel with the hand; to touch; to stroke; to grope; to steal; to abstract, Example: 别乱摸东西。, Translation: Don't touch things randomly.

Word: 模式, Pinyin: mó shì, Meaning: mode; method; pattern, Example: 换个新模式吧。, Translation: Let's try a new mode.

Word: 模型, Pinyin: mó xíng, Meaning: model; mold; matrix; pattern, Example: 我喜欢这个模型。, Translation: I like this model.

Word: 末, Pinyin: mò, Meaning: tip; end; final stage; latter part; inessential detail; powder; dust; opera role of old man, Example: 周末见！, Translation: See you on the weekend!

Word: 某, Pinyin: mǒu, Meaning: some; a certain; sb or sth indefinite; such-and-such, Example: 某人在等我。, Translation: Someone is waiting for me.

Word: 母, Pinyin: mǔ, Meaning: mother; elderly female relative; origin; source; (of animals) female, Example: 母鸡下蛋了。, Translation: The hen laid an egg.

Word: 母亲, Pinyin: mǔ qīn, Meaning: mother; also pr. [mǔ qin], Example: 我爱我的母亲。, Translation: I love my mother.

Word: 目标, Pinyin: mù biāo, Meaning: target; goal; objective, Example: 我的目标是学好中文。, Translation: My goal is to learn Chinese well.

Word: 目的, Pinyin: mù dì, Meaning: purpose; aim; goal; target; objective, Example: 我的目的是学习中文。, Translation: My goal is to learn Chinese.

Word: 目前, Pinyin: mù qián, Meaning: at the present time; currently, Example: 目前我在学习中文。, Translation: Currently I am learning Chinese.

Word: 幕, Pinyin: mù, Meaning: curtain or screen; canopy or tent; headquarters of a general; act (of a play), Example: 音乐会开幕了。, Translation: The concert has started.

Word: 嗯, Pinyin: ēn, Meaning: (a groaning sound), Example: 嗯，我知道了。, Translation: Hmm, I know.

Word: 拿, Pinyin: ná, Meaning: old variant of 拿, Example: 请拿一杯水。, Translation: Please get a cup of water.

Word: 哪, Pinyin: nǎ, Meaning: how; which, Example: 这是哪本书？, Translation: Which book is this?

Word: 哪儿, Pinyin: nǎ r, Meaning: where?; wherever; anywhere; somewhere; (used in rhetorical questions) how can ...?; how could ...?, Example: 你去哪儿？, Translation: Where are you going?

Word: 哪里, Pinyin: nǎ lǐ, Meaning: where?; somewhere; anywhere; wherever; nowhere (negative answer to question); humble expression denying compliment; also written 哪里, Example: 你在哪里？, Translation: Where are you?

Word: 哪些, Pinyin: nǎ xiē, Meaning: which ones?; who?; what?, Example: 你想要哪些？, Translation: Which ones do you want?

Word: 那, Pinyin: Nā, Meaning: surname Na, Example: 我姓那。, Translation: My surname is Na.

Word: 那边, Pinyin: nà bian, Meaning: over there; yonder, Example: 我们去那边吧。, Translation: Let's go over there.

Word: 那儿, Pinyin: nà r, Meaning: there, Example: 我们去那儿吧。, Translation: Let's go there.

Word: 那里, Pinyin: nà li, Meaning: there; that place, Example: 我们去那里吧。, Translation: Let's go there.

Word: 那么, Pinyin: nà me, Meaning: like that; in that way; or so; so; so very much; about; in that case, Example: 天气那么冷。, Translation: The weather is so cold.

Word: 那时, Pinyin: nà shí, Meaning: then; at that time; in those days, Example: 那时我很忙。, Translation: I was very busy then.

Word: 那些, Pinyin: nà xiē, Meaning: those, Example: 那些是什么？, Translation: What are those?

Word: 那样, Pinyin: nà yàng, Meaning: that kind; that sort, Example: 别那样做。, Translation: Don't do that.

Word: 奶, Pinyin: nǎi, Meaning: breast; milk; to breastfeed, Example: 我想喝奶。, Translation: I want to drink milk.

Word: 奶奶, Pinyin: nǎi nai, Meaning: (informal) grandma (paternal grandmother); (respectful) mistress of the house; (coll.) boobies; breasts, Example: 我想奶奶了。, Translation: I miss grandma. 53%|█████▎    | 1589/3006 [9:56:14<8:42:07, 22.11s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1590/3006 [9:56:26<7:26:41, 18.93s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1591/3006 [9:56:42<7:05:46, 18.05s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1592/3006 [9:57:07<7:52:55, 20.07s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1593/3006 [9:57:22<7:22:40, 18.80s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1594/3006 [9:57:38<7:01:10, 17.90s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1595/3006 [9:58:06<8:13:58, 21.01s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1596/3006 [9:58:26<8:03:54, 20.59s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1597/3006 [9:58:58<9:25:04, 24.06s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1598/3006 [9:59:28<10:04:11, 25.75s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1599/3006 [9:59:56<10:18:43, 26.38s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1600/3006 [10:00:18<9:50:42, 25.21s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1601/3006 [10:00:35<8:50:20, 22.65s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1602/3006 [10:01:05<9:39:50, 24.78s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1603/3006 [10:01:31<9:50:55, 25.27s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1604/3006 [10:02:00<10:12:47, 26.22s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1605/3006 [10:02:24<9:59:36, 25.68s/it]  53%|█████▎    | 1606/3006 [10:02:45<9:23:56, 24.17s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1607/3006 [10:03:10<9:30:46, 24.48s/it] 53%|█████▎    | 1608/3006 [10:03:36<9:41:27, 24.96s/it] 54%|█████▎    | 1609/3006 [10:04:07<10:22:41, 26.74s/it] 54%|█████▎    | 1610/3006 [10:04:34<10:25:48, 26.90s/it] 54%|█████▎    | 1611/3006 [10:04:52<9:21:34, 24.15s/it]  54%|█████▎    | 1612/3006 [10:05:09<8:31:26, 22.01s/it] 54%|█████▎    | 1613/3006 [10:05:34<8:50:36, 22.85s/it] 54%|█████▎    | 1614/3006 [10:06:04<9:43:29, 25.15s/it] 54%|█████▎    | 1615/3006 [10:06:28<9:32:37, 24.70s/it] 54%|█████▍    | 1616/3006 [10:06:52<9:27:04, 24.48s/it] 54%|█████▍    | 1617/3006 [10:07:22<10:05:55, 26.17s/it] 54%|█████▍    | 1618/3006 [10:07:36<8:43:28, 22.63s/it]  54%|█████▍    | 1619/3006 [10:08:01<9:01:01, 23.40s/it] 54%|█████▍    | 1620/3006 [10:08:24<8:55:04, 23