Word: 耐心, Pinyin: nài xīn, Meaning: to be patient; patience, Example: 他很有耐心。, Translation: He is very patient.

Word: 男, Pinyin: nán, Meaning: male; Baron, lowest of five orders of nobility 位, Example: 他是男的。, Translation: He is male.

Word: 男朋友, Pinyin: nán péng you, Meaning: boyfriend, Example: 他是我男朋友。, Translation: He is my boyfriend.

Word: 男人, Pinyin: nán rén, Meaning: a man; a male; men, Example: 那个男人很帅。, Translation: That man is very handsome.

Word: 男生, Pinyin: nán shēng, Meaning: schoolboy; male student; boy; guy (young adult male), Example: 那个男生是我同学。, Translation: That boy is my classmate.

Word: 男性, Pinyin: nán xìng, Meaning: the male sex; a male, Example: 我是男性。, Translation: I am male.

Word: 男子, Pinyin: nán zǐ, Meaning: a man; a male, Example: 那位男子是我朋友。, Translation: That man is my friend.

Word: 南, Pinyin: Nán, Meaning: surname Nan, Example: 南先生来了。, Translation: Mr. Nan is here.

Word: 南方, Pinyin: nán fāng, Meaning: south; the southern part of the country; the South, Example: 我想去南方。, Translation: I want to go south.

Word: 难, Pinyin: nán, Meaning: difficult (to...); problem; difficulty; difficult; not good, Example: 这道题很难。, Translation: This question is very difficult.

Word: 难道, Pinyin: nán dào, Meaning: don't tell me ...; could it be that...?, Example: 难道你忘了？, Translation: Don't tell me you forgot?

Word: 难过, Pinyin: nán guò, Meaning: to feel sad; to feel unwell; (of life) to be difficult, Example: 我今天很难过。, Translation: I feel sad today.

Word: 难受, Pinyin: nán shòu, Meaning: to feel unwell; to suffer pain; to be difficult to bear, Example: 我今天很难受。, Translation: I feel very unwell today.

Word: 难以, Pinyin: nán yǐ, Meaning: hard to (predict, imagine etc), Example: 未来难以预测。, Translation: The future is hard to predict.

Word: 脑袋, Pinyin: nǎo dai, Meaning: head; skull; brains; mental capability, Example: 他挠了挠脑袋。, Translation: He scratched his head.

Word: 脑子, Pinyin: nǎo zi, Meaning: brains; mind, Example: 我脑子转不动了。, Translation: My brain isn't working.

Word: 闹, Pinyin: nào, Meaning: variant of 闹, Example: 别闹了！, Translation: Stop messing around!

Word: 呢, Pinyin: ne, Meaning: particle indicating that a previously asked question is to be applied to the preceding word ("What about ...?", "And ...?"); particle for inquiring about location ("Where is ...?"); particle signaling a pause, to emphasize the preceding words and allow the listener time to take them on board ("ok?", "are you with me?"); (at the end of a declarative sentence) particle indicating continuation of a state or action; particle indicating strong affirmation, Example: 你呢？, Translation: What about you?

Word: 内, Pinyin: nèi, Meaning: inside; inner; internal; within; interior, Example: 请进室内。, Translation: Please come inside.

Word: 内部, Pinyin: nèi bù, Meaning: interior; inside (part, section); internal, Example: 内部空间很大。, Translation: The interior space is large.

Word: 内容, Pinyin: nèi róng, Meaning: content; substance; details, Example: 这本书的内容很有趣。, Translation: The content of this book is very interesting.

Word: 内心, Pinyin: nèi xīn, Meaning: heart; innermost being; (math.) incenter, Example: 我内心很平静。, Translation: I feel calm inside.

Word: 能, Pinyin: Néng, Meaning: surname Neng, Example: 我能老师好。, Translation: Hello, Teacher Neng.

Word: 能不能, Pinyin: néng bùnéng, Meaning: Can you, Example: 能不能帮我？, Translation: Can you help me?

Word: 能否, Pinyin: néng fǒu, Meaning: whether or not; can it or can't it; is it possible?, Example: 能否帮帮我？, Translation: Could you help me?

Word: 能够, Pinyin: néng gòu, Meaning: to be capable of; to be able to; can, Example: 他能够说中文。, Translation: He can speak Chinese.

Word: 能力, Pinyin: néng lì, Meaning: capability; ability, Example: 我有这个能力。, Translation: I have this ability.

Word: 能量, Pinyin: néng liàng, Meaning: energy; capabilities, Example: 我需要一点能量。, Translation: I need a little energy.

Word: 能源, Pinyin: néng yuán, Meaning: energy; power source, Example: 我们需要更多能源。, Translation: We need more energy.

Word: 你, Pinyin: nǐ, Meaning: you (informal, as opposed to courteous 您), Example: 你好吗？, Translation: How are you?

Word: 你们, Pinyin: nǐ men, Meaning: you (plural), Example: 你们好吗？, Translation: How are you all?

Word: 年, Pinyin: Nián, Meaning: surname Nian, Example: 明年见。, Translation: See you next year.

Word: 年代, Pinyin: nián dài, Meaning: a decade of a century (e.g. the Sixties); age; era; period, Example: 我们喜欢那个年代。, Translation: We like that era.

Word: 年度, Pinyin: nián dù, Meaning: year (e.g. school year, fiscal year); annual, Example: 年度聚会真开心。, Translation: The annual gathering was really fun.

Word: 年纪, Pinyin: nián jì, Meaning: age, Example: 你年纪多大？, Translation: How old are you?

Word: 年龄, Pinyin: nián líng, Meaning: (a person's) age, Example: 你的年龄是多少？, Translation: What is your age?

Word: 年轻, Pinyin: nián qīng, Meaning: young, Example: 她看起来很年轻。, Translation: She looks young.

Word: 念, Pinyin: niàn, Meaning: variant of 念, to read aloud, Example: 请大声念出来。, Translation: Please read it out loud.

Word: 娘, Pinyin: niáng, Meaning: mother; young lady; (coll.) effeminate, Example: 我娘在家。, Translation: My mother is at home.

Word: 鸟, Pinyin: diǎo, Meaning: variant of 屌; penis, Example: 这鸟事真烦, Translation: This damn thing is so annoying.

Word: 尿, Pinyin: niào, Meaning: to urinate; urine, Example: 我想去尿尿。, Translation: I want to go pee.

Word: 您, Pinyin: nín, Meaning: you (courteous, as opposed to informal 你), Example: 您好吗？, Translation: How are you?

Word: 牛, Pinyin: Niú, Meaning: surname Niu, Example: 牛老师来了。, Translation: Teacher Niu is here.

Word: 牛奶, Pinyin: niú nǎi, Meaning: cow's milk, Example: 我想喝牛奶。, Translation: I want to drink milk.

Word: 农民, Pinyin: nóng mín, Meaning: peasant; farmer, Example: 我爸爸是农民。, Translation: My father is a farmer.

Word: 弄, Pinyin: lòng, Meaning: lane; alley, Example: 我家住在弄里。, Translation: I live in the alley.

Word: 努力, Pinyin: nǔ lì, Meaning: to make an effort; to try hard; to strive; hard-working; conscientious, Example: 请继续努力。, Translation: Please keep trying hard.

Word: 女, Pinyin: nǚ, Meaning: female; woman; daughter, Example: 她是我的女儿。, Translation: She is my daughter.

Word: 女儿, Pinyin: nǚ ér, Meaning: daughter, Example: 我女儿很乖。, Translation: My daughter is very well-behaved.

Word: 女朋友, Pinyin: nǚ péng you, Meaning: girlfriend, Example: 我女朋友很漂亮。, Translation: My girlfriend is very pretty.

Word: 女人, Pinyin: nǚ rén, Meaning: woman, Example: 那个女人很漂亮。, Translation: That woman is very pretty.

Word: 女生, Pinyin: nǚ shēng, Meaning: schoolgirl; female student; girl, Example: 那个女生是我同学。, Translation: That girl is my classmate.

Word: 女士, Pinyin: nǚ shì, Meaning: lady; madam; Miss; Ms, Example: 这位女士请坐。, Translation: Madam, please take a seat.

Word: 女性, Pinyin: nǚ xìng, Meaning: woman; the female sex, Example: 很多女性喜欢旅行。, Translation: Many women like traveling.

Word: 女子, Pinyin: nǚ zǐ, Meaning: woman; female, Example: 那位女子很漂亮。, Translation: That woman is very pretty.

Word: 暖, Pinyin: nuǎn, Meaning: old variant of 暖, Example: 天气真暖。, Translation: The weather is really warm.

Word: 哦, Pinyin: é, Meaning: to chant, Example: 我喜欢哦诗。, Translation: I like to chant poems.

Word: 欧洲, Pinyin: Oū zhōu, Meaning: Europe (abbr. for 欧罗巴洲), Example: 我想去欧洲。, Translation: I want to go to Europe.

Word: 偶尔, Pinyin: ǒu ěr, Meaning: occasionally; once in a while; sometimes, Example: 我偶尔喝咖啡。, Translation: I occasionally drink coffee.

Word: 偶像, Pinyin: ǒu xiàng, Meaning: idol, Example: 他是我的偶像。, Translation: He is my idol.

Word: 爬, Pinyin: pá, Meaning: to crawl; to climb; to get up or sit up, Example: 小猫爬上树了。, Translation: The cat climbed the tree.

Word: 怕, Pinyin: Pà, Meaning: surname Pa, Example: 我怕黑。, Translation: I am afraid of the dark.

Word: 拍, Pinyin: pāi, Meaning: to pat; to clap; to slap; to swat; to take (a photo); to shoot (a film); racket (sports); beat (music), Example: 请帮我拍个照。, Translation: Please take a photo for me.

Word: 拍摄, Pinyin: pāi shè, Meaning: to take (a picture); to shoot (a film), Example: 我在拍摄照片。, Translation: I am taking photos.

Word: 拍照, Pinyin: pāi zhào, Meaning: to take a picture, Example: 请帮我拍照。, Translation: Please take a picture for me.

Word: 排, Pinyin: pái, Meaning: a row; a line; to set in order; to arrange; to line up; to eliminate; to drain; to push open; platoon; raft; classifier for lines, rows etc, Example: 我们排成一队吧。, Translation: Let's line up in a row.

Word: 排除, Pinyin: pái chú, Meaning: to eliminate; to remove; to exclude; to rule out, Example: 先排除干扰。, Translation: Rule out distractions first.

Word: 牌, Pinyin: pái, Meaning: mahjong tile; playing card; game pieces; signboard; plate; tablet; medal, Example: 他抽到一张牌。, Translation: He drew a card.

Word: 派, Pinyin: pài, Meaning: clique; school; group; faction; to dispatch; to send; to assign; to appoint; pi (Greek letter Ππ); the circular ratio pi = 3.1415926; (loanword) pie, Example: 公司派他出差。, Translation: The company sent him on a business trip.

Word: 盘, Pinyin: pán, Meaning: plate; dish; tray; board; hard drive (computing); to build; to coil; to check; to examine; to transfer (property); to make over; classifier for food: dish, helping; to coil; classifier for coils of wire; classifier for games of chess, Example: 这盘菜真好吃。, Translation: This dish is really delicious.

Word: 判, Pinyin: pàn, Meaning: to judge; to sentence; to discriminate; to discern; clearly distinguishable, Example: 这事不好判。, Translation: It is hard to judge.

Word: 判断, Pinyin: pàn duàn, Meaning: to judge; to determine; judgment, Example: 这很难判断。, Translation: It's hard to judge.

Word: 判决, Pinyin: pàn jué, Meaning: judgment (by a court of law); to pass judgment on; to sentence, Example: 法院今天下判决。, Translation: The court will give the verdict today.

Word: 旁, Pinyin: páng, Meaning: one side; other; different; lateral component of a Chinese character (such as 刂, 亻 etc), Example: 我坐在旁边。, Translation: I sit on the side.

Word: 旁边, Pinyin: páng biān, Meaning: side; adjacent place, Example: 我坐在旁边。, Translation: I'm sitting on the side.

Word: 胖, Pinyin: pán, Meaning: healthy; at ease, Example: 他最近变胖了。, Translation: He has gotten a bit chubby lately.

Word: 抛, Pinyin: pāo, Meaning: to throw; to toss; to fling; to cast; to abandon, Example: 他把球抛给我。, Translation: He threw the ball to me.

Word: 跑, Pinyin: páo, Meaning: (of an animal) to paw (the ground), Example: 马跑地。, Translation: The horse paws the ground.

Word: 泡, Pinyin: pāo, Meaning: puffed; swollen; spongy; small lake (esp. in place names); classifier for urine or feces, Example: 我们去那个小泡吧。, Translation: Let's go to that small lake.

Word: 陪, Pinyin: péi, Meaning: to accompany; to keep sb company; to assist; old variant of 赔, Example: 我陪你吃饭。, Translation: I'll eat with you.

Word: 培训, Pinyin: péi xùn, Meaning: to cultivate; to train; to groom; training, Example: 明天有培训吗？, Translation: Is there training tomorrow?

Word: 培养, Pinyin: péi yǎng, Meaning: to cultivate; to breed; to foster; to nurture; to educate; to groom (for a position); education; fostering; culture (biology), Example: 父母培养孩子。, Translation: Parents nurture children.

Word: 赔偿, Pinyin: péi cháng, Meaning: to compensate, Example: 请赔偿我的损失。, Translation: Please compensate for my loss.

Word: 配, Pinyin: pèi, Meaning: to join; to fit; to mate; to mix; to match; to deserve; to make up (a prescription); to allocate, Example: 衣服很配你。, Translation: The clothes suit you well.

Word: 配合, Pinyin: pèi hé, Meaning: matching; fitting in with; compatible with; to correspond; to fit; to conform to; rapport; to coordinate with; to act in concert with; to cooperate; to become man and wife; to combine parts of machine, Example: 请配合一下。, Translation: Please cooperate.

Word: 喷, Pinyin: pēn, Meaning: to puff; to spout; to spray; to spurt, Example: 水从管子里喷出来。, Translation: Water is spraying out of the pipe.

Word: 朋友, Pinyin: péng you, Meaning: friend, Example: 他是我的朋友。, Translation: He is my friend.

Word: 碰, Pinyin: pèng, Meaning: variant of 碰, Example: 别碰我的电脑。, Translation: Don't touch my computer.

Word: 碰到, Pinyin: pèng dào, Meaning: to come across; to run into; to meet; to hit, Example: 昨天碰到你了。, Translation: I ran into you yesterday.

Word: 批, Pinyin: pī, Meaning: to ascertain; to act on; to criticize; to pass on; classifier for batches, lots, military flights; tier (for the ranking of universities and colleges), Example: 我买了一批书。, Translation: I bought a batch of books.

Word: 批评, Pinyin: pī píng, Meaning: to criticize; criticism, Example: 老师批评了我。, Translation: The teacher criticized me.

Word: 批准, Pinyin: pī zhǔn, Meaning: to approve; to ratify, Example: 请批准我的申请。, Translation: Please approve my application.

Word: 皮, Pinyin: Pí, Meaning: surname Pi, Example: 我朋友姓皮。, Translation: My friend's surname is Pi.

Word: 皮肤, Pinyin: pí fū, Meaning: skin, Example: 我的皮肤很干。, Translation: My skin is very dry.

Word: 啤酒, Pinyin: pí jiǔ, Meaning: beer (loanword), Example: 我想喝啤酒。, Translation: I want to drink beer.

Word: 匹, Pinyin: pī, Meaning: mate; one of a pair, Example: 找匹合适的。, Translation: Find a suitable mate.

Word: 屁股, Pinyin: pì gu, Meaning: buttocks; bottom; butt; back part, Example: 我摔到屁股了。, Translation: I fell on my butt.

Word: 偏, Pinyin: piān, Meaning: to lean; to slant; oblique; prejudiced; to deviate from average; to stray from the intended line; stubbornly; contrary to expectations, Example: 衣服偏小了。, Translation: The clothes are a bit small.

Word: 篇, Pinyin: piān, Meaning: sheet; piece of writing; bound set of bamboo slips used for record keeping (old); classifier for written items: chapter, article, Example: 我写了一篇作文。, Translation: I wrote an essay.

Word: 片, Pinyin: piān, Meaning: disk; sheet, Example: 请给我一片纸。, Translation: Please give me a sheet of paper.

Word: 骗, Pinyin: piàn, Meaning: to cheat; to swindle; to deceive; to get on (a horse etc) by swinging one leg over, Example: 别骗我。, Translation: Don't lie to me.

Word: 票, Pinyin: piào, Meaning: ticket; ballot; banknote; person held for ransom; amateur performance of Chinese opera; classifier for groups, batches, business transactions, Example: 我有一张票。, Translation: I have a ticket.

Word: 漂亮, Pinyin: piào liang, Meaning: pretty; beautiful, Example: 这花真漂亮。, Translation: This flower is really beautiful.

Word: 拼, Pinyin: pīn, Meaning: to piece together; to join together; to stake all; adventurous; at the risk of one's life; to spell, Example: 拼一把吧！, Translation: Let's give it a shot!

Word: 频道, Pinyin: pín dào, Meaning: frequency; (television) channel, Example: 换个频道吧。, Translation: Let's change the channel.

Word: 品, Pinyin: pǐn, Meaning: (bound form) article; commodity; product; goods; (bound form) grade; rank; kind; type; variety; character; disposition; nature; temperament; to taste sth; to sample; to criticize; to comment; to judge; to size up; fret (on a guitar or lute), Example: 我在品茶。, Translation: I am tasting tea.

Word: 品牌, Pinyin: pǐn pái, Meaning: brand name; trademark, Example: 这个品牌很好。, Translation: This brand is very good.

Word: 平, Pinyin: Píng, Meaning: surname Ping, Example: 我姓平。, Translation: My surname is Ping.

Word: 平安, Pinyin: píng ān, Meaning: safe and sound; well; without mishap; quiet and safe; at peace, Example: 祝你一路平安。, Translation: Wish you a safe journey.

Word: 平衡, Pinyin: píng héng, Meaning: balance; equilibrium, Example: 生活需要平衡。, Translation: Life needs balance.

Word: 平静, Pinyin: píng jìng, Meaning: tranquil; undisturbed; serene, Example: 湖面很平静。, Translation: The lake is very tranquil.

Word: 平均, Pinyin: píng jūn, Meaning: average; on average; evenly; in equal proportions, Example: 平均价格是多少？, Translation: What is the average price?

Word: 平时, Pinyin: píng shí, Meaning: ordinarily; in normal times; in peacetime, Example: 平时你几点起床？, Translation: What time do you usually wake up?

Word: 评估, Pinyin: píng gū, Meaning: to evaluate; to assess; assessment; evaluation, Example: 请评估这个方案。, Translation: Please evaluate this plan.

Word: 评价, Pinyin: píng jià, Meaning: to evaluate; to assess, Example: 请评价一下。, Translation: Please evaluate this.

Word: 评论, Pinyin: píng lùn, Meaning: to comment on; to discuss; comment; commentary, Example: 你的评论很棒。, Translation: Your comment is great.

Word: 评委, Pinyin: píng wěi, Meaning: evaluation committee; judging panel; judging panel member; adjudicator (abbr. for 评选委员会委员), Example: 评委是谁？, Translation: Who is the judge?

Word: 凭, Pinyin: píng, Meaning: variant of 凭, Example: 你凭什么这么说？, Translation: Why do you say that?

Word: 苹果, Pinyin: píng guǒ, Meaning: apple, Example: 我喜欢吃苹果。, Translation: I like to eat apples.

Word: 屏幕, Pinyin: píng mù, Meaning: screen (TV, computer or movie), Example: 别一直看屏幕, Translation: Don't keep staring at the screen.

Word: 瓶, Pinyin: píng, Meaning: bottle; vase; pitcher; classifier for wine and liquids, Example: 请给我一瓶水。, Translation: Please give me a bottle of water.

Word: 破, Pinyin: pò, Meaning: broken; damaged; worn out; lousy; rotten; to break, split or cleave; to get rid of; to destroy; to break with; to defeat; to capture (a city etc); to expose the truth of, Example: 衣服破了一个洞。, Translation: The clothes have a hole.

Word: 破坏, Pinyin: pò huài, Meaning: destruction; damage; to wreck; to break; to destroy, Example: 别破坏我的计划。, Translation: Don't ruin my plan.

Word: 普通, Pinyin: pǔ tōng, Meaning: common; ordinary; general; average, Example: 我就是个普通人。, Translation: I am just an ordinary person.

Word: 七, Pinyin: qī, Meaning: seven; 7, Example: 我有七本书。, Translation: I have seven books.

Word: 妻子, Pinyin: qī zǐ, Meaning: wife and children, Example: 我妻子喜欢做饭。, Translation: My wife likes cooking.

Word: 期, Pinyin: qī, Meaning: variant of 期; period; cycle, Example: 假期快到了。, Translation: The holiday is almost here.

Word: 期待, Pinyin: qī dài, Meaning: to look forward to; to await; expectation, Example: 我很期待你的回复。, Translation: I look forward to your reply.

Word: 期间, Pinyin: qī jiān, Meaning: period of time; time; time period; period, Example: 出差期间我很忙。, Translation: I was very busy during the trip.

Word: 期望, Pinyin: qī wàng, Meaning: to have expectations; to earnestly hope; expectation; hope, Example: 我期望你能来。, Translation: I hope you can come.

Word: 齐, Pinyin: Qí, Meaning: (name of states and dynasties at several different periods); surname Qi, Example: 我姓齐。, Translation: My surname is Qi.

Word: 其, Pinyin: qí, Meaning: his; her; its; their; that; such; it (refers to sth preceding it), Example: 其书在桌上。, Translation: His book is on the table.

