Word: 素, Pinyin: sù, Meaning: raw silk; white; plain, unadorned; vegetarian (food); essence; nature; element; constituent; usually; always; ever, Example: 我喜欢吃素。, Translation: I like eating vegetarian food.

Word: 速度, Pinyin: sù dù, Meaning: speed; rate; velocity; (music) tempo, Example: 你的速度真快！, Translation: Your speed is really fast!

Word: 诉讼, Pinyin: sù sòng, Meaning: lawsuit, Example: 我们不想提诉讼。, Translation: We don't want to file a lawsuit.

Word: 酸, Pinyin: suān, Meaning: sour; tart; sick at heart; grieved; sore; aching; pedantic; impractical; to make sarcastic remarks about sb; an acid, Example: 这柠檬真酸。, Translation: This lemon is really sour.

Word: 算, Pinyin: suàn, Meaning: to regard as; to figure; to calculate; to compute, Example: 你算一下多少钱。, Translation: Calculate how much it costs.

Word: 算了, Pinyin: suàn le, Meaning: let it be; let it pass; forget about it, Example: 算了，不去了。, Translation: Forget it, I'm not going.

Word: 算是, Pinyin: suàn shì, Meaning: considered to be; at last, Example: 这算是我的错。, Translation: This is considered my fault.

Word: 虽然, Pinyin: suī rán, Meaning: although; even though (often used correlatively with 是 or 是 etc), Example: 虽然下雨，我不去。, Translation: Although it's raining, I won't go.

Word: 随, Pinyin: Suí, Meaning: surname Sui, Example: 他姓随。, Translation: He is surnamed Sui.

Word: 随便, Pinyin: suí biàn, Meaning: as one wishes; as one pleases; at random; negligent; casual; wanton, Example: 你想吃什么？随便。, Translation: What do you want to eat? Anything is fine.

Word: 随后, Pinyin: suí hòu, Meaning: soon after, Example: 我先吃饭，随后去睡觉。, Translation: I will eat first, then go to sleep.

Word: 随时, Pinyin: suí shí, Meaning: at any time; at all times; at the right time; whenever necessary, Example: 有事随时找我。, Translation: Contact me anytime.

Word: 随意, Pinyin: suí yì, Meaning: as one wishes; according to one's wishes; at will; voluntary; conscious, Example: 座位你随意。, Translation: Sit wherever you like.

Word: 随着, Pinyin: suí zhe, Meaning: along with; in the wake of; following, Example: 随着长大，我懂了。, Translation: As I grew up, I understood.

Word: 岁, Pinyin: suì, Meaning: variant of 岁, year; years old, Example: 我今年三岁。, Translation: I am three years old this year.

Word: 碎, Pinyin: suì, Meaning: (transitive or intransitive verb) to break into pieces; to shatter; to crumble; broken; fragmentary; scattered; garrulous, Example: 杯子碎了。, Translation: The cup broke.

Word: 损伤, Pinyin: sǔn shāng, Meaning: to harm; to damage; to injure; impairment; loss; disability, Example: 吸烟会损伤肺部。, Translation: Smoking damages the lungs.

Word: 损失, Pinyin: sǔn shī, Meaning: loss; damage; to lose; to suffer damage, Example: 这次损失很大。, Translation: The loss this time is huge.

Word: 所, Pinyin: suǒ, Meaning: actually; place; classifier for houses, small buildings, institutions etc; that which; particle introducing a relative clause or passive, Example: 这是一所学校。, Translation: This is a school.

Word: 所谓, Pinyin: suǒ wèi, Meaning: so-called; what is called, Example: 所谓的专家也不一定对。, Translation: So-called experts aren't always right.

Word: 所以, Pinyin: suǒ yǐ, Meaning: therefore; as a result; so; the reason why, Example: 他病了，所以没来。, Translation: He was sick, so he didn't come.

Word: 所有, Pinyin: suǒ yǒu, Meaning: all; to have; to possess; to own, Example: 所有人都在吗？, Translation: Is everyone here?

Word: 所在, Pinyin: suǒ zài, Meaning: place; location; (after a noun) place where it is located, Example: 公司的所在在市区。, Translation: The company's location is in the city.

Word: 锁, Pinyin: suǒ, Meaning: to lock; to lock up; a lock, Example: 请锁门。, Translation: Please lock the door.

Word: 他, Pinyin: tā, Meaning: he; him (used for either sex when the sex is unknown or unimportant); (used before sb's name for emphasis); (used as a meaningless mock object); (literary) other, Example: 他是我朋友。, Translation: He is my friend.

Word: 他们, Pinyin: tā men, Meaning: they, Example: 他们去学校。, Translation: They go to school.

Word: 他人, Pinyin: tā rén, Meaning: another person; sb else; other people, Example: 请尊重他人。, Translation: Please respect others.

Word: 它, Pinyin: tā, Meaning: it, Example: 我喜欢它。, Translation: I like it.

Word: 它们, Pinyin: tā men, Meaning: they (for inanimate objects), Example: 它们在桌子上。, Translation: They are on the table.

Word: 她, Pinyin: tā, Meaning: she, Example: 她喜欢唱歌。, Translation: She likes to sing.

Word: 她们, Pinyin: tā men, Meaning: they; them (for females), Example: 她们是我的朋友。, Translation: They are my friends.

Word: 塔, Pinyin: tǎ, Meaning: pagoda; tower; minaret; stupa (abbr. loanword from Sanskrit tapo), Example: 我们去看那座塔。, Translation: We are going to see that tower.

Word: 踏, Pinyin: tā, Meaning: see 踏实, Example: 他做事很踏实。, Translation: He works very reliably.

Word: 台, Pinyin: Tái, Meaning: Taiwan (abbr.); surname Tai, Example: 我朋友姓台。, Translation: My friend's surname is Tai.

Word: 抬, Pinyin: tái, Meaning: to lift; to raise; (of two or more persons) to carry, Example: 请帮我抬箱子。, Translation: Please help me lift the box.

Word: 太, Pinyin: tài, Meaning: highest; greatest; too (much); very; extremely, Example: 今天太热了。, Translation: It is too hot today.

Word: 太空, Pinyin: tài kōng, Meaning: outer space, Example: 我想去太空。, Translation: I want to go to outer space.

Word: 太太, Pinyin: tài tai, Meaning: married woman; Mrs.; Madam; wife, Example: 我太太在家。, Translation: My wife is at home.

Word: 太阳, Pinyin: tài yang, Meaning: sun; abbr. for 太阳穴, Example: 太阳出来了。, Translation: The sun is out.

Word: 态度, Pinyin: tài du, Meaning: manner; bearing; attitude; approach, Example: 他的态度很好。, Translation: His attitude is very good.

Word: 谈, Pinyin: Tán, Meaning: surname Tan, Example: 谈老师来了。, Translation: Teacher Tan is here.

Word: 谈话, Pinyin: tán huà, Meaning: to talk (with sb); to have a conversation; talk; conversation, Example: 我想和你谈话。, Translation: I want to have a conversation with you.

Word: 谈判, Pinyin: tán pàn, Meaning: to negotiate; negotiation; talks; conference, Example: 我们去谈判吧。, Translation: Let's go negotiate.

Word: 探, Pinyin: tàn, Meaning: to explore; to search out; to scout; to visit; to stretch forward, Example: 我想去探险。, Translation: I want to go exploring.

Word: 汤, Pinyin: Tāng, Meaning: surname Tang, Example: 汤先生来了。, Translation: Mr. Tang is here.

Word: 堂, Pinyin: táng, Meaning: (main) hall; large room for a specific purpose; relationship between cousins etc on the paternal side of a family; of the same clan; classifier for classes, lectures etc; classifier for sets of furniture, Example: 今天有三堂课。, Translation: There are three classes today.

Word: 糖, Pinyin: táng, Meaning: sugar; sweets; candy, Example: 我喜欢吃糖。, Translation: I like eating candy.

Word: 躺, Pinyin: tǎng, Meaning: to recline; to lie down, Example: 我想躺一会儿。, Translation: I want to lie down for a while.

Word: 趟, Pinyin: tāng, Meaning: old variant of 趟, Example: 我去一趟。, Translation: I will go there.

Word: 逃, Pinyin: táo, Meaning: to escape; to run away; to flee, Example: 他逃走了。, Translation: He ran away.

Word: 淘汰, Pinyin: táo tài, Meaning: to wash out; (fig.) to cull; to weed out; to eliminate; to die out; to phase out, Example: 旧手机被淘汰了。, Translation: Old phones are phased out.

Word: 讨论, Pinyin: tǎo lùn, Meaning: to discuss; to talk over, Example: 我们讨论一下。, Translation: Let's discuss it.

Word: 讨厌, Pinyin: tǎo yàn, Meaning: to dislike; to loathe; disagreeable; troublesome; annoying, Example: 我讨厌下雨。, Translation: I hate rain.

Word: 套, Pinyin: tào, Meaning: to cover; to encase; cover; sheath; to overlap; to interleave; to model after; to copy; formula; harness; loop of rope; (fig.) to fish for; to obtain slyly; classifier for sets, collections; bend (of a river or mountain range, in place names); tau (Greek letter Ττ), Example: 我买了一套书。, Translation: I bought a set of books.

Word: 特, Pinyin: tè, Meaning: special; unique; distinguished; especially; unusual; very; abbr. for 斯, tex, Example: 我特想去。, Translation: I really want to go.

Word: 特别, Pinyin: tè bié, Meaning: unusual; special; very; especially; particularly; expressly; for a specific purpose; (often followed by 是) in particular, Example: 我今天特别开心。, Translation: I'm very happy today.

Word: 特殊, Pinyin: tè shū, Meaning: special; particular; unusual; extraordinary, Example: 这是特殊情况。, Translation: This is a special situation.

Word: 特征, Pinyin: tè zhēng, Meaning: characteristic; diagnostic property; distinctive feature; trait, Example: 他的特征是爱笑。, Translation: His trait is loving to smile.

Word: 疼, Pinyin: téng, Meaning: (it) hurts; sore; to love dearly, Example: 我肚子疼。, Translation: My stomach hurts.

Word: 疼痛, Pinyin: téng tòng, Meaning: pain; (of a body part) to be painful; to be sore; to hurt; (of a person) to be in pain, Example: 我的头有点疼痛。, Translation: My head hurts a little.

Word: 踢, Pinyin: tī, Meaning: to kick; to play (e.g. soccer); (slang) butch (in a lesbian relationship), Example: 我们去踢足球吧。, Translation: Let's go play soccer.

Word: 提, Pinyin: dī, Meaning: used in 防 and 溜, Example: 出门要提防小偷。, Translation: Be careful of pickpockets when going out.

Word: 提出, Pinyin: tí chū, Meaning: to raise (an issue); to propose; to put forward; to suggest; to post (on a website); to withdraw (cash), Example: 他提出了一个好主意。, Translation: He proposed a good idea.

Word: 提到, Pinyin: tí dào, Meaning: to mention; to raise (a subject); to refer to, Example: 他提到明天开会。, Translation: He mentioned tomorrow's meeting.

Word: 提高, Pinyin: tí gāo, Meaning: to raise; to increase; to improve, Example: 我要提高成绩。, Translation: I want to improve my grades.

Word: 提供, Pinyin: tí gōng, Meaning: to offer; to supply; to provide; to furnish, Example: 公司提供免费午餐。, Translation: The company provides free lunch.

Word: 提起, Pinyin: tí qǐ, Meaning: to mention; to speak of; to lift; to pick up; to arouse; to raise (a topic, a heavy weight, one's fist, one's spirits etc), Example: 你提起过他吗？, Translation: Have you mentioned him?

Word: 提前, Pinyin: tí qián, Meaning: to shift to an earlier date; to do sth ahead of time; in advance, Example: 我们提前走吧。, Translation: Let's leave early.

Word: 提升, Pinyin: tí shēng, Meaning: to promote (to a higher-ranking position); to lift; to hoist; (fig.) to elevate; to raise; to improve, Example: 我想提升自己的能力。, Translation: I want to improve my skills.

Word: 提示, Pinyin: tí shì, Meaning: to point out; to remind (sb of sth); to suggest; suggestion; tip; reminder; notice, Example: 谢谢你的提示。, Translation: Thanks for your tip.

Word: 提醒, Pinyin: tí xǐng, Meaning: to remind; to call attention to; to warn of, Example: 请提醒我明天开会。, Translation: Please remind me about tomorrow's meeting.

Word: 题, Pinyin: Tí, Meaning: surname Ti, Example: 这道题很难。, Translation: This question is very hard.

Word: 体会, Pinyin: tǐ huì, Meaning: to know from experience; to learn through experience; to realize; understanding; experience, Example: 你会有体会的。, Translation: You'll come to understand through experience.

Word: 体验, Pinyin: tǐ yàn, Meaning: to experience for oneself, Example: 我想亲自体验。, Translation: I want to experience it myself.

Word: 体育, Pinyin: tǐ yù, Meaning: sports; physical education, Example: 我喜欢体育。, Translation: I like sports.

Word: 替, Pinyin: tì, Meaning: to substitute for; to take the place of; to replace; for; on behalf of; to stand in for, Example: 我替你去吧。, Translation: I'll go for you.

Word: 天, Pinyin: tiān, Meaning: day; sky; heaven, Example: 今天天气很好。, Translation: The weather is very nice today.

Word: 天空, Pinyin: tiān kōng, Meaning: sky, Example: 我喜欢看天空。, Translation: I like looking at the sky.

Word: 天气, Pinyin: tiān qì, Meaning: weather, Example: 今天天气很好。, Translation: The weather is great today.

Word: 天使, Pinyin: tiān shǐ, Meaning: angel, Example: 你是我的小天使。, Translation: You are my little angel.

Word: 天堂, Pinyin: tiān táng, Meaning: paradise; heaven, Example: 这里就是天堂。, Translation: This place is paradise.

Word: 天下, Pinyin: tiān xià, Meaning: land under heaven; the whole world; the whole of China; realm; rule, Example: 天下真大啊！, Translation: The world is really big!

Word: 田, Pinyin: Tián, Meaning: surname Tian, Example: 我姓田。, Translation: My surname is Tian.

Word: 甜, Pinyin: tián, Meaning: sweet, Example: 这苹果很甜。, Translation: This apple is very sweet.

Word: 挑, Pinyin: tiāo, Meaning: to carry on a shoulder pole; to choose; to pick; to nitpick, Example: 你挑一件吧。, Translation: You pick one.

Word: 挑战, Pinyin: tiǎo zhàn, Meaning: to challenge; challenge, Example: 我想挑战你。, Translation: I want to challenge you.

Word: 条, Pinyin: tiáo, Meaning: strip; item; article; clause (of law or treaty); classifier for long thin things (ribbon, river, road, trousers etc), Example: 我买了一条裤子。, Translation: I bought a pair of trousers.

Word: 条件, Pinyin: tiáo jiàn, Meaning: condition; circumstance; term; factor; requirement; prerequisite; qualification; situation; state; condition, Example: 你有什么条件？, Translation: What are the conditions?

Word: 跳, Pinyin: tiào, Meaning: to jump; to hop; to skip over; to bounce; to palpitate, Example: 他跳得很高。, Translation: He jumps very high.

Word: 跳舞, Pinyin: tiào wǔ, Meaning: to dance, Example: 我喜欢跳舞。, Translation: I like to dance.

Word: 贴, Pinyin: tiē, Meaning: to stick; to paste; to post (e.g. on a blog); to keep close to; to fit snugly; to subsidize; allowance (e.g. money for food or housing); sticker; classifier for sticking plaster: strip, Example: 我在墙上贴了海报。, Translation: I pasted a poster on the wall.

Word: 铁, Pinyin: Tiě, Meaning: surname Tie, Example: 我姓铁。, Translation: My surname is Tie.

Word: 厅, Pinyin: tīng, Meaning: (reception) hall; living room; office; provincial government department, Example: 我们在客厅看电视。, Translation: We watch TV in the living room.

Word: 听, Pinyin: yǐn, Meaning: smile (archaic), Example: 请仔细听。, Translation: Please listen carefully.

Word: 听到, Pinyin: tīng dào, Meaning: to hear, Example: 你听到音乐了吗？, Translation: Did you hear the music?

Word: 听见, Pinyin: tīng jiàn, Meaning: to hear, Example: 你听见了吗？, Translation: Did you hear that?

Word: 听说, Pinyin: tīng shuō, Meaning: to hear (sth said); one hears (that); hearsay; listening and speaking, Example: 听说你要来。, Translation: I heard you're coming.

Word: 停, Pinyin: tíng, Meaning: to stop; to halt; to park (a car), Example: 请在这里停。, Translation: Please stop here.

Word: 停车, Pinyin: tíng chē, Meaning: to pull up (stop one's vehicle); to park; (of a machine) to stop working; to stall, Example: 前面可以停车吗？, Translation: Can I park in front?

Word: 停下, Pinyin: tíng xià, Meaning: to stop, Example: 请停下吧。, Translation: Please stop.

Word: 停止, Pinyin: tíng zhǐ, Meaning: to stop; to halt; to cease, Example: 请停止说话。, Translation: Please stop talking.

Word: 挺, Pinyin: tǐng, Meaning: straight; erect; to stick out (a part of the body); to (physically) straighten up; to support; to withstand; outstanding; (coll.) quite; very; classifier for machine guns, Example: 今天天气挺好的。, Translation: The weather is quite nice today.

Word: 通, Pinyin: tōng, Meaning: to go through; to know well; (suffix) expert; to connect; to communicate; open; to clear; classifier for letters, telegrams, phone calls etc, Example: 网不通了。, Translation: The internet isn't connecting.

Word: 通常, Pinyin: tōng cháng, Meaning: regular; usual; normal; usually; normally, Example: 我通常七点起床。, Translation: I usually wake up at seven.

Word: 通道, Pinyin: Tōng dào, Meaning: Tongdao Dong autonomous county in Huaihua 怀化, Hunan, Example: 请走安全通道。, Translation: Please use the safety passage.

Word: 通过, Pinyin: tōng guò, Meaning: to pass through; to get through; to adopt (a resolution); to pass (legislation); to pass (a test); by means of; through; via, Example: 我通过了考试。, Translation: I passed the test.

Word: 通讯, Pinyin: tōng xùn, Meaning: communications; news story; dispatch, Example: 我们靠手机通讯。, Translation: We communicate via mobile phones.

Word: 通知, Pinyin: tōng zhī, Meaning: to notify; to inform; notice; notification, Example: 我会通知你。, Translation: I will notify you.

Word: 同, Pinyin: tóng, Meaning: like; same; similar; together; alike; with, Example: 我们同班。, Translation: We are in the same class.

Word: 同时, Pinyin: tóng shí, Meaning: at the same time; simultaneously, Example: 我们同时出发吧。, Translation: Let's leave at the same time.

Word: 同事, Pinyin: tóng shì, Meaning: colleague; co-worker, Example: 我的同事很友好。, Translation: My colleague is very friendly.

Word: 同学, Pinyin: tóng xué, Meaning: to study at the same school; fellow student; classmate, Example: 他是我的同学。, Translation: He is my classmate.

Word: 同样, Pinyin: tóng yàng, Meaning: same; equal; equivalent, Example: 我们同样喜欢音乐。, Translation: We both like music equally.

Word: 同意, Pinyin: tóng yì, Meaning: to agree; to consent; to approve, Example: 我完全同意。, Translation: I completely agree.

Word: 同志, Pinyin: tóng zhì, Meaning: comrade; (slang) homosexual, Example: 你好，同志。, Translation: Hello, comrade.

Word: 统计, Pinyin: tǒng jì, Meaning: statistics; to count; to add up, Example: 请统计一下人数。, Translation: Please count the number of people.

Word: 统一, Pinyin: tǒng yī, Meaning: to unify; to integrate; unified; integrated, Example: 我们统一意见吧。, Translation: Let's all agree on the same thing.

Word: 桶, Pinyin: tǒng, Meaning: bucket; (trash) can; barrel (of oil etc), Example: 请给我一桶水。, Translation: Please give me a bucket of water.

Word: 痛, Pinyin: tòng, Meaning: ache; pain; sorrow; deeply; thoroughly, Example: 我肚子痛。, Translation: I have a stomachache.

Word: 痛苦, Pinyin: tòng kǔ, Meaning: pain; suffering; painful, Example: 心里真痛苦。, Translation: I feel so much pain inside.

Word: 偷, Pinyin: tōu, Meaning: to steal; to pilfer; to snatch; thief; stealthily, Example: 他偷了我的钱。, Translation: He stole my money.

Word: 头, Pinyin: tóu, Meaning: head; hair style; the top; end; beginning or end; a stub; remnant; chief; boss; side; aspect; first; leading; classifier for pigs or livestock, Example: 我头疼。, Translation: My head hurts.

Word: 头部, Pinyin: tóu bù, Meaning: head, Example: 你的头部还好吗？, Translation: Is your head okay?

Word: 头发, Pinyin: tóu fa, Meaning: hair (on the head), Example: 你的头发很长。, Translation: Your hair is very long.

Word: 投, Pinyin: tóu, Meaning: to cast; to send; to throw oneself (into the river etc); to seek refuge; to place oneself into the hands of, Example: 你投票了吗？, Translation: Did you cast your vote?

Word: 投票, Pinyin: tóu piào, Meaning: to vote; vote, Example: 我们一起投票吧。, Translation: Let's vote together.

Word: 投入, Pinyin: tóu rù, Meaning: to throw into; to put into; to throw oneself into; to participate in; to invest in; absorbed; engrossed, Example: 他投入了全部精力。, Translation: He devoted all his energy.

Word: 投诉, Pinyin: tóu sù, Meaning: complaint; to complain; to register a complaint (esp. as a customer), Example: 我要投诉这家店。, Translation: I want to complain about this store.

Word: 投资, Pinyin: tóu zī, Meaning: investment; to invest, Example: 我想投资。, Translation: I want to invest.

Word: 透, Pinyin: tòu, Meaning: (bound form) to penetrate; to seep through; to tell secretly; to leak; thoroughly; through and through; to appear; to show, Example: 衣服湿透了。, Translation: The clothes are completely soaked through.

Word: 透露, Pinyin: tòu lù, Meaning: to leak out; to divulge; to reveal, Example: 他透露了消息。, Translation: He revealed the news.

Word: 突出, Pinyin: tū chū, Meaning: prominent; outstanding; to give prominence to; to protrude; to project, Example: 他的成绩很突出。, Translation: His grades are very outstanding.

Word: 突破, Pinyin: tū pò, Meaning: to break through; to make a breakthrough; to surmount (an obstacle); (sports) to break through the opponent's defense, Example: 我们突破了纪录。, Translation: We broke the record.

Word: 突然, Pinyin: tū rán, Meaning: sudden; abrupt; unexpected, Example: 他突然走了。, Translation: He suddenly left.

Word: 图, Pinyin: tú, Meaning: diagram; picture; drawing; chart; map; to plan; to scheme; to attempt; to pursue; to seek, Example: 请看这张图。, Translation: Please look at this picture.

Word: 图片, Pinyin: tú piàn, Meaning: picture; photograph, Example: 我喜欢这张图片。, Translation: I like this picture.

Word: 图书馆, Pinyin: tú shū guǎn, Meaning: library, Example: 我们去图书馆吧。, Translation: Let's go to the library.

Word: 土, Pinyin: Tǔ, Meaning: Tu (ethnic group); surname Tu, Example: 他姓土。, Translation: He is surnamed Tu.

Word: 土地, Pinyin: tǔ dì, Meaning: land; soil; territory, Example: 我们有一块土地。, Translation: We have a piece of land.

Word: 吐, Pinyin: tǔ, Meaning: to spit; to send out (silk from a silkworm, bolls from cotton flowers etc); to say; to pour out (one's grievances), Example: 别随地吐痰。, Translation: Don't spit on the ground.

Word: 涂, Pinyin: tú, Meaning: to apply (paint etc); to smear; to daub; to blot out; to scribble; to scrawl; (literary) mud; street, Example: 请涂点胶水。, Translation: Please apply some glue.

Word: 团, Pinyin: tuán, Meaning: round; lump; ball; to roll into a ball; to gather; regiment; group; society; classifier for a lump or a soft mass: wad (of paper), ball (of wool), cloud (of smoke), Example: 他把纸揉成一团。, Translation: He rolled the paper into a ball.

Word: 团队, Pinyin: tuán duì, Meaning: team, Example: 我们团队很棒。, Translation: Our team is great.

Word: 团结, Pinyin: tuán jié, Meaning: to unite; unity; solidarity; united, Example: 大家很团结。, Translation: Everyone is very united.

Word: 团体, Pinyin: tuán tǐ, Meaning: group; organization; team, Example: 我们是志愿者团体。, Translation: We are a volunteer group.

Word: 推, Pinyin: tuī, Meaning: to push; to cut; to refuse; to reject; to decline; to shirk (responsibility); to put off; to delay; to push forward; to nominate; to elect; massage, Example: 请你推开门。, Translation: Please push the door open.

Word: 推荐, Pinyin: tuī jiàn, Meaning: to recommend; recommendation, Example: 我推荐这本书。, Translation: I recommend this book.

Word: 推进, Pinyin: tuī jìn, Meaning: to impel; to carry forward; to push on; to advance; to drive forward, Example: 我们推进项目。, Translation: We are advancing the project.

Word: 腿, Pinyin: tuǐ, Meaning: leg, Example: 我的腿很痛。, Translation: My leg hurts.

Word: 退, Pinyin: tuì, Meaning: to retreat; to withdraw; to reject; to return (sth); to decline, Example: 我想退货。, Translation: I want to return this item.

Word: 退出, Pinyin: tuì chū, Meaning: to withdraw; to abort; to quit; to log out (computing), Example: 我想退出群聊。, Translation: I want to quit the group chat.

Word: 退休, Pinyin: tuì xiū, Meaning: to retire (from the workforce); to go into retirement, Example: 我想早点退休。, Translation: I want to retire early.

Word: 托, Pinyin: tuō, Meaning: prop; support (for weight); rest (e.g. arm rest); thanks to; to hold in one's hand; to support in one's palm; to give; to base; to commit; to set; torr (unit of pressure), Example: 他用手托着下巴。, Translation: He rests his chin on his hand.

Word: 拖, Pinyin: tuō, Meaning: variant of 拖, Example: 我明天拖地。, Translation: I will mop the floor tomorrow.

Word: 脱, Pinyin: tuō, Meaning: to shed; to take off; to escape; to get away from, Example: 我脱了外套。, Translation: I took off my jacket.

Word: 挖, Pinyin: wā, Meaning: to dig; to excavate; to scoop out, Example: 他在挖坑。, Translation: He is digging a hole.

Word: 瓦, Pinyin: wǎ, Meaning: roof tile; abbr. for 特, Example: 这是一片瓦。, Translation: This is a roof tile.

Word: 哇, Pinyin: wā, Meaning: Wow!; sound of a child's crying; sound of vomiting, Example: 哇，好漂亮！, Translation: Wow, so beautiful!

Word: 外, Pinyin: wài, Meaning: outside; in addition; foreign; external, Example: 我在外面等你。, Translation: I'm waiting for you outside.

Word: 外面, Pinyin: wài miàn, Meaning: outside (also pr. [wài mian] for this sense); surface; exterior; external appearance, Example: 外面下雨了。, Translation: It's raining outside.

Word: 外套, Pinyin: wài tào, Meaning: coat; jacket, Example: 记得带外套哦。, Translation: Remember to bring a coat.

Word: 完, Pinyin: wán, Meaning: to finish; to be over; whole; complete; entire, Example: 我写完作业了。, Translation: I finished my homework.

Word: 完毕, Pinyin: wán bì, Meaning: to finish; to end; to complete, Example: 任务完毕，可以走了。, Translation: Task done, we can leave.

Word: 完成, Pinyin: wán chéng, Meaning: to complete; to accomplish, Example: 我完成了作业。, Translation: I finished my homework.

Word: 完美, Pinyin: wán měi, Meaning: perfect, Example: 这个设计真完美。, Translation: This design is really perfect.

Word: 完全, Pinyin: wán quán, Meaning: complete; whole; totally; entirely, Example: 我完全同意。, Translation: I completely agree.

Word: 完整, Pinyin: wán zhěng, Meaning: complete; intact, Example: 他的回答很完整。, Translation: His answer is very complete.

Word: 玩, Pinyin: wán, Meaning: to play; to have fun; to trifle with; toy; sth used for amusement; curio or antique (Taiwan pr. [wàn]); to keep sth for entertainment, Example: 我们出去玩吧。, Translation: Let's go out and play.

Word: 玩具, Pinyin: wán jù, Meaning: plaything; toy, Example: 我喜欢这个玩具。, Translation: I like this toy.

Word: 晚, Pinyin: wǎn, Meaning: evening; night; late, Example: 今晚吃什么？, Translation: What are we eating tonight?

Word: 晚安, Pinyin: wǎn ān, Meaning: Good night!; Good evening!, Example: 晚安，好梦。, Translation: Good night, sweet dreams.

Word: 晚餐, Pinyin: wǎn cān, Meaning: evening meal; dinner, Example: 晚餐吃什么？, Translation: What's for dinner?

Word: 晚饭, Pinyin: wǎn fàn, Meaning: evening meal; dinner; supper, Example: 晚饭吃什么？, Translation: What's for dinner?

Word: 晚会, Pinyin: wǎn huì, Meaning: evening party, Example: 我们今晚去晚会。, Translation: We are going to the evening party tonight.

Word: 晚上, Pinyin: wǎn shang, Meaning: evening; night; in the evening, Example: 我们晚上见。, Translation: See you tonight.

Word: 碗, Pinyin: wǎn, Meaning: variant of 碗, Example: 请给我一碗面。, Translation: Please give me a bowl of noodles.

Word: 万, Pinyin: mò, Meaning: used in 俟, Example: 我有一万块钱。, Translation: I have ten thousand yuan.

Word: 万一, Pinyin: wàn yī, Meaning: just in case; if by any chance; contingency, Example: 带把伞，万一下雨。, Translation: Bring an umbrella, just in case it rains.

Word: 王, Pinyin: Wáng, Meaning: surname Wang, Example: 我姓王。, Translation: My surname is Wang.

Word: 王子, Pinyin: wáng zǐ, Meaning: prince; son of a king, Example: 我想见王子。, Translation: I want to see the prince.

Word: 网, Pinyin: wǎng, Meaning: net; network, Example: 我喜欢上网。, Translation: I like to go online.

Word: 网络, Pinyin: Wǎng luò, Meaning: Internet, Example: 我喜欢用网络。, Translation: I like using the internet.

Word: 网上, Pinyin: wǎng shàng, Meaning: online, Example: 我在网上买东西。, Translation: I shop online.

Word: 网站, Pinyin: wǎng zhàn, Meaning: website; network station; node, Example: 这个网站很好用。, Translation: This website is very easy to use.

Word: 往, Pinyin: wǎng, Meaning: to go (in a direction); to; towards; (of a train) bound for; past; previous, Example: 请往这边走。, Translation: Please come this way.

Word: 忘, Pinyin: wàng, Meaning: to forget; to overlook; to neglect, Example: 我忘了带钥匙。, Translation: I forgot to bring my keys.

Word: 忘记, Pinyin: wàng jì, Meaning: to forget, Example: 我忘记带伞了。, Translation: I forgot to bring my umbrella.

Word: 望, Pinyin: wàng, Meaning: full moon; to hope; to expect; to visit; to gaze (into the distance); to look towards; towards, Example: 他望著窗外。, Translation: He looks out the window.

Word: 危机, Pinyin: wēi jī, Meaning: crisis, Example: 经济危机来了。, Translation: The economic crisis is here.

Word: 危险, Pinyin: wēi xiǎn, Meaning: danger; dangerous, Example: 这里太危险了。, Translation: It's too dangerous here.

Word: 威胁, Pinyin: wēi xié, Meaning: to threaten; to menace, Example: 别威胁我！, Translation: Don't threaten me!

Word: 微笑, Pinyin: wēi xiào, Meaning: smile; to smile, Example: 她对我微笑。, Translation: She smiled at me.

Word: 围, Pinyin: Wéi, Meaning: surname Wei, Example: 他姓围。, Translation: He is surnamed Wei.

Word: 违法, Pinyin: wéi fǎ, Meaning: illegal; to break the law, Example: 这违法吗？, Translation: Is this illegal?

Word: 违反, Pinyin: wéi fǎn, Meaning: to violate (a law), Example: 你违反法律了。, Translation: You violated the law.

Word: 唯, Pinyin: wéi, Meaning: only; alone; -ism (in Chinese, a prefix, often combined with a suffix such as 主义 or 论, e.g. 唯理论, rationalism), Example: 唯有你能行。, Translation: Only you can do it.

Word: 唯一, Pinyin: wéi yī, Meaning: only; sole, Example: 你是我的唯一。, Translation: You are my only one.

Word: 维持, Pinyin: wéi chí, Meaning: to keep; to maintain; to preserve, Example: 他努力维持生活。, Translation: He works hard to make a living.

Word: 维护, Pinyin: wéi hù, Meaning: to defend; to safeguard; to protect; to uphold; to maintain, Example: 我要维护我的权利。, Translation: I want to defend my rights.

Word: 伟大, Pinyin: wěi dà, Meaning: huge; great; grand; worthy of the greatest admiration; important (contribution etc), Example: 妈妈真伟大。, Translation: Mom is so great.

Word: 委托, Pinyin: wěi tuō, Meaning: to entrust; to trust; to commission, Example: 我委托朋友帮忙。, Translation: I entrusted a friend to help me.

Word: 委员会, Pinyin: wěi yuán huì, Meaning: committee, Example: 委员会今天开会。, Translation: The committee is meeting today.

Word: 卫生, Pinyin: wèi shēng, Meaning: health; hygiene; sanitation, Example: 这里很卫生。, Translation: This place is very hygienic.

Word: 卫星, Pinyin: wèi xīng, Meaning: satellite; moon, Example: 天上有一颗卫星。, Translation: There is a satellite in the sky.

Word: 为, Pinyin: wéi, Meaning: as (in the capacity of); to take sth as; to act as; to serve as; to behave as; to become; to be; to do; by (in the passive voice), Example: 他为班长。, Translation: He is the class monitor.

Word: 为此, Pinyin: wèi cǐ, Meaning: for this reason; with regards to this; in this respect; in order to do this; to this end, Example: 为此我存了好多钱。, Translation: I saved a lot of money for this.

Word: 为何, Pinyin: wèi hé, Meaning: why, Example: 你为何不来？, Translation: Why aren't you coming?

Word: 为了, Pinyin: wèi le, Meaning: for; for the purpose of; in order to, Example: 为了健康，我多运动。, Translation: For my health, I exercise more.

Word: 为什么, Pinyin: wèi shén me, Meaning: why?; for what reason?, Example: 你为什么迟到？, Translation: Why are you late?

Word: 为止, Pinyin: wéi zhǐ, Meaning: until; (used in combination with words like 到 or 至 in constructs of the form 到...到...为止), Example: 我等到八点为止。, Translation: I will wait until eight o'clock.

Word: 未, Pinyin: wèi, Meaning: not yet; did not; have not; not; 8th earthly branch: 1-3 p.m., 6th solar month (7th July-6th August), year of the Sheep; ancient Chinese compass point: 210°, Example: 他未到。, Translation: He hasn't arrived yet.

Word: 未来, Pinyin: wèi lái, Meaning: future; tomorrow; approaching; coming; pending, Example: 未来会更好。, Translation: The future will be better.

Word: 位, Pinyin: wèi, Meaning: position; location; place; seat; classifier for people (honorific); classifier for binary bits (e.g. 十六位 16-bit or 2 bytes); (physics) potential, Example: 我的位在左边。, Translation: My seat is on the left.

Word: 位于, Pinyin: wèi yú, Meaning: to be located at; to be situated at; to lie, Example: 学校位于市中心。, Translation: The school is located in the city center.

Word: 位置, Pinyin: wèi zhi, Meaning: position; place; seat, Example: 这个位置很好。, Translation: This place is good.

Word: 味道, Pinyin: wèi dao, Meaning: flavor; taste; (fig.) feeling (of ...); sense (of ...); hint (of ...); (fig.) interest; delight; (dialect) smell; odor, Example: 这汤味道很好。, Translation: This soup tastes great.

Word: 胃, Pinyin: wèi, Meaning: stomach, Example: 我胃不舒服。, Translation: My stomach feels uncomfortable.

Word: 喂, Pinyin: wéi, Meaning: hello (when answering the phone), Example: 喂，你好！, Translation: Hello!

Word: 温度, Pinyin: wēn dù, Meaning: temperature, Example: 今天温度多少？, Translation: What's the temperature today?

Word: 温暖, Pinyin: wēn nuǎn, Meaning: warm, Example: 阳光很温暖。, Translation: The sunshine is very warm.

Word: 温柔, Pinyin: wēn róu, Meaning: gentle and soft; tender; sweet (commonly used to describe a girl or woman), Example: 她说话很温柔。, Translation: She speaks very gently.

Word: 文, Pinyin: Wén, Meaning: surname Wen, Example: 我姓文。, Translation: My surname is Wen.

Word: 文化, Pinyin: wén huà, Meaning: culture; civilization; cultural, Example: 我喜欢中国文化。, Translation: I like Chinese culture.

Word: 文件, Pinyin: wén jiàn, Meaning: document; file, Example: 请发给我文件。, Translation: Please send me the file.

Word: 文明, Pinyin: wén míng, Meaning: civilized; civilization; culture, Example: 我们要讲文明。, Translation: We should be polite and civilized.

Word: 文章, Pinyin: wén zhāng, Meaning: article; essay; literary works; writings; hidden meaning, Example: 我写了一篇文章。, Translation: I wrote an article.

Word: 闻, Pinyin: Wén, Meaning: surname Wen, Example: 我姓闻。, Translation: My surname is Wen.

Word: 吻, Pinyin: wěn, Meaning: kiss; to kiss; mouth, Example: 我想吻你。, Translation: I want to kiss you.

Word: 稳, Pinyin: wěn, Meaning: settled; steady; stable, Example: 他走路很稳。, Translation: He walks very steadily.

Word: 稳定, Pinyin: wěn dìng, Meaning: steady; stable; stability; to stabilize; to pacify, Example: 工作很稳定。, Translation: My job is very stable.

Word: 问, Pinyin: wèn, Meaning: to ask; to inquire, Example: 我可以问你吗？, Translation: Can I ask you?

Word: 问题, Pinyin: wèn tí, Meaning: question; problem; issue; topic, Example: 我有个问题。, Translation: I have a question.

Word: 我, Pinyin: wǒ, Meaning: I; me; my, Example: 我是学生。, Translation: I am a student.

Word: 我们, Pinyin: wǒ men, Meaning: we; us; ourselves; our, Example: 我们一起去吃饭吧。, Translation: Let's go eat together.

Word: 污染, Pinyin: wū rǎn, Meaning: to pollute; to contaminate (lit. and fig.), Example: 别污染这里的水。, Translation: Don't pollute the water here.

Word: 屋, Pinyin: wū, Meaning: (bound form) house; (bound form) room, Example: 我的小屋很干净。, Translation: My small room is very clean.

Word: 无, Pinyin: wú, Meaning: not to have; no; none; not; to lack; un-; -less, Example: 我一无所有, Translation: I have nothing.

Word: 无比, Pinyin: wú bǐ, Meaning: incomparable; matchless, Example: 他无比开心。, Translation: He is incomparably happy.

Word: 无法, Pinyin: wú fǎ, Meaning: unable; incapable, Example: 我无法回答。, Translation: I can't answer.

Word: 无关, Pinyin: wú guān, Meaning: unrelated; having nothing to do (with sth else), Example: 这跟你无关。, Translation: It has nothing to do with you.

Word: 无聊, Pinyin: wú liáo, Meaning: bored; boring; senseless, Example: 今天好无聊。, Translation: Today is so boring.

Word: 无论, Pinyin: wú lùn, Meaning: no matter what or how; regardless of whether..., Example: 无论多忙，都要吃饭。, Translation: No matter how busy, always eat.

Word: 无数, Pinyin: wú shù, Meaning: countless; numberless; innumerable, Example: 我有无数问题。, Translation: I have countless questions.

Word: 无疑, Pinyin: wú yí, Meaning: undoubtedly; without doubt; for sure, Example: 他无疑是对的。, Translation: He is undoubtedly right.

Word: 五, Pinyin: wǔ, Meaning: five; 5, Example: 我五点起床。, Translation: I get up at five o'clock.

Word: 武器, Pinyin: wǔ qì, Meaning: weapon; arms, Example: 这把武器很重。, Translation: This weapon is heavy.

Word: 武装, Pinyin: wǔ zhuāng, Meaning: arms; equipment; to arm; military; armed (forces), Example: 他们全副武装。, Translation: They are fully armed.

Word: 舞, Pinyin: wǔ, Meaning: to dance; to wield; to brandish, Example: 她在跳舞。, Translation: She is dancing.

Word: 舞蹈, Pinyin: wǔ dǎo, Meaning: dance (performance art); dancing, Example: 我想学舞蹈。, Translation: I want to learn dance.

Word: 舞台, Pinyin: wǔ tái, Meaning: (lit. and fig.) stage; arena, Example: 他在舞台上唱歌。, Translation: He sings on stage.

Word: 物品, Pinyin: wù pǐn, Meaning: articles; goods, Example: 请带走你的物品。, Translation: Please take your items.

Word: 物质, Pinyin: wù zhì, Meaning: matter; substance; material; materialistic, Example: 物质确实很重要。, Translation: Material things are indeed very important.

Word: 吸, Pinyin: xī, Meaning: to breathe; to suck in; to absorb; to inhale, Example: 请深呼吸。, Translation: Please take a deep breath.

Word: 吸引, Pinyin: xī yǐn, Meaning: to attract; to appeal to; to fascinate, Example: 这本书很吸引我。, Translation: This book really attracts me.

Word: 希望, Pinyin: xī wàng, Meaning: to hope; a hope; a wish, Example: 我希望你喜欢。, Translation: I hope you like it.

Word: 牺牲, Pinyin: xī shēng, Meaning: to sacrifice one's life; to sacrifice (sth valued); beast slaughtered as a sacrifice, Example: 他为了救人牺牲了。, Translation: He sacrificed himself to save someone.

Word: 习惯, Pinyin: xí guàn, Meaning: habit; custom; usual practice; to be used to, Example: 这是个好习惯。, Translation: This is a good habit.

Word: 袭击, Pinyin: xí jī, Meaning: attack (esp. surprise attack); raid; to attack, Example: 敌人袭击了我们的村庄。, Translation: The enemy attacked our village.

Word: 洗, Pinyin: xǐ, Meaning: to wash; to bathe; to develop (photographs); to shuffle (cards etc); to erase (a recording), Example: 我去洗澡了。, Translation: I'm going to take a shower.

Word: 洗澡, Pinyin: xǐ zǎo, Meaning: to bathe; to take a shower, Example: 我想去洗澡。, Translation: I want to take a shower.

Word: 喜欢, Pinyin: xǐ huan, Meaning: to like; to be fond of, Example: 我喜欢苹果。, Translation: I like apples.

Word: 戏, Pinyin: xì, Meaning: variant of 戏, Example: 我们去看戏吧。, Translation: Let's go watch a play.

Word: 系, Pinyin: xì, Meaning: to connect; to relate to; to tie up; to bind; to be (literary), Example: 请系好安全带, Translation: Please fasten your seatbelt.

Word: 系列, Pinyin: xì liè, Meaning: series; set, Example: 喜欢这个系列吗？, Translation: Do you like this series?

Word: 系统, Pinyin: xì tǒng, Meaning: system, Example: 这个系统很好用。, Translation: This system is very easy to use.

Word: 细, Pinyin: xì, Meaning: thin or slender; finely particulate; thin and soft; fine; delicate; trifling; (of a sound) quiet; frugal, Example: 头发很细。, Translation: The hair is very fine.

Word: 细胞, Pinyin: xì bāo, Meaning: cell (biology), Example: 人体有很多细胞。, Translation: The human body has many cells.

Word: 细节, Pinyin: xì jié, Meaning: details; particulars, Example: 细节很重要。, Translation: Details are important.

Word: 西, Pinyin: Xī, Meaning: the West; abbr. for Spain 牙; Spanish, Example: 他爱吃西餐。, Translation: He likes Western food.

Word: 西部, Pinyin: xī bù, Meaning: western part, Example: 他住在西部。, Translation: He lives in the western part.

