Word: 下班, Pinyin: xià bān, Meaning: to finish work; to get off work, Example: 你几点下班？, Translation: What time do you get off work?

Word: 下次, Pinyin: xià cì, Meaning: next time, Example: 我们下次见。, Translation: See you next time.

Word: 下降, Pinyin: xià jiàng, Meaning: to decline; to drop; to fall; to go down; to decrease, Example: 气温下降了。, Translation: The temperature dropped.

Word: 下来, Pinyin: xià lai, Meaning: to come down; (completed action marker); (after verb of motion, indicates motion down and towards us, also fig.); (indicates continuation from the past towards us); to be harvested (of crops); to be over (of a period of time); to go among the masses (said of leaders), Example: 你快下来吧。, Translation: Come down quickly.

Word: 下面, Pinyin: xià miàn, Meaning: below; under; next; the following; also pr. [xià mian], Example: 答案在下面。, Translation: The answer is below.

