Word: 牙, Pinyin: yá, Meaning: tooth; ivory, Example: 我牙疼。, Translation: I have a toothache.

Word: 亚洲, Pinyin: Yà zhōu, Meaning: Asia (abbr. for 亚细亚洲), Example: 我住在亚洲。, Translation: I live in Asia.

Word: 呀, Pinyin: ya, Meaning: (particle equivalent to 啊 after a vowel, expressing surprise or doubt), Example: 原来是你呀！, Translation: Oh, it's you!

Word: 烟, Pinyin: yān, Meaning: cigarette or pipe tobacco; smoke; mist; vapour; tobacco plant; (of the eyes) to be irritated by smoke, Example: 屋里全是烟。, Translation: The room is full of smoke.

Word: 严格, Pinyin: yán gé, Meaning: strict; stringent; tight; rigorous, Example: 老师很严格。, Translation: The teacher is very strict.

Word: 严肃, Pinyin: yán sù, Meaning: solemn; grave; serious; earnest; severe, Example: 老师很严肃。, Translation: The teacher is very serious.

Word: 严重, Pinyin: yán zhòng, Meaning: grave; serious; severe; critical, Example: 病情很严重。, Translation: The illness is very serious.

Word: 研究, Pinyin: yán jiū, Meaning: research; a study; to research; to look into, Example: 我想研究这个。, Translation: I want to research this.

Word: 盐, Pinyin: yán, Meaning: salt, Example: 请给我一点盐。, Translation: Please give me some salt.

Word: 颜色, Pinyin: yán sè, Meaning: color; countenance; appearance; facial expression; pigment; dyestuff, Example: 我喜欢这个颜色。, Translation: I like this color.

Word: 眼, Pinyin: yǎn, Meaning: eye; small hole; crux (of a matter); classifier for big hollow things (wells, stoves, pots etc), Example: 针上有个眼。, Translation: The needle has a small hole.

Word: 眼镜, Pinyin: yǎn jìng, Meaning: spectacles; eyeglasses, Example: 我忘带眼镜了。, Translation: I forgot to bring my glasses.

Word: 眼睛, Pinyin: yǎn jing, Meaning: eye, Example: 请闭上眼睛。, Translation: Please close your eyes.

Word: 眼泪, Pinyin: yǎn lèi, Meaning: tears; crying, Example: 别流眼泪。, Translation: Don't cry.

Word: 眼前, Pinyin: yǎn qián, Meaning: before one's eyes; now; at present, Example: 幸福就在眼前。, Translation: Happiness is right in front of you.

Word: 眼神, Pinyin: yǎn shén, Meaning: expression or emotion showing in one's eyes; meaningful glance; wink; eyesight (dialect), Example: 别用那种眼神看我。, Translation: Don't look at me with that expression.

Word: 演, Pinyin: yǎn, Meaning: to develop; to evolve; to practice; to perform; to play; to act, Example: 她喜欢演戏。, Translation: She likes acting.

Word: 演唱, Pinyin: yǎn chàng, Meaning: sung performance; to sing for an audience, Example: 她今晚要演唱一首歌。, Translation: She will sing a song tonight.

Word: 演唱会, Pinyin: yǎn chàng huì, Meaning: vocal recital or concert, Example: 我想去演唱会。, Translation: I want to go to a concert.

Word: 演出, Pinyin: yǎn chū, Meaning: to act (in a play); to perform; to put on (a performance); performance; concert; show, Example: 今晚有演出吗？, Translation: Is there a show tonight?

Word: 演讲, Pinyin: yǎn jiǎng, Meaning: lecture; to make a speech, Example: 他明天要演讲。, Translation: He will give a speech tomorrow.

Word: 演员, Pinyin: yǎn yuán, Meaning: actor or actress; performer, Example: 我想当演员。, Translation: I want to be an actor.

Word: 羊, Pinyin: Yáng, Meaning: surname Yang, Example: 他姓羊。, Translation: His surname is Yang.

Word: 阳光, Pinyin: yáng guāng, Meaning: sunshine; (of personality) upbeat; energetic; transparent (open to public scrutiny), Example: 今天阳光真好。, Translation: The sunshine is really nice today.

Word: 养, Pinyin: yǎng, Meaning: to raise (animals); to bring up (children); to keep (pets); to support; to give birth, Example: 我养了一只猫。, Translation: I keep a cat.

Word: 样, Pinyin: yàng, Meaning: manner; pattern; way; appearance; shape; classifier: kind, type, Example: 你长什么样？, Translation: What do you look like?

Word: 样子, Pinyin: yàng zi, Meaning: appearance; manner; pattern; model, Example: 这包的样子不错。, Translation: This bag's style is nice.

Word: 腰, Pinyin: yāo, Meaning: waist; lower back; pocket; middle; loins, Example: 我腰疼。, Translation: My waist hurts.

Word: 邀请, Pinyin: yāo qǐng, Meaning: to invite; invitation, Example: 他邀请我去吃饭。, Translation: He invited me to dinner.

Word: 摇, Pinyin: Yáo, Meaning: surname Yao, Example: 别摇椅子。, Translation: Don't shake the chair.

Word: 咬, Pinyin: yǎo, Meaning: to bite; to nip, Example: 蚊子咬我。, Translation: A mosquito bit me.

Word: 药, Pinyin: yào, Meaning: leaf of the iris; variant of 药, Example: 吃药了吗？, Translation: Did you take your medicine?

Word: 药品, Pinyin: yào pǐn, Meaning: medicaments; medicine; drug, Example: 这些药品很便宜。, Translation: These medicines are cheap.

Word: 药物, Pinyin: yào wù, Meaning: medicaments; pharmaceuticals; medication; medicine; drug, Example: 这种药物有效。, Translation: This medicine is effective.

Word: 要, Pinyin: yāo, Meaning: (bound form) to demand; to coerce, Example: 他向我要钱。, Translation: He demanded money from me.

Word: 要不, Pinyin: yào bù, Meaning: otherwise; or else; how about...?; either... (or...), Example: 要不我们走吧？, Translation: How about we leave?

Word: 要么, Pinyin: yào me, Meaning: or; either one or the other, Example: 要么喝茶，要么喝咖啡。, Translation: Either drink tea or coffee.

Word: 要求, Pinyin: yāo qiú, Meaning: to request; to require; requirement; to stake a claim; to ask; to demand, Example: 你的要求是什么？, Translation: What is your requirement?

Word: 要是, Pinyin: yào shi, Meaning: (coll.) if, Example: 要是下雨，我就不去了。, Translation: If it rains, I won't go.

Word: 钥匙, Pinyin: yào shi, Meaning: key, Example: 我的钥匙在哪？, Translation: Where is my key?

Word: 也, Pinyin: Yě, Meaning: surname Ye, Example: 我也喜欢喝茶。, Translation: I also like drinking tea.

Word: 也就是说, Pinyin: yě jiù shì shuō, Meaning: in other words; that is to say; so; thus, Example: 他迟到，也就是说没来。, Translation: That means he didn't come.

Word: 也许, Pinyin: yě xǔ, Meaning: perhaps; maybe, Example: 也许他会来。, Translation: Maybe he will come.

Word: 野, Pinyin: yě, Meaning: old variant of 野, Example: 我们去野外吧。, Translation: Let's go to the outdoors.

Word: 业, Pinyin: Yè, Meaning: surname Ye, Example: 我姓业。, Translation: My surname is Ye.

Word: 业务, Pinyin: yè wù, Meaning: business; professional work; service, Example: 我负责新业务。, Translation: I handle the new business.

Word: 页, Pinyin: xié, Meaning: head, Example: 请翻到下一页。, Translation: Please turn to the next page.

Word: 夜, Pinyin: yè, Meaning: variant of 夜, Example: 夜里风很大。, Translation: The wind is strong at night.

Word: 夜晚, Pinyin: yè wǎn, Meaning: night, Example: 我喜欢夜晚。, Translation: I like the night.

Word: 爷爷, Pinyin: yé ye, Meaning: (coll.) father's father; paternal grandfather, Example: 爷爷在家吗？, Translation: Is grandpa at home?

Word: 一, Pinyin: yī, Meaning: one; single; a (article); as soon as; entire; whole; all; throughout; "one" radical in Chinese characters (Kangxi radical 1); also pr. [yāo] for greater clarity when spelling out numbers digit by digit, Example: 我有一个苹果。, Translation: I have an apple.

Word: 一般, Pinyin: yī bān, Meaning: same; ordinary; so-so; common; general; generally; in general, Example: 他的成绩一般。, Translation: His grades are so-so.

Word: 一半, Pinyin: yī bàn, Meaning: half, Example: 我吃了一半苹果。, Translation: I ate half an apple.

Word: 一辈子, Pinyin: yī bèi zi, Meaning: (for) a lifetime, Example: 我想陪你一辈子。, Translation: I want to stay with you for a lifetime.

Word: 一边, Pinyin: yī biān, Meaning: one side; either side; on the one hand; on the other hand; doing while, Example: 他一边吃饭一边看书。, Translation: He eats while reading.

Word: 一旦, Pinyin: yī dàn, Meaning: in case (sth happens); if; once (sth happens, then...); when; in a short time; in one day, Example: 一旦下雨我就回家。, Translation: Once it rains, I'll go home.

Word: 一定, Pinyin: yī dìng, Meaning: surely; certainly; necessarily; fixed; a certain (extent etc); given; particular; must, Example: 我一定去。, Translation: I will definitely go.

Word: 一番, Pinyin: yì fān, Meaning: Some, Example: 他做了一番努力。, Translation: He made some effort.

Word: 一会儿, Pinyin: yī huì r, Meaning: a moment; a while; in a moment; now...now...; also pr. [yī huǐ r], Example: 我一会儿来。, Translation: I'll come in a moment.

Word: 一句话, Pinyin: yī jù huà, Meaning: in a word; in short, Example: 一句话，很简单。, Translation: In short, it's very simple.

Word: 一路, Pinyin: yī lù, Meaning: the whole journey; all the way; going the same way; going in the same direction; of the same kind, Example: 他一路走回家。, Translation: He walked home all the way.

Word: 一面, Pinyin: yī miàn, Meaning: one side; one aspect; simultaneously... (and...); one's whole face, Example: 他一面走一面笑。, Translation: He walks and smiles at the same time.

Word: 一起, Pinyin: yī qǐ, Meaning: in the same place; together; with; altogether (in total), Example: 我们一起去吃饭。, Translation: Let's go eat together.

Word: 一切, Pinyin: yī qiè, Meaning: everything; every; all, Example: 别担心，一切都会好的。, Translation: Don't worry, everything will be fine.

Word: 一生, Pinyin: yī shēng, Meaning: all one's life; throughout one's life, Example: 我想用一生学习。, Translation: I want to study all my life.

Word: 一时, Pinyin: yī shí, Meaning: a period of time; a while; for a short while; temporary; momentary; at the same time, Example: 我一时忘了。, Translation: I forgot for a moment.

Word: 一些, Pinyin: yī xiē, Meaning: some; a few; a little; (following an adjective) slightly ...er, Example: 我想买一些苹果。, Translation: I want to buy some apples.

Word: 一样, Pinyin: yī yàng, Meaning: same; like; equal to; the same as; just like, Example: 我们俩一样。, Translation: We are the same.

Word: 一一, Pinyin: yī yī, Meaning: one by one; one after another, Example: 大家一一排队。, Translation: Everyone lines up one by one.

Word: 一阵, Pinyin: yī zhèn, Meaning: a burst; a fit; a peal; a spell (period of time), Example: 刚才刮了一阵风。, Translation: There was a gust of wind just now.

Word: 一直, Pinyin: yī zhí, Meaning: straight (in a straight line); continuously; always; all the way through, Example: 他一直在学习。, Translation: He has been studying continuously.

Word: 一致, Pinyin: yī zhì, Meaning: unanimous; identical (views or opinions), Example: 我们意见一致。, Translation: Our opinions are the same.

Word: 衣服, Pinyin: yī fu, Meaning: clothes, Example: 我的衣服很漂亮。, Translation: My clothes are very pretty.

Word: 医疗, Pinyin: yī liáo, Meaning: medical treatment, Example: 这里的医疗很好。, Translation: Medical treatment here is good.

Word: 医生, Pinyin: yī shēng, Meaning: doctor, Example: 我是医生。, Translation: I am a doctor.

Word: 医学, Pinyin: yī xué, Meaning: medicine; medical science; study of medicine, Example: 我想学医学。, Translation: I want to study medicine.

Word: 医院, Pinyin: yī yuàn, Meaning: hospital, Example: 明天去医院。, Translation: I will go to the hospital tomorrow.

Word: 依, Pinyin: yī, Meaning: to depend on; to comply with or listen to sb; according to; in the light of, Example: 依我看，这样好。, Translation: In my opinion, this is better.

Word: 依靠, Pinyin: yī kào, Meaning: to rely on sth (for support etc); to depend on, Example: 我依靠父母生活。, Translation: I rely on my parents for a living.

Word: 依然, Pinyin: yī rán, Meaning: still; as before, Example: 我依然记得。, Translation: I still remember.

Word: 仪式, Pinyin: yí shì, Meaning: ceremony, Example: 今天的仪式很简单。, Translation: Today's ceremony is very simple.

Word: 移, Pinyin: yí, Meaning: to move; to shift; to change; to alter; to remove, Example: 请把椅子移开。, Translation: Please move the chair away.

Word: 移动, Pinyin: yí dòng, Meaning: to move; movement; migration; mobile; portable, Example: 请移动一下椅子。, Translation: Please move the chair.

Word: 遗憾, Pinyin: yí hàn, Meaning: regret; to regret; to be sorry that, Example: 我很遗憾不能去。, Translation: I'm sorry I can't go.

Word: 已, Pinyin: yǐ, Meaning: already; to stop; then; afterwards, Example: 我已到了。, Translation: I'm already here.

Word: 已经, Pinyin: yǐ jīng, Meaning: already, Example: 我已经吃饭了。, Translation: I have already eaten.

Word: 以, Pinyin: yǐ, Meaning: old variant of 以, Example: 我以手机付款。, Translation: I pay by phone.

Word: 以后, Pinyin: yǐ hòu, Meaning: after; later; afterwards; following; later on; in the future, Example: 以后常联系。, Translation: Keep in touch in the future.

Word: 以及, Pinyin: yǐ jí, Meaning: as well as; too; and, Example: 我带了书以及笔。, Translation: I brought a book as well as a pen.

Word: 以来, Pinyin: yǐ lái, Meaning: since (a previous event), Example: 毕业以来，我很忙。, Translation: Since graduation, I've been busy.

Word: 以前, Pinyin: yǐ qián, Meaning: before; formerly; previous; ago, Example: 我以前住北京。, Translation: I used to live in Beijing.

Word: 以上, Pinyin: yǐ shàng, Meaning: that level or higher; that amount or more; the above-mentioned; (used to indicate that one has completed one's remarks) That is all., Example: 十八岁以上可以参加。, Translation: Those eighteen and older can join.

Word: 以外, Pinyin: yǐ wài, Meaning: apart from; other than; except for; external; outside of; on the other side of; beyond, Example: 他以外，还有谁？, Translation: Apart from him, who else?

Word: 以为, Pinyin: yǐ wéi, Meaning: to think (i.e. to take it to be true that ...) (Usually there is an implication that the notion is mistaken – except when expressing one's own current opinion.), Example: 我以为今天下雨。, Translation: I thought it would rain today.

Word: 以下, Pinyin: yǐ xià, Meaning: that level or lower; that amount or less; the following, Example: 十元以下免费。, Translation: Ten yuan or less is free.

Word: 义务, Pinyin: yì wù, Meaning: duty; obligation; volunteer (work etc), Example: 这是我的义务。, Translation: This is my duty.

Word: 亿, Pinyin: yì, Meaning: 100 million, Example: 他赚了一亿块钱。, Translation: He earned one hundred million yuan.

Word: 艺术, Pinyin: yì shù, Meaning: art, Example: 我喜欢艺术。, Translation: I like art.

Word: 亦, Pinyin: yì, Meaning: also, Example: 我亦想去。, Translation: I also want to go.

Word: 异常, Pinyin: yì cháng, Meaning: unusual; abnormal; extremely; exceptionally, Example: 今天天气异常冷。, Translation: The weather is extremely cold today.

Word: 意见, Pinyin: yì jiàn, Meaning: idea; opinion; suggestion; objection; complaint, Example: 你有什么意见？, Translation: Do you have any suggestions?

Word: 意识, Pinyin: yì shí, Meaning: consciousness; awareness; to be aware; to realize, Example: 我意识到错了。, Translation: I realized I was wrong.

Word: 意思, Pinyin: yì si, Meaning: idea; opinion; meaning; wish; desire; interest; fun; token of appreciation, affection etc; to give as a small token; to do sth as a gesture of goodwill etc, Example: 一点小意思。, Translation: Just a small token.

Word: 意外, Pinyin: yì wài, Meaning: unexpected; accident; mishap, Example: 这真是个大意外。, Translation: This is really unexpected.

Word: 意味着, Pinyin: yì wèi zhe, Meaning: to signify; to mean; to imply, Example: 这意味着什么？, Translation: What does this mean?

Word: 意义, Pinyin: yì yì, Meaning: sense; meaning; significance; importance, Example: 这有什么意义？, Translation: What's the meaning of this?

Word: 因, Pinyin: yīn, Meaning: old variant of 因, Example: 我因忙没去。, Translation: I didn't go because I was busy.

Word: 因此, Pinyin: yīn cǐ, Meaning: thus; consequently; as a result, Example: 他病了，因此没来。, Translation: He was sick, so he didn't come.

Word: 因素, Pinyin: yīn sù, Meaning: element; factor, Example: 天气是重要因素。, Translation: Weather is an important factor.

Word: 因为, Pinyin: yīn wèi, Meaning: because; owing to; on account of, Example: 因为下雨，我不去。, Translation: Because it's raining, I won't go.

Word: 音乐, Pinyin: yīn yuè, Meaning: music, Example: 我喜欢音乐。, Translation: I like music.

Word: 银, Pinyin: yín, Meaning: silver; silver-colored; relating to money or currency, Example: 这枚戒指是银的。, Translation: This ring is silver.

Word: 银行, Pinyin: yín háng, Meaning: bank, Example: 我去银行。, Translation: I go to the bank.

Word: 引, Pinyin: yǐn, Meaning: to draw (e.g. a bow); to pull; to stretch sth; to extend; to lengthen; to involve or implicate in; to attract; to lead; to guide; to leave; to provide evidence or justification for; old unit of distance equal to 10 丈, one-thirtieth of a km or 33.33 meters, Example: 他引着我去参观。, Translation: He led me around.

Word: 引导, Pinyin: yǐn dǎo, Meaning: to guide; to lead (around); to conduct; to boot; introduction; primer, Example: 请引导客人入座。, Translation: Please guide the guests to their seats.

Word: 引发, Pinyin: yǐn fā, Meaning: to lead to; to trigger; to initiate; to cause; to evoke (emotions), Example: 他的话引发了争吵。, Translation: His words caused an argument.

Word: 引起, Pinyin: yǐn qǐ, Meaning: to give rise to; to lead to; to cause; to arouse, Example: 这引起了很多问题。, Translation: This caused many problems.

Word: 饮料, Pinyin: yǐn liào, Meaning: drink; beverage, Example: 我想喝饮料。, Translation: I want to drink a beverage.

Word: 隐藏, Pinyin: yǐn cáng, Meaning: to hide; to conceal; to mask; to shelter; to harbor (i.e. keep sth hidden); to hide oneself; to lie low; to nestle; hidden; implicit; private; covert; recessed (lighting), Example: 他喜欢隐藏在沙发下。, Translation: He likes to hide under the sofa.

Word: 印, Pinyin: Yìn, Meaning: surname Yin; abbr. for 度, Example: 他姓印。, Translation: His last name is Yin.

Word: 印象, Pinyin: yìn xiàng, Meaning: impression (sth that stays in one's mind); a memory, Example: 第一印象很重要。, Translation: First impressions are important.

Word: 应, Pinyin: Yīng, Meaning: surname Ying; Taiwan pr. [Yìng], Example: 你姓应吗？, Translation: Is your surname Ying?

Word: 应当, Pinyin: yīng dāng, Meaning: should; ought to, Example: 你应当早点休息。, Translation: You should get some rest early.

Word: 应该, Pinyin: yīng gāi, Meaning: ought to; should; must, Example: 你应该早点休息。, Translation: You should rest early.

Word: 英雄, Pinyin: yīng xióng, Meaning: hero, Example: 他是我们的英雄。, Translation: He is our hero.

Word: 英语, Pinyin: Yīng yǔ, Meaning: English (language), Example: 你会说英语吗？, Translation: Can you speak English?

Word: 婴儿, Pinyin: yīng ér, Meaning: infant; baby; lead (Pb), Example: 这个婴儿很可爱。, Translation: This baby is very cute.

Word: 赢, Pinyin: yíng, Meaning: to beat; to win; to profit, Example: 我们赢了比赛。, Translation: We won the match.

Word: 赢得, Pinyin: yíng dé, Meaning: to win; to gain, Example: 他赢得了比赛。, Translation: He won the match.

Word: 影片, Pinyin: yǐng piàn, Meaning: a copy of a film; film; motion picture; movie, Example: 这部影片很好看。, Translation: This movie is very good.

Word: 影响, Pinyin: yǐng xiǎng, Meaning: influence; effect; to influence; to affect (usually adversely); to disturb, Example: 别影响我工作。, Translation: Don't affect my work.

Word: 硬, Pinyin: yìng, Meaning: hard; stiff; solid; (fig.) strong; firm; resolutely; uncompromisingly; laboriously; with great difficulty; good (quality); able (person); (of food) filling; substantial, Example: 这面包太硬了。, Translation: This bread is too hard.

Word: 拥抱, Pinyin: yōng bào, Meaning: to embrace; to hug, Example: 我想拥抱你。, Translation: I want to hug you.

Word: 拥有, Pinyin: yōng yǒu, Meaning: to have; to possess, Example: 我拥有很多书。, Translation: I have many books.

Word: 永远, Pinyin: yǒng yuǎn, Meaning: forever; eternal, Example: 我永远爱你。, Translation: I will always love you.

Word: 勇敢, Pinyin: yǒng gǎn, Meaning: brave; courageous, Example: 你真勇敢！, Translation: You are very brave!

Word: 勇气, Pinyin: yǒng qì, Meaning: courage; valor, Example: 我需要勇气。, Translation: I need courage.

Word: 用, Pinyin: yòng, Meaning: to use; to employ; to have to; to eat or drink; expense or outlay; usefulness; hence; therefore, Example: 我用手机上网。, Translation: I use my phone to browse the internet.

Word: 用来, Pinyin: yòng lái, Meaning: to be used for, Example: 钥匙用来开门。, Translation: Keys are used to open doors.

Word: 用于, Pinyin: yòng yú, Meaning: to use in; to use on; to use for, Example: 这笔钱用于买书。, Translation: This money is used to buy books.

Word: 优势, Pinyin: yōu shì, Meaning: superiority; dominance; advantage, Example: 他的优势是英语。, Translation: His advantage is English.

Word: 优秀, Pinyin: yōu xiù, Meaning: outstanding; excellent, Example: 她是个优秀的学生。, Translation: She is an excellent student.

Word: 尤其, Pinyin: yóu qí, Meaning: especially; particularly, Example: 我喜欢水果，尤其苹果。, Translation: I like fruit, especially apples.

Word: 由, Pinyin: yóu, Meaning: to follow; from; because of; due to; by; via; through; (before a noun and a verb) it is for ... to ..., Example: 这事由我负责。, Translation: I will be responsible for this.

Word: 由于, Pinyin: yóu yú, Meaning: due to; as a result of; thanks to; owing to; since; because, Example: 由于下雨，我没去。, Translation: Because of the rain, I didn't go.

Word: 邮件, Pinyin: yóu jiàn, Meaning: mail; post; email, Example: 我发了一封邮件。, Translation: I sent an email.

Word: 油, Pinyin: yóu, Meaning: oil; fat; grease; petroleum; to apply tung oil, paint or varnish; oily; greasy; glib; cunning, Example: 这汤太油了。, Translation: This soup is too oily.

Word: 游, Pinyin: Yóu, Meaning: surname You, Example: 你好，我姓游。, Translation: Hello, my surname is You.

Word: 游戏, Pinyin: yóu xì, Meaning: game; to play, Example: 我喜欢玩游戏。, Translation: I like playing games.

Word: 游泳, Pinyin: yóu yǒng, Meaning: swimming; to swim, Example: 我喜欢游泳。, Translation: I like swimming.

Word: 有, Pinyin: yǒu, Meaning: to have; there is; (bound form) having; with; -ful; -ed; -al (as in 意 intentional), Example: 我有一本书。, Translation: I have a book.

Word: 有的, Pinyin: yǒu de, Meaning: (there are) some (who are...); some (exist), Example: 有的人喜欢喝茶。, Translation: Some people like drinking tea.

Word: 有关, Pinyin: yǒu guān, Meaning: to have sth to do with; to relate to; related to; to concern; concerning, Example: 这跟钱有关。, Translation: This is related to money.

Word: 有趣, Pinyin: yǒu qù, Meaning: interesting; fascinating; amusing, Example: 这本书很有趣。, Translation: This book is interesting.

Word: 有人, Pinyin: yǒu rén, Meaning: someone; people; anyone; there is someone there; occupied (as in restroom), Example: 有人敲门。, Translation: Someone is knocking on the door.

Word: 有时, Pinyin: yǒu shí, Meaning: sometimes; now and then, Example: 我有时喝咖啡。, Translation: I sometimes drink coffee.

Word: 有时候, Pinyin: yǒu shí hou, Meaning: sometimes, Example: 有时候我想家。, Translation: Sometimes I miss home.

Word: 有所, Pinyin: yǒu suǒ, Meaning: somewhat; to some extent, Example: 情况有所改善。, Translation: The situation has somewhat improved.

Word: 有效, Pinyin: yǒu xiào, Meaning: effective; in effect; valid, Example: 这个方法很有效。, Translation: This method is very effective.

Word: 有些, Pinyin: yǒu xiē, Meaning: some; somewhat, Example: 我有些累了。, Translation: I'm somewhat tired.

Word: 有意思, Pinyin: yǒu yì si, Meaning: interesting; meaningful; enjoyable; fun, Example: 这本书很有意思。, Translation: This book is very interesting.

Word: 有着, Pinyin: yǒu zhe, Meaning: to have; to possess, Example: 他有着好习惯。, Translation: He has good habits.

Word: 又, Pinyin: yòu, Meaning: (once) again; also; both... and...; and yet; (used for emphasis) anyway, Example: 他又迟到了。, Translation: He is late again.

Word: 右, Pinyin: yòu, Meaning: (bound form) right; right-hand side; (bound form) (politics) right of center; (bound form) (old) west; (literary) the right side as the side of precedence, Example: 请往右走。, Translation: Please walk to the right.

Word: 右边, Pinyin: yòu bian, Meaning: right side; right, to the right, Example: 书在右边。, Translation: The book is on the right.

Word: 诱惑, Pinyin: yòu huò, Meaning: to entice; to lure; to induce; to attract, Example: 金钱诱惑了他。, Translation: Money tempted him.

Word: 友好, Pinyin: Yǒu hǎo, Meaning: Youhao district of Yichun city 市, Heilongjiang, Example: 他们很友好。, Translation: They are very friendly.

Word: 友谊, Pinyin: yǒu yì, Meaning: companionship; fellowship; friendship, Example: 我们珍惜这份友谊。, Translation: We cherish this friendship.

Word: 于, Pinyin: Yú, Meaning: surname Yu, Example: 于老师来了。, Translation: Teacher Yu is here.

Word: 于是, Pinyin: yú shì, Meaning: thereupon; as a result; consequently; thus; hence, Example: 下雨了，于是我不出门。, Translation: So I didn't go out.

Word: 鱼, Pinyin: Yú, Meaning: surname Yu, Example: 他姓鱼。, Translation: His surname is Yu.

Word: 娱乐, Pinyin: yú lè, Meaning: to entertain; to amuse; entertainment; recreation; amusement; hobby; fun; joy, Example: 我喜欢娱乐。, Translation: I like entertainment.

Word: 愉快, Pinyin: yú kuài, Meaning: cheerful; cheerily; delightful; pleasant; pleasantly; pleasing; happy; delighted, Example: 今天真愉快。, Translation: Today was really pleasant.

Word: 与, Pinyin: yú, Meaning: variant of 欤, Example: 此事甚好与？, Translation: That's very good, isn't it?

Word: 宇宙, Pinyin: yǔ zhòu, Meaning: universe; cosmos, Example: 宇宙很大。, Translation: The universe is very big.

Word: 雨, Pinyin: yǔ, Meaning: rain, Example: 今天下雨了。, Translation: It's raining today.

Word: 语言, Pinyin: yǔ yán, Meaning: language, Example: 我喜欢学语言。, Translation: I like learning languages.

Word: 玉米, Pinyin: yù mǐ, Meaning: corn; maize, Example: 我喜欢吃玉米。, Translation: I like to eat corn.

Word: 预测, Pinyin: yù cè, Meaning: to forecast; to predict, Example: 你能预测天气吗？, Translation: Can you predict the weather?

Word: 预计, Pinyin: yù jì, Meaning: to forecast; to predict; to estimate, Example: 预计明天会下雨。, Translation: It is expected to rain tomorrow.

Word: 预算, Pinyin: yù suàn, Meaning: budget, Example: 我的预算不够。, Translation: My budget isn't enough.

Word: 遇, Pinyin: Yù, Meaning: surname Yu, Example: 我遇见过他。, Translation: I have met him before.

Word: 遇到, Pinyin: yù dào, Meaning: to meet; to run into; to come across, Example: 我昨天遇到朋友了。, Translation: I met a friend yesterday.

Word: 遇见, Pinyin: yù jiàn, Meaning: to meet, Example: 我遇见了朋友。, Translation: I met a friend.

Word: 元, Pinyin: Yuán, Meaning: surname Yuan; the Yuan or Mongol dynasty (1279-1368), Example: 我姓元。, Translation: My surname is Yuan.

Word: 员, Pinyin: yuán, Meaning: person; employee; member, Example: 他是新成员。, Translation: He is a new member.

Word: 员工, Pinyin: yuán gōng, Meaning: staff; personnel; employee, Example: 公司有很多员工。, Translation: The company has many employees.

Word: 原, Pinyin: Yuán, Meaning: surname Yuan; (Japanese surname) Hara, Example: 原老师来了。, Translation: Teacher Yuan is here.

Word: 原本, Pinyin: yuán běn, Meaning: originally; original, Example: 我原本想去。, Translation: I originally wanted to go.

Word: 原来, Pinyin: yuán lái, Meaning: original; former; originally; formerly; at first; so, actually, as it turns out, Example: 原来是你啊。, Translation: So it's you!

Word: 原谅, Pinyin: yuán liàng, Meaning: to excuse; to forgive; to pardon, Example: 请原谅我。, Translation: Please forgive me.

Word: 原因, Pinyin: yuán yīn, Meaning: cause; origin; root cause; reason, Example: 我不知道原因。, Translation: I don't know the reason.

Word: 原则, Pinyin: yuán zé, Meaning: principle; doctrine, Example: 这是我的原则。, Translation: That's my principle.

Word: 圆, Pinyin: yuán, Meaning: circle; round; circular; spherical; (of the moon) full; unit of Chinese currency (yuan); tactful; to make consistent and whole (the narrative of a dream or a lie), Example: 今晚的月亮真圆。, Translation: The moon is so round tonight.

Word: 远, Pinyin: yuǎn, Meaning: far; distant; remote; (intensifier in a comparison) by far; much (lower etc), Example: 学校离我家很远。, Translation: The school is far from my home.

Word: 远离, Pinyin: yuǎn lí, Meaning: to be far from; to keep away from, Example: 请远离危险。, Translation: Please stay away from danger.

Word: 远远, Pinyin: yuǎn yuǎn, Meaning: distant; by far, Example: 他远远地看着我。, Translation: He watched me from a distance.

Word: 院, Pinyin: yuàn, Meaning: courtyard; institution, Example: 我们在院子里玩。, Translation: We play in the courtyard.

Word: 愿, Pinyin: yuàn, Meaning: honest; prudent; variant of 愿, Example: 愿你每天开心。, Translation: May you be happy every day.

Word: 愿望, Pinyin: yuàn wàng, Meaning: desire; wish, Example: 我有一个小愿望。, Translation: I have a small wish.

Word: 愿意, Pinyin: yuàn yì, Meaning: to wish; to want; ready; willing (to do sth), Example: 你愿意去吗？, Translation: Are you willing to go?

Word: 约, Pinyin: yāo, Meaning: to weigh in a balance or on a scale, Example: 请帮我约两斤。, Translation: Please weigh two jin for me.

Word: 约会, Pinyin: yuē huì, Meaning: appointment; engagement; date; to arrange to meet, Example: 今晚去约会吧。, Translation: Let's go on a date tonight.

Word: 月, Pinyin: yuè, Meaning: moon; month; monthly, Example: 今晚的月亮真美。, Translation: The moon is so beautiful tonight.

Word: 越, Pinyin: Yuè, Meaning: generic word for peoples or states of south China or south Asia at different historical periods; abbr. for Vietnam 越南, Example: 他是越人。, Translation: He is Vietnamese.

Word: 越来越, Pinyin: yuè lái yuè, Meaning: more and more, Example: 天气越来越热。, Translation: The weather is getting hotter and hotter.

Word: 晕, Pinyin: yūn, Meaning: confused; dizzy; giddy; to faint; to swoon; to lose consciousness; to pass out, Example: 我有点晕。, Translation: I'm a bit dizzy.

Word: 云, Pinyin: yún, Meaning: (classical) to say, Example: 古人云：“知足常乐。”, Translation: The ancients say, "Contentment brings happiness."

Word: 允许, Pinyin: yǔn xǔ, Meaning: to permit; to allow, Example: 这里不允许拍照。, Translation: No photos allowed here.

Word: 运, Pinyin: yùn, Meaning: to move; to transport; to use; to apply; fortune; luck; fate, Example: 你的运气真好。, Translation: You're so lucky.

Word: 运动, Pinyin: yùn dòng, Meaning: to move; to exercise; sports; exercise; motion; movement; campaign, Example: 我喜欢运动。, Translation: I like to exercise.

Word: 运动员, Pinyin: yùn dòng yuán, Meaning: athlete, Example: 我想当运动员。, Translation: I want to be an athlete.

Word: 运气, Pinyin: yùn qi, Meaning: luck (good or bad), Example: 今天运气真好。, Translation: My luck is really good today.

Word: 运输, Pinyin: yùn shū, Meaning: to transport; to carry; transportation, Example: 我们每天运输货物。, Translation: We transport goods every day.

Word: 运行, Pinyin: yùn xíng, Meaning: to move along one's course (of celestial bodies etc); (fig.) to function; to be in operation; (of a train service etc) to operate; to run; (of a computer) to run, Example: 电脑运行正常。, Translation: The computer is running normally.

Word: 运用, Pinyin: yùn yòng, Meaning: to use; to put to use, Example: 我会运用这个技巧。, Translation: I will use this technique.

Word: 运作, Pinyin: yùn zuò, Meaning: to operate; operations; workings; activities (usu. of an organization); thread (computing), Example: 公司运作很顺利。, Translation: The company runs smoothly.

Word: 杂志, Pinyin: zá zhì, Meaning: magazine, Example: 我喜欢看杂志。, Translation: I like reading magazines.

Word: 砸, Pinyin: zá, Meaning: to smash; to pound; to fail; to muck up; to bungle, Example: 他把花瓶砸了。, Translation: He smashed the vase.

Word: 再, Pinyin: zài, Meaning: again; once more; re-; second; another; then (after sth, and not until then); no matter how ... (followed by an adjective or verb, and then (usually) 也 or 都 for emphasis), Example: 请再试一次。, Translation: Please try again.

Word: 再次, Pinyin: zài cì, Meaning: one more time; again; one more; once again, Example: 我想再次试试。, Translation: I want to try again.

Word: 再见, Pinyin: zài jiàn, Meaning: goodbye; see you again later, Example: 我们明天再见。, Translation: See you tomorrow.

Word: 再说, Pinyin: zài shuō, Meaning: to say again; to put off a discussion until later; moreover; what's more; besides, Example: 明天再说吧。, Translation: Let's talk about it tomorrow.

Word: 在, Pinyin: zài, Meaning: to exist; to be alive; (of sb or sth) to be (located) at; (used before a verb to indicate an action in progress), Example: 我在家。, Translation: I am at home.

Word: 在场, Pinyin: zài chǎng, Meaning: to be present; to be on the scene, Example: 他不在场。, Translation: He is not present.

Word: 在乎, Pinyin: zài hu, Meaning: to care about; equivalent of 在于, Example: 我不在乎钱。, Translation: I don't care about money.

Word: 在家, Pinyin: zài jiā, Meaning: to be at home; (at a workplace) to be in (as opposed to being away on official business 差); (Buddhism etc) to remain a layman (as opposed to becoming a monk or a nun 家), Example: 我今天在家。, Translation: I am at home today.

Word: 在于, Pinyin: zài yú, Meaning: to be in; to lie in; to consist in; to depend on; to rest with, Example: 成功在于坚持。, Translation: Success lies in persistence.

Word: 咱, Pinyin: zán, Meaning: variant of 咱, Example: 咱一起去吧。, Translation: Let's go together.

Word: 咱们, Pinyin: zán men, Meaning: we or us (including both the speaker and the person(s) spoken to); (dialect) I or me; (dialect) (in a coaxing or familiar way) you; also pr. [zá men], Example: 咱们走吧。, Translation: Let's go.

Word: 暂时, Pinyin: zàn shí, Meaning: temporary; provisional; for the time being, Example: 我暂时住在这里。, Translation: I am staying here temporarily.

Word: 遭到, Pinyin: zāo dào, Meaning: to suffer; to meet with (sth unfortunate), Example: 他遭到了批评。, Translation: He was criticized.

Word: 遭遇, Pinyin: zāo yù, Meaning: to meet with; to encounter; (bitter) experience, Example: 我遭遇了意外。, Translation: I encountered an accident.

Word: 糟糕, Pinyin: zāo gāo, Meaning: too bad; how terrible; what bad luck; terrible; bad, Example: 糟糕，我迟到了。, Translation: Oh no, I'm late.

Word: 早, Pinyin: zǎo, Meaning: early; morning; Good morning!; long ago; prematurely, Example: 你起得很早。, Translation: You get up very early.

Word: 早餐, Pinyin: zǎo cān, Meaning: breakfast, Example: 我想吃早餐。, Translation: I want to eat breakfast.

Word: 早晨, Pinyin: zǎo chén, Meaning: early morning; also pr. [zǎo chen], Example: 早晨喝杯咖啡吧。, Translation: Have a coffee in the morning.

Word: 早就, Pinyin: zǎo jiù, Meaning: already at an earlier time, Example: 我早就知道了。, Translation: I already knew.

Word: 早上, Pinyin: zǎo shang, Meaning: early morning, Example: 你早上几点起？, Translation: What time do you wake up in the morning?

Word: 造, Pinyin: zào, Meaning: to make; to build; to manufacture; to invent; to fabricate; to go to; party (in a lawsuit or legal agreement); crop; classifier for crops, Example: 他造了一座桥。, Translation: He built a bridge.

Word: 造成, Pinyin: zào chéng, Meaning: to bring about; to create; to cause, Example: 熬夜造成头痛。, Translation: Staying up late causes headaches.

Word: 造型, Pinyin: zào xíng, Meaning: to model; to shape; appearance; style; design; form; pose, Example: 这个造型不错。, Translation: This style looks good.

Word: 则, Pinyin: zé, Meaning: (literary) (conjunction used to express contrast with a previous clause) but; then; (bound form) standard; norm; (bound form) principle; (literary) to imitate; to follow; classifier for written items, Example: 如果下雨，则取消。, Translation: If it rains, then cancel.

Word: 责任, Pinyin: zé rèn, Meaning: responsibility; blame; duty, Example: 这是我的责任。, Translation: This is my responsibility.

Word: 贼, Pinyin: zéi, Meaning: thief; traitor; wily; deceitful; evil; extremely, Example: 今天天气贼冷。, Translation: Today is extremely cold.

Word: 怎么, Pinyin: zěn me, Meaning: how?; what?; why?, Example: 你怎么去？, Translation: How do you get there?

Word: 怎么办, Pinyin: zěn me bàn, Meaning: what's to be done, Example: 手机没电了，怎么办？, Translation: My phone died. What should I do?

Word: 怎么样, Pinyin: zěn me yàng, Meaning: how?; how about?; how was it?; how are things?, Example: 你觉得怎么样？, Translation: What do you think?

Word: 怎样, Pinyin: zěn yàng, Meaning: how; what kind, Example: 你觉得怎样？, Translation: What do you think?

Word: 增加, Pinyin: zēng jiā, Meaning: to raise; to increase, Example: 价格增加了。, Translation: The price increased.

Word: 增长, Pinyin: zēng zhǎng, Meaning: to grow; to increase, Example: 工资增长了。, Translation: The salary increased.

Word: 扎, Pinyin: zhā, Meaning: to prick; to run or stick (a needle etc) into; mug or jug used for serving beer (loanword from "jar"), Example: 他不小心扎了手。, Translation: He accidentally pricked his hand.

Word: 炸, Pinyin: zhá, Meaning: to deep fry; Taiwan pr. [zhà], Example: 今天炸鱼吗？, Translation: Are we deep-frying fish today?

Word: 炸弹, Pinyin: zhà dàn, Meaning: bomb, Example: 别碰那个炸弹。, Translation: Don't touch that bomb.

Word: 粘, Pinyin: nián, Meaning: variant of 黏, Example: 这糖很粘。, Translation: This candy is very sticky.

Word: 展开, Pinyin: zhǎn kāi, Meaning: to unfold; to spread out; to open up; to launch; to carry out, Example: 我们展开讨论吧。, Translation: Let's start a discussion.

Word: 展示, Pinyin: zhǎn shì, Meaning: to reveal; to display; to show; to exhibit, Example: 请展示你的作品。, Translation: Please show your work.

Word: 展现, Pinyin: zhǎn xiàn, Meaning: to unfold before one's eyes; to emerge; to reveal; to display, Example: 照片展现了她的笑容。, Translation: The photo shows her smile.

Word: 占, Pinyin: zhàn, Meaning: variant of 占, Example: 这箱子占地方。, Translation: This box takes up space.

Word: 战斗, Pinyin: zhàn dòu, Meaning: to fight; to engage in combat; struggle; battle, Example: 我们一起战斗吧。, Translation: Let's fight together.

Word: 战略, Pinyin: zhàn lu:è, Meaning: strategy, Example: 我们的战略是什么？, Translation: What is our strategy?

Word: 战胜, Pinyin: zhàn shèng, Meaning: to prevail over; to defeat; to surmount, Example: 我们要战胜困难。, Translation: We must overcome difficulties.

Word: 战士, Pinyin: zhàn shì, Meaning: fighter; soldier; warrior, Example: 我想当一名战士。, Translation: I want to be a soldier.

Word: 战争, Pinyin: zhàn zhēng, Meaning: war; conflict, Example: 我们讨厌战争。, Translation: We hate war.

Word: 站, Pinyin: zhàn, Meaning: station; to stand; to halt; to stop; branch of a company or organization; website, Example: 我们在车站见。, Translation: Let's meet at the station.

Word: 张, Pinyin: Zhāng, Meaning: surname Zhang, Example: 我姓张。, Translation: My surname is Zhang.

Word: 章, Pinyin: Zhāng, Meaning: surname Zhang, Example: 我姓章。, Translation: My surname is Zhang.

Word: 长, Pinyin: cháng, Meaning: length; long; forever; always; constantly, Example: 这条路很长。, Translation: This road is very long.

Word: 长大, Pinyin: zhǎng dà, Meaning: to grow up, Example: 我想快点长大。, Translation: I want to grow up soon.

Word: 长期, Pinyin: cháng qī, Meaning: long term; long time; long range (of a forecast), Example: 他长期住在这里。, Translation: He has lived here for a long time.

Word: 掌握, Pinyin: zhǎng wò, Meaning: to grasp (often fig.); to control; to seize (initiative, opportunity, destiny); to master; to know well; to understand sth well and know how to use it; fluency, Example: 他很快掌握了中文。, Translation: He quickly mastered Chinese.

Word: 丈夫, Pinyin: zhàng fu, Meaning: husband, Example: 她丈夫是医生。, Translation: Her husband is a doctor.

Word: 账户, Pinyin: zhàng hù, Meaning: bank account; online account, Example: 我的账户没钱了。, Translation: My account has no money.

Word: 障碍, Pinyin: zhàng ài, Meaning: barrier; obstruction; hindrance; impediment; obstacle, Example: 语言不是障碍。, Translation: Language isn't a barrier.

Word: 招, Pinyin: zhāo, Meaning: to recruit; to provoke; to beckon; to incur; to infect; contagious; a move (chess); a maneuver; device; trick; to confess, Example: 这招真管用。, Translation: This trick really works.

Word: 找, Pinyin: zhǎo, Meaning: to try to find; to look for; to call on sb; to find; to seek; to return; to give change, Example: 我在找钥匙。, Translation: I'm looking for my keys.

Word: 找到, Pinyin: zhǎo dào, Meaning: to find, Example: 我找到钥匙了。, Translation: I found the key.

Word: 照, Pinyin: zhào, Meaning: variant of 照; to shine; to illuminate, Example: 太阳照着我。, Translation: The sun shines on me.

Word: 照顾, Pinyin: zhào gu, Meaning: to take care of; to show consideration; to attend to; to look after, Example: 请照顾好自己。, Translation: Please take good care of yourself.

Word: 照片, Pinyin: zhào piàn, Meaning: photograph; picture, Example: 我喜欢这张照片。, Translation: I like this photo.

Word: 折, Pinyin: shé, Meaning: to snap; to break (a stick, a bone etc); (bound form) to sustain a loss (in business), Example: 树枝折了。, Translation: The branch snapped.

Word: 折磨, Pinyin: zhé mó, Meaning: to torment; to torture, Example: 别折磨自己了。, Translation: Don't torment yourself anymore.

Word: 者, Pinyin: zhě, Meaning: (after a verb or adjective) one who (is) ...; (after a noun) person involved in ...; -er; -ist; (used after a number or 后 or 前 to refer to sth mentioned previously); (used after a term, to mark a pause before defining the term); (old) (used at the end of a command); (old) this, Example: 他是这本书的作者。, Translation: He is the author of this book.

Word: 这, Pinyin: zhè, Meaning: (pronoun) this; these; (bound form) this; the (followed by a noun); (bound form) this; these (followed by a classifier) (in this sense, commonly pr. [zhèi], esp. in Beijing), Example: 这是什么？, Translation: What is this?

Word: 这边, Pinyin: zhè biān, Meaning: this side; here, Example: 我坐这边。, Translation: I'll sit here.

Word: 这儿, Pinyin: zhè r, Meaning: here, Example: 我在这儿等你。, Translation: I am waiting for you here.

Word: 这里, Pinyin: zhè lǐ, Meaning: variant of 这里, Example: 我喜欢这里。, Translation: I like it here.

Word: 这么, Pinyin: zhè me, Meaning: so much; this much; how much?; this way; like this, Example: 今天这么冷！, Translation: It's so cold today!

Word: 这时, Pinyin: zhè shí, Meaning: at this time; at this moment, Example: 这时我饿了。, Translation: At this moment, I'm hungry.

Word: 这些, Pinyin: zhè xiē, Meaning: these, Example: 这些书是我的。, Translation: These books are mine.

Word: 这样, Pinyin: zhè yàng, Meaning: this kind of; so; this way; like this; such, Example: 请这样做。, Translation: Please do it like this.

Word: 着, Pinyin: zhāo, Meaning: (chess) move; trick; all right!; (dialect) to add, Example: 这招真着！, Translation: This trick is great!

Word: 著名, Pinyin: zhù míng, Meaning: famous; noted; well-known; celebrated, Example: 他是著名作家。, Translation: He is a famous writer.

Word: 针, Pinyin: zhēn, Meaning: needle; pin; injection; stitch, Example: 我有一根针。, Translation: I have a needle.

Word: 针对, Pinyin: zhēn duì, Meaning: to target; to focus on; to be aimed at or against; in response to, Example: 针对这个问题，我们有办法。, Translation: Regarding this problem, we have a solution.

Word: 珍惜, Pinyin: zhēn xī, Meaning: to treasure; to value; to cherish, Example: 我们要珍惜时间。, Translation: We should cherish time.

Word: 真, Pinyin: zhēn, Meaning: really; truly; indeed; real; true; genuine, Example: 今天真冷。, Translation: It's really cold today.

Word: 真的, Pinyin: zhēn de, Meaning: really, truly, indeed, Example: 我真的很开心。, Translation: I am really happy.

Word: 真实, Pinyin: zhēn shí, Meaning: true; real, Example: 这是真实的故事。, Translation: This is a true story.

Word: 真相, Pinyin: zhēn xiàng, Meaning: the truth about sth; the actual facts, Example: 请告诉我真相。, Translation: Please tell me the truth.

Word: 真心, Pinyin: zhēn xīn, Meaning: sincere; heartfelt, Example: 我是真心的。, Translation: I mean it.

Word: 真正, Pinyin: zhēn zhèng, Meaning: genuine; real; true; really; indeed, Example: 他是个真正的朋友。, Translation: He is a true friend.

Word: 诊断, Pinyin: zhěn duàn, Meaning: to diagnose, Example: 医生能诊断我的病吗？, Translation: Can the doctor diagnose my illness?

Word: 阵, Pinyin: zhèn, Meaning: disposition of troops; wave; spate; burst; spell; short period of time; classifier for events or states of short duration, Example: 下了一阵雨。, Translation: It rained for a short while.

Word: 镇, Pinyin: zhèn, Meaning: to press down; to calm; to subdue; to suppress; to guard; garrison; small town; to cool or chill (food or drinks), Example: 我住在小镇上。, Translation: I live in a small town.

Word: 震惊, Pinyin: zhèn jīng, Meaning: to shock; to astonish, Example: 消息让我很震惊。, Translation: The news really shocked me.

Word: 争, Pinyin: zhēng, Meaning: to strive for; to vie for; to argue or debate; deficient or lacking (dialect); how or what (literary), Example: 别争了，听我的。, Translation: Stop arguing, listen to me.

Word: 争取, Pinyin: zhēng qǔ, Meaning: to fight for; to strive for; to win over, Example: 我争取早点到。, Translation: I'll try to arrive early.

Word: 整, Pinyin: zhěng, Meaning: exactly; in good order; whole; complete; entire; in order; orderly; to repair; to mend; to renovate; (coll.) to fix sb; to give sb a hard time; to mess with sb, Example: 他吃了整个苹果。, Translation: He ate the whole apple.

Word: 整个, Pinyin: zhěng gè, Meaning: whole; entire; total, Example: 我花了整个下午。, Translation: I spent the whole afternoon.

Word: 整理, Pinyin: zhěng lǐ, Meaning: to arrange; to tidy up; to sort out; to straighten out; to list systematically; to collate (data, files); to pack (luggage), Example: 我要整理房间。, Translation: I need to tidy up my room.

Word: 整天, Pinyin: zhěng tiān, Meaning: all day long; whole day, Example: 他整天玩手机。, Translation: He plays with his phone all day long.

Word: 正, Pinyin: zhēng, Meaning: first month of the lunar year, Example: 我们正月见。, Translation: See you in the first lunar month.

Word: 正常, Pinyin: zhèng cháng, Meaning: regular; normal; ordinary, Example: 一切正常。, Translation: Everything is normal.

Word: 正好, Pinyin: zhèng hǎo, Meaning: just (in time); just right; just enough; to happen to; to chance to; by chance; it just so happens that, Example: 我正好有空。, Translation: I happen to be free.

Word: 正确, Pinyin: zhèng què, Meaning: correct; sound; right; proper, Example: 你的答案正确。, Translation: Your answer is correct.

Word: 正式, Pinyin: zhèng shì, Meaning: formal; official, Example: 明天是正式会议。, Translation: Tomorrow is a formal meeting.

Word: 正是, Pinyin: zhèng shì, Meaning: is precisely, Example: 这正是我想要的。, Translation: This is precisely what I want.

Word: 正在, Pinyin: zhèng zài, Meaning: just at (that time); right in (that place); right in the middle of (doing sth), Example: 我正在吃饭。, Translation: I am eating.

Word: 证, Pinyin: zhèng, Meaning: to admonish; variant of 证, Example: 我有工作证。, Translation: I have my work ID.

Word: 证据, Pinyin: zhèng jù, Meaning: evidence; proof; testimony, Example: 你有证据吗？, Translation: Do you have evidence?

Word: 证明, Pinyin: zhèng míng, Meaning: proof; certificate; identification; testimonial; to prove; to testify; to confirm the truth of, Example: 我需要一份证明。, Translation: I need a certificate.

Word: 证实, Pinyin: zhèng shí, Meaning: to confirm (sth to be true); to verify, Example: 这证实了我的猜测。, Translation: This confirmed my guess.

Word: 政策, Pinyin: zhèng cè, Meaning: policy, Example: 公司有新政策吗？, Translation: Does the company have a new policy?

Word: 政府, Pinyin: zhèng fǔ, Meaning: government, Example: 政府帮了我们。, Translation: The government helped us.

Word: 政治, Pinyin: zhèng zhì, Meaning: politics; political, Example: 我喜欢政治。, Translation: I like politics.

Word: 症状, Pinyin: zhèng zhuàng, Meaning: symptom (of an illness), Example: 你的症状是什么？, Translation: What are your symptoms?

Word: 之, Pinyin: zhī, Meaning: (possessive particle, literary equivalent of 的); him; her; it, Example: 我知其事。, Translation: I know the matter.

Word: 之后, Pinyin: zhī hòu, Meaning: after; behind; (at the beginning of a sentence) afterwards; since then, Example: 下课之后，我回家。, Translation: After class, I go home.

Word: 之间, Pinyin: zhī jiān, Meaning: (after a noun) between; among; amid; (used after certain bisyllabic words to form expressions indicating a short period of time, e.g. 弹指之间), Example: 你我之间没秘密。, Translation: There are no secrets between you and me.

Word: 之类, Pinyin: zhī lèi, Meaning: and so on; and such, Example: 我想买点水果之类吧。, Translation: I want to buy some fruits and such.

Word: 之内, Pinyin: zhī nèi, Meaning: inside; within, Example: 三天之内做完。, Translation: Finish it within three days.

Word: 之前, Pinyin: zhī qián, Meaning: before; prior to; ago; previously; beforehand, Example: 我之前不知道。, Translation: I didn't know before.

Word: 之所以, Pinyin: zhī suǒ yǐ, Meaning: (after a noun N and before a predicate P) the reason why N P; Example: 我之所以讨厌他 "the reason why I dislike him (is ...)", Example: 我之所以迟到，堵车了。, Translation: The reason I was late is the traffic.

Word: 之外, Pinyin: zhī wài, Meaning: outside; excluding, Example: 工作之外我喜欢运动。, Translation: Outside of work, I like sports.

Word: 之下, Pinyin: zhī xià, Meaning: under; beneath; less than, Example: 桌子之下有只猫。, Translation: There is a cat under the table.

Word: 之一, Pinyin: zhī yī, Meaning: one of (sth); one out of a multitude; one (third, quarter, percent etc), Example: 他是我的同学之一。, Translation: He is one of my classmates.

Word: 之中, Pinyin: zhī zhōng, Meaning: inside; among; in the midst of (doing sth); during, Example: 我们之中选一个吧。, Translation: Let's pick one among us.

Word: 支, Pinyin: Zhī, Meaning: surname Zhi, Example: 我姓支。, Translation: My surname is Zhi.

Word: 支持, Pinyin: zhī chí, Meaning: to be in favor of; to support; to back; support; backing; to stand by, Example: 我支持你。, Translation: I support you.

Word: 支付, Pinyin: zhī fù, Meaning: to pay (money), Example: 怎么支付？, Translation: How do I pay?

Word: 汁, Pinyin: zhī, Meaning: juice, Example: 我想喝果汁。, Translation: I want to drink some juice.

Word: 知道, Pinyin: zhī dào, Meaning: to know; to become aware of; also pr. [zhī dao], Example: 我知道答案。, Translation: I know the answer.

Word: 知识, Pinyin: zhī shi, Meaning: knowledge; intellectual, Example: 知识很有用。, Translation: Knowledge is very useful.

Word: 执法, Pinyin: zhí fǎ, Meaning: to enforce a law; law enforcement, Example: 警察正在执法。, Translation: The police are enforcing the law.

Word: 执行, Pinyin: zhí xíng, Meaning: to implement; to carry out; to execute; to run, Example: 我们执行吧。, Translation: Let's carry it out.

Word: 直, Pinyin: Zhí, Meaning: surname Zhi; Zhi (c. 2000 BC), fifth of the legendary Flame Emperors 帝 descended from Shennong 神农 Farmer God, Example: 他说话很直。, Translation: He speaks very directly.

Word: 直播, Pinyin: zhí bō, Meaning: (TV, radio) to broadcast live; live broadcast; (Internet) to livestream; (agriculture) direct seeding, Example: 我喜欢看直播。, Translation: I like watching livestreams.

Word: 直到, Pinyin: zhí dào, Meaning: until, Example: 我工作直到深夜。, Translation: I worked until late night.

Word: 直接, Pinyin: zhí jiē, Meaning: direct (opposite: indirect 间接); immediate; straightforward, Example: 请直接告诉我。, Translation: Please tell me directly.

Word: 值, Pinyin: zhí, Meaning: value; (to be) worth; to happen to; to be on duty, Example: 这书值多少钱？, Translation: How much is this book worth?

Word: 值得, Pinyin: zhí de, Meaning: to be worth; to deserve, Example: 这本书值得看。, Translation: This book is worth reading.

Word: 职业, Pinyin: zhí yè, Meaning: occupation; profession; vocation; professional, Example: 你的职业是什么？, Translation: What is your profession?

Word: 职责, Pinyin: zhí zé, Meaning: duty; responsibility; obligation, Example: 这是我的职责。, Translation: This is my duty.

Word: 植物, Pinyin: zhí wù, Meaning: plant; vegetation, Example: 这盆植物很漂亮。, Translation: This potted plant is very pretty.

Word: 止, Pinyin: zhǐ, Meaning: to stop; to prohibit; until; only, Example: 到此为止。, Translation: Stop here.

Word: 只, Pinyin: zhǐ, Meaning: only; merely; just; but, Example: 我只吃苹果。, Translation: I only eat apples.

Word: 只不过, Pinyin: zhǐ bu guò, Meaning: only; merely; nothing but; no more than; it's just that ..., Example: 他只不过是个新手。, Translation: He is just a beginner.

Word: 只好, Pinyin: zhǐ hǎo, Meaning: to have no other option but to ...; to have to; to be forced to, Example: 雨太大，我只好回家。, Translation: The rain was too heavy, so I had to go home.

Word: 只能, Pinyin: zhǐ néng, Meaning: can only; obliged to do sth; to have no other choice, Example: 我今天只能在家。, Translation: I can only stay home today.

Word: 只是, Pinyin: zhǐ shì, Meaning: merely; only; just; nothing but; simply; but; however, Example: 我只是看看。, Translation: I'm just looking.

Word: 只要, Pinyin: zhǐ yào, Meaning: if only; so long as, Example: 只要你开心就好。, Translation: As long as you're happy, that's fine.

Word: 只有, Pinyin: zhǐ yǒu, Meaning: only have ...; there is only ...; (used in combination with 才) it is only if one ... (that one can ...) (Example: 只有通过治疗才能痊愈 "the only way to cure it is with therapy"); it is only ... (who ...) (Example: 要 "only men would have such a requirement"); (used to indicate that one has no alternative) one can only (do a certain thing) (Example: 服 "the only thing you can do is give in"), Example: 这里只有我一个人。, Translation: There is only me here.

Word: 纸, Pinyin: zhǐ, Meaning: variant of 纸, Example: 请给我一张纸。, Translation: Please give me a piece of paper.

Word: 指, Pinyin: zhǐ, Meaning: finger; to point at or to; to indicate or refer to; to depend on; to count on; (of hair) to stand on end, Example: 我指给你看。, Translation: I'll point it out to you.

Word: 指出, Pinyin: zhǐ chū, Meaning: to indicate; to point out, Example: 老师指出了错误。, Translation: The teacher pointed out the mistake.

Word: 指导, Pinyin: zhǐ dǎo, Meaning: to guide; to give directions; to direct; to coach; guidance; tuition, Example: 谢谢你的指导。, Translation: Thank you for your guidance.

Word: 指挥, Pinyin: zhǐ huī, Meaning: to conduct; to command; to direct; conductor (of an orchestra), Example: 他指挥乐队。, Translation: He conducts the orchestra.

Word: 指示, Pinyin: zhǐ shì, Meaning: to point out; to indicate; to instruct; directives; instructions, Example: 按指示做就行。, Translation: Just follow the instructions.

Word: 至, Pinyin: zhì, Meaning: to arrive; most; to; until, Example: 我们至少五个。, Translation: We have at least five.

Word: 至今, Pinyin: zhì jīn, Meaning: so far; to this day; until now, Example: 他至今没回信。, Translation: He still hasn't replied.

Word: 至少, Pinyin: zhì shǎo, Meaning: at least; (to say the) least, Example: 至少吃一个吧。, Translation: At least eat one.

Word: 至于, Pinyin: zhì yú, Meaning: as for; as to; to go so far as to, Example: 至于明天，再说吧。, Translation: As for tomorrow, we'll see.

Word: 制, Pinyin: zhì, Meaning: system; to control; to regulate; variant of 制, Example: 制度很好。, Translation: The system is good.

Word: 制定, Pinyin: zhì dìng, Meaning: to draw up; to formulate, Example: 我们制定计划吧。, Translation: Let's make a plan.

Word: 制度, Pinyin: zhì dù, Meaning: system (e.g. political, adminstrative etc); institution, Example: 这个制度很好。, Translation: This system is very good.

Word: 制造, Pinyin: zhì zào, Meaning: to manufacture; to make, Example: 工厂制造手机。, Translation: The factory makes phones.

Word: 制作, Pinyin: zhì zuò, Meaning: to make; to manufacture, Example: 我喜欢制作蛋糕。, Translation: I like making cakes.

Word: 治, Pinyin: zhì, Meaning: to rule; to govern; to manage; to control; to harness (a river); to treat (a disease); to wipe out (a pest); to punish; to research, Example: 他治好了感冒。, Translation: He cured the cold.

Word: 治安, Pinyin: zhì ān, Meaning: law and order; public security, Example: 这里治安很好。, Translation: Public security here is very good.

Word: 治疗, Pinyin: zhì liáo, Meaning: to treat (an illness); medical treatment; therapy, Example: 这病能治疗吗？, Translation: Can this illness be treated?

Word: 质量, Pinyin: zhì liàng, Meaning: quality; (physics) mass, Example: 这衣服质量很好。, Translation: The quality of these clothes is very good.

Word: 致, Pinyin: zhì, Meaning: (bound form) fine; delicate; exquisite, Example: 这礼物真精致。, Translation: This gift is really exquisite.

Word: 智慧, Pinyin: zhì huì, Meaning: wisdom; knowledge; intelligent; intelligence, Example: 他很有智慧。, Translation: He is very wise.

Word: 置, Pinyin: zhì, Meaning: to install; to place; to put; to buy, Example: 我们购置了新沙发。, Translation: We bought a new sofa.

Word: 中, Pinyin: Zhōng, Meaning: China; Chinese; surname Zhong, Example: 我在中国。, Translation: I am in China.

Word: 中国, Pinyin: Zhōng guó, Meaning: China, Example: 我喜欢中国。, Translation: I like China.

Word: 中间, Pinyin: zhōng jiān, Meaning: the middle; the inside; in the middle; within; between; among; during; in the meantime, Example: 他在中间坐着。, Translation: He sits in the middle.

Word: 中午, Pinyin: zhōng wǔ, Meaning: noon; midday, Example: 我们中午吃饭。, Translation: We eat lunch at noon.

Word: 中心, Pinyin: zhōng xīn, Meaning: center; heart; core, Example: 市中心很热闹。, Translation: The city center is very lively.

Word: 中央, Pinyin: zhōng yāng, Meaning: central; middle; center; central authorities (of a state), Example: 我们在中央等你。, Translation: We are waiting for you in the center.

Word: 终于, Pinyin: zhōng yú, Meaning: at last; in the end; finally; eventually, Example: 我终于到家了。, Translation: I'm finally home.

Word: 钟, Pinyin: Zhōng, Meaning: surname Zhong, Example: 我姓钟。, Translation: My surname is Zhong.

Word: 肿瘤, Pinyin: zhǒng liú, Meaning: tumor, Example: 他得了肿瘤。, Translation: He has a tumor.

Word: 种, Pinyin: zhǒng, Meaning: seed; species; kind; type; classifier for types, kinds, sorts, Example: 这是哪种水果？, Translation: What kind of fruit is this?

Word: 重, Pinyin: chóng, Meaning: to repeat; repetition; again; re-; classifier: layer, Example: 我们重来一次。, Translation: Let's start over.

Word: 重大, Pinyin: zhòng dà, Meaning: great; important; major; significant, Example: 这是重大决定。, Translation: This is a major decision.

Word: 重点, Pinyin: chóng diǎn, Meaning: to recount (e.g. results of election); to re-evaluate, Example: 我们重点讨论。, Translation: We focus on the key points.

Word: 重复, Pinyin: chóng fù, Meaning: to repeat; to duplicate, Example: 请重复一下。, Translation: Please repeat it.

Word: 重视, Pinyin: zhòng shì, Meaning: to attach importance to sth; to value, Example: 我们要重视健康。, Translation: We should value our health.

Word: 重新, Pinyin: chóng xīn, Meaning: again; once more; re-, Example: 请重新说一遍。, Translation: Please say it again.

Word: 重要, Pinyin: zhòng yào, Meaning: important; significant; major, Example: 这件事很重要。, Translation: This is very important.

Word: 州, Pinyin: zhōu, Meaning: prefecture; (old) province; (old) administrative division; state (e.g. of US); oblast (Russia); canton (Switzerland), Example: 美国有五十个州。, Translation: The US has fifty states.

Word: 周, Pinyin: Zhōu, Meaning: surname Zhou; Zhou Dynasty (1046-256 BC), Example: 我姓周。, Translation: My surname is Zhou.

Word: 周末, Pinyin: zhōu mò, Meaning: weekend, Example: 你周末忙吗？, Translation: Are you busy on the weekend?

Word: 周年, Pinyin: zhōu nián, Meaning: anniversary; annual, Example: 明天是一周年。, Translation: Tomorrow is our first anniversary.

Word: 周围, Pinyin: zhōu wéi, Meaning: environs; surroundings; periphery, Example: 周围很安静。, Translation: It's quiet around here.

Word: 猪, Pinyin: zhū, Meaning: hog; pig; swine, Example: 我养了一只猪。, Translation: I raised a pig.

Word: 逐渐, Pinyin: zhú jiàn, Meaning: gradually, Example: 天气逐渐变冷。, Translation: The weather is gradually getting colder.

Word: 主, Pinyin: zhǔ, Meaning: owner; master; host; individual or party concerned; God; Lord; main; to indicate or signify; trump card (in card games), Example: 今天谁做主？, Translation: Who's in charge today?

Word: 主持, Pinyin: zhǔ chí, Meaning: to take charge of; to manage or direct; to preside over; to uphold; to stand for (justice etc); to host (a TV or radio program etc); (TV) anchor, Example: 他主持节目。, Translation: He hosts the program.

Word: 主持人, Pinyin: zhǔ chí rén, Meaning: TV or radio presenter; host; anchor, Example: 谁是今晚的主持人？, Translation: Who is the host tonight?

Word: 主动, Pinyin: zhǔ dòng, Meaning: to take the initiative; to do sth of one's own accord; spontaneous; active; opposite: passive 被动; drive (of gears and shafts etc), Example: 他主动帮我。, Translation: He took the initiative to help me.

Word: 主管, Pinyin: zhǔ guǎn, Meaning: in charge; responsible for; person in charge; manager, Example: 他是主管。, Translation: He is the manager.

Word: 主角, Pinyin: zhǔ jué, Meaning: leading role; lead; protagonist, Example: 他是电影的主角。, Translation: He is the protagonist of the movie.

Word: 主人, Pinyin: zhǔ rén, Meaning: master; host; owner, Example: 狗的主人在哪？, Translation: Where is the dog's owner?

Word: 主任, Pinyin: zhǔ rèn, Meaning: director; head, Example: 他是我们的主任。, Translation: He is our director.

Word: 主题, Pinyin: zhǔ tí, Meaning: theme; subject, Example: 你的主题是什么？, Translation: What is your theme?

Word: 主席, Pinyin: zhǔ xí, Meaning: chairperson; premier; chairman, Example: 王主席来了吗？, Translation: Is Chairman Wang here?

Word: 主要, Pinyin: zhǔ yào, Meaning: main; principal; major; primary, Example: 主要问题是钱。, Translation: The main problem is money.

Word: 主义, Pinyin: zhǔ yì, Meaning: -ism; ideology, Example: 他信什么主义？, Translation: What ideology does he believe in?

Word: 主意, Pinyin: zhǔ yi, Meaning: plan; idea; decision; Beijing pr. [zhú yi], Example: 你有好主意吗？, Translation: Do you have a good idea?

Word: 煮, Pinyin: zhǔ, Meaning: variant of 煮, Example: 我煮面吃。, Translation: I cook noodles to eat.

Word: 住, Pinyin: zhù, Meaning: to live; to dwell; to stay; to reside; to stop; (suffix indicating firmness, steadiness, or coming to a halt), Example: 我住在北京。, Translation: I live in Beijing.

Word: 助理, Pinyin: zhù lǐ, Meaning: assistant, Example: 他是我的助理。, Translation: He is my assistant.

Word: 注, Pinyin: zhù, Meaning: to inject; to pour into; to concentrate; to pay attention; stake (gambling); classifier for sums of money; variant of 注, Example: 请多注意。, Translation: Please pay attention.

Word: 注册, Pinyin: zhù cè, Meaning: to register; to enroll, Example: 我要注册账号。, Translation: I want to register an account.

Word: 注定, Pinyin: zhù dìng, Meaning: to foreordain; to be bound to; to be destined to; to be doomed to; inevitably, Example: 我们注定在一起。, Translation: We are destined to be together.

Word: 注射, Pinyin: zhù shè, Meaning: injection; to inject, Example: 我要注射。, Translation: I want to get an injection.

Word: 注意, Pinyin: zhù yì, Meaning: to take note of; to pay attention to, Example: 请大家注意。, Translation: Everyone, please pay attention.

Word: 祝, Pinyin: Zhù, Meaning: surname Zhu, Example: 我叫祝明。, Translation: My name is Zhu Ming.

Word: 祝福, Pinyin: zhù fú, Meaning: blessings; to wish sb well, Example: 我送你一份祝福。, Translation: I'm sending you a blessing.

Word: 祝贺, Pinyin: zhù hè, Meaning: to congratulate; congratulations, Example: 祝贺你获奖。, Translation: Congratulations on your win.

Word: 抓, Pinyin: zhuā, Meaning: to grab; to catch; to arrest; to snatch; to scratch, Example: 别抓我！, Translation: Don't grab me!

Word: 抓紧, Pinyin: zhuā jǐn, Meaning: to keep a firm grip on; to pay close attention to; to lose no time in (doing sth), Example: 抓紧复习吧。, Translation: Hurry up and review.

Word: 抓住, Pinyin: zhuā zhù, Meaning: to grab hold of; to capture, Example: 快抓住我的手。, Translation: Grab my hand quickly.

Word: 专辑, Pinyin: zhuān jí, Meaning: album; record (music); special collection of printed or broadcast material, Example: 我买了新专辑。, Translation: I bought a new album.

Word: 专家, Pinyin: zhuān jiā, Meaning: expert; specialist, Example: 他是个专家。, Translation: He is an expert.

Word: 专门, Pinyin: zhuān mén, Meaning: specialist; specialized; customized, Example: 我专门为你做的。, Translation: I made this specifically for you.

Word: 专业, Pinyin: zhuān yè, Meaning: specialty; specialized field; main field of study (at university); major; professional, Example: 你的专业是什么？, Translation: What is your major?

Word: 转, Pinyin: zhuǎi, Meaning: see 转文, Example: 别转文了。, Translation: Stop using fancy words.

Word: 转变, Pinyin: zhuǎn biàn, Meaning: to change; to transform; shift; transformation, Example: 他的态度转变了。, Translation: His attitude changed.

